<p. 1>

brahmayāmale mātṛṇāmutsavam |

hariḥ oṃ |

mātṛṇāmutsavaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu brahmanyathākramam |
purā kṛtayugasyādau devāśca siramaisvaraiḥ ||

devaiśca rodhanaṃ kṛtvā dārukena mahānṛpa |
devāssañcintitassarve dārukāhvaya kāraṇam ||

dārukassa vayasmṛtya vayau vātha kathaṃ harim |
tacchrutvā hariḥ proktaḥ striyaṃ sṛṣṭiti tadvada ||

evaṃ śrutvā tu deve hyaikaikaṃ sṛṣṭivat striyam |
brahmāṇi brahmasaṃbhūtā māheśvarī maheśvarāt ||

kaumārīskandasaṃbhūtā vaiṣṇaī viṣṇusaṃbūtā |
vārāhī yamasaṃbhūtā indrāṇi indrasaṃbhavā ||

eteṣāṃ mātaro deva yuddhaṃ vai dārukena tu |
mātṝṇāṃ durbalaṃ gachet prabalena mahāsuraḥ ||

mātṝṇāṃ saṃbhūyanodbhūtā ekavīraparātparā |
paramekāṃśamevantu parameśvaralocane ||

jayate bhadrakālī tu dārukāvadhakāriṇīm |
dārukaṃ hṛdayaṃ bhitvā rudhiraṃ māṃsacarcitam ||

āpūrṇāyāhṛdaṃ sarvaṃ hariṣṇyāṇītyupakramam |
tacchrutvā īśvaro devī nṛttaṃ kṛtvā tu śāmyati ||

<p. 2>

śāntyantu sarva devebhyo cāmuṇḍaparameśvari |
tāsāṃ vai mūrtibhedantu śṛṇu brahma yuge yuge ||

kṛtayuge koṭimūrti mūrtayaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
prakarālya titīkṣṇākṣī vidyujjihvā vijṛṃbhiṇī ||

kṣobhiṇī mohinī caiva tathā yonimukhī bhavet |
adhomukhī ca vikhyātā tathā raudramukhī bhavet ||

kṛṣṇā caiva tu kṛṣṇākṣī tathā ca śyāmalā bhavet |
tryambakī gomukhī caiva snehākhyā ca tathā parā ||

bhaganonmukhī vikhyātā mūrtayaṣṣoḍaśasmṛtā |
etāśca mūrtayo jñeyā mātṛkāśca prakīrtitā ||

kṛṣṇākṛṣṇatarā jñeyā śvetāśvetatarā bhavet |
raktāraktatarā jñeyā pītāpītatarā bhavet ||

vikhyātā mūrtayo jñeyā mūrtayasyuḥ prakīrtitā |
bhadrakāli tu cāmuṇḍī sadā vijayavarddhinī ||

nāśaimastu śirodbhutā kaliyuge prakīrtitā |
etairmūrtayo jñeyā sadā śāntikaro bhavet ||

tasyāssarva prayatnena caturmūrtiḥ prapūjayet |
daśaśāntikaraścaiva nṛpāṇāṃ vijayaṃ bhavet ||

sarvapāpaharaṃ śāntaṃ sadā vijaya saṃbhavam |
caturbhūti vidhānena mātṛpūjāśca kārayet ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ mātrotsavo nāma prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 1 
||
<p. 3>

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi devyādeśavidhiṃ param |
grāme ca nagare caiva pattane kheṭakepi ca ||

tīrthasthāne'tha saumye vā samudre parvatapārśvayoḥ |
parvate ca vane caiva nadīnāṃ rājadhānike ||

indrāyāṃ vijayaṃ caiva āgneyegnibhayaṃ bhavet |
dakṣiṇe cāpamṛtyuśca nairṛtyāṃ vyādhipīḍitam ||

vāruṇyāṃ varṣanāśantu vāyavyāṃ rogamāviśet |
saumyāyāṃ sarvasaṃsiddhiraiśānyāmaṣṭasiddhidam ||

uttaradvārato bāhye somasūtrasya pūrvataḥ |
śatadaṇḍāntaraṃ kṛtvā sarvasiddhikaraṃ param ||

pūrvadvāre tu vijayamāgneye maraṇaṃ bhavet |
yamadvāre tu kalahaṃ nair(-)ṛte nāśamāviśet ||

paścime sarvasiddhissyāt vāyavye ripunāśanam |
uttaradvārameteṣāmaiśvaryamuttarottaram ||

īśadvāre tu rakṣārthametat dvāraṃ vidhīyate |
brāhmaṇakṣatriyo vaiśyaśūdraścaiva caturvidham ||

brāhmaṇān pāpanāśārthaṃ kṣatriyo vijayaṃ bhavet |
vaiśyānāndhanamāpnoti śūdrāṇāṃ sukhamāpnuyāt ||

yāvat prāsādavistāraṃ tāvat kuryāt parigraham |
karṣaṇaṃ kārayet tatra bījāṃkuramanirdiśet ||

<p. 4>

khananaṃ puruṣamātreṇa udarāntamathāpi vā |
pāṃsunā pūrayet tatra udakaṃ pūrayet purā ||

hastipādaghanaṃ sādhyamācārya śilpibhissaha |
caitreṣu viṣuvaṃ kuryāt prācīṃ grahaṇamādiśet ||

udīcīṃ tatra saṃgrāhya hrāmayeccaturaśrakam |
evaṃ parigrahā bhūmiraṣṭasiddhikaraṃ mahat ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ bhūparigraho nāma dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 2 
||

pratimālakṣaṇaṃ |

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi pratimā ṣaḍvidhā parā |
śailajā lohajā caiva ratnajā maṇinā śubhā ||

athavā dārujā caiva mṛṇamayaṃ ca manoharam |
dvārotsedhasamāyuktaṃ pādotsedhaṃ tathaiva ca ||

garbhasyāṇḍasya pratimaṃ kanyasaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ |
pañcabhāgavibhakte tu tribhāgaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet ||

tridhāgarbhasamaṃ kṛtvā dvibhāgaṃ cottamaṃ bhavet |
evaṃ gabhānur pañcapratimañca prakīrtitā ||

navārdhaṃ tālamānena pratimāṃ kuryāt sa lakṣaṇaṃ |
eteṣu caiva cāyāmaṃ saṃgṛhyantu vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

<p. 5>

tadāyāmaṃ tridhā caiva bhāge pratimaṃ bhavet |
bhāgaikantu bhavet pīṭhaṃ tadardhena tu nirṇaye ||

evaṃ sukhāsanaṃ proktaṃ sthitairanyairanukramām |
sukhāsanasya bhavet pīṭha caturaśrāyataṃ bhavet ||

caturaśraṃ tathā kṛtvā tattadbhāgantu vinyaset |
ubhayoḥ pārśvayoścaiva āyatāśraṃ prakīrtitam ||

evaṃ sukhāsanaṃ proktaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
śiraḥ pañcāṃgulañcaiva mukhayāmaṃ tribhāgatā ||

caturaṃgulaṃ bhaved grīvā hṛdayaṃ mukhamucyate |
hṛdayaṃ nābhideśe tu mukhaṃ tatraiva cocyate ||

pañcāṃgulamupasthaṃ syāt ūruśca dvimukhaṃ bhavet |
jaṃghe corusamaṃ proktaṃ bhāgajño ekapādakam ||

vakṣo  daṇḍasya vistāramaṃgulyā pañcaviṃśakam |
kaṭidaṇḍatriṃśadīrghaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulamucyate ||

āyāmaṃ bāhudaṇḍābhyāṃ caturviṃśāṃgulaṃ bhavet |
āyāmamupabāhuśca ṣoḍaśāṃgulamucyate ||

maṇibandhe kalāyāmaṃ mukhaṃ karatalaṃ bhavet |
caturdaśāṃgulāyāmaṃ pādayorubhayorbhavet ||

yasya keśa pramāṇantu dvādaśaṃ vibhajed budhaḥ |
caturbhāgaṃ madhyamantu śūlaṃ ṣaḍbhāgamuttamam ||

<p. 6>

bhavet kaṭaśalkimantvibhāge vidhīyate |
tasmānyathārthamityuktaṃ vaktro varṇantu mīyate ||

śūlamasti sitārajju kṛtā māsapaṭaṃ tathā |
kṛtetu śvetavarṇañca tretāyāṃ raktameva ca ||

dvāpare pītavarṇantu śyāmaṃ kaliyuge bhavet |
pauṣṭikaṃ sitavarṇābhaṃ raktañcaivābhivṛddhidam ||

pītaṃ vaśīkaraṃ kṛtvā śyāmaṃ śāntyarthamucyate |
nārīṇāmuttamā devī tasmānmānamidaṃ param ||

jānurajjugatāśreṣṭhaṃ śvetapadmoparisthitam |
caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca śiro mālā vibhūṣitā ||

nānābharaṇasaṃyuktā śiro mālāvalīḍhakā |
triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇe haste kapālaṃ vāmahastake ||

varadābhayadañcaiva karau dakṣiṇa vāmakau |
evaṃ vidhi mahāvīraṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam ||

divyavastropavītañca divyacandana lepanam |
raktanetraṃ viśālākṣaṃ raktakeśaṃ manoramam ||

rakteṣu raktajihvā ca raktamālopaśobhitam |
khaḍgaṃ khaṭvāṃgaśūlantu paraśun dakṣiṇe dadhat ||

kapālaṃ caiva ghaṇṭāñca dalapallava hastakam |
vāme tu kaṭakaṃ dadyāt pādenākramya dārukān ||

<p. 7>

triṇetraṃ varadaṃ ramyaṃ ekavīraṃ prakīrtitam |
dṛṣṭidvayañca śāntissyāllalāṭa prabhayānvitam ||

dārukasya vadhodbhūtā lalāṭotsṛṣṭikīrtitā |
evaṃ vidhiprakartavyaṃ ekavīrī manoharā ||

raktākṣī vinyaset prācyāṃ karālīṃ dakṣiṇe nyaset |
caṇḍākṣī paścime nyasya mahocchiṣṭottaraṃ nyaset ||

ambikā caṇḍikā caiva ghorī ghoreśvarī tathā |
koṇeṣu vinyaset kṛtvā śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

yoginī pītavarṇābhā vilāsī kapilā bhavet |
etā vai dvāradeśe tu dvārapālaṃ nyaset kramāt ||

yoginī dakṣiṇā jñeyā vilāsī cottarā bhavet |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ pratimālakṣaṇavidhirnāma tṛtīyaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 3 ||

diṅnirṇayam |

diṅnirṇayaṃ pravakṣyāmi kṣetrapālasya saṃhṛtam |
aindreśānayormadhye kṣetrapālālayaṃ bhavet ||

pīṭhaṃ vā tatra kartavyaṃ yathāvidhi purassaram |
svarṇantatra khanitvā tu vidhi dṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

cottamaṃ cāṣṭahastaṃ syāt caturhastena madhyamam |
kanyasañca tadardhaṃ syāt trividhaṃ tatprakīrtitam ||

<p. 8>

yatheṣṭakaṃ samāśṛtya balipīṭhaṃ prakalpayet |
pūrvamagraṃ prakartavyaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam ||

pīṭhārtha khananaṃ kuryāt yathā vistārarūpakam |
pañcaratnaṃ kṣipet tatra tvadho caiva vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

navakṣaraṃ kṣipet tatra mantrajño deśikottamaḥ |
pañcaikānanyatastasya navārṇena yathākramam ||

evaṃ nyastvā tu vidhivat balipīṭhaṃ samārabhet |
vistārasya samaṃ proktaṃ cotsedhañca sa lakṣaṇaṃ ||

utsedhañca tridhā kṛtvā samabhāgaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
prathamaṃ caturaśraṃ tu lakṣaṇena samanvitam ||

prathamaṃ caturaśrañca kārayettatra vittamaḥ |
aśrantu pañcadhā kṛtvā tadbhāgaika tridhā bhavet ||

tadbhāgaika vihīnaṃ syāt vṛttaśrañca prakīrtitam |
caturaśra samaṃ kṛtvā vṛttordhve caturaśrakam ||

padmaṃ tatra prakartavyaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
tatri bhāgaika bhāgantu padmaṃ kuryāt sa lakṣaṇaṃ ||

utsedhantāvadevoktamaṣṭapatraṃ sa karṇikam |
evaṃ kṛtvā samāsena pīṭhañcaiva manoharam ||

śiva prītikaraṃ vāpi kṣetrapālaṃ sa lakṣaṇaṃ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ kṣetrapālalakṣaṇaṃ nāma caturthaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 4 ||
<p. 9>

aṃkurārpaṇaṃ |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi makhilasyāṅkurārpaṇam |
prokṣaṇe ca pratiṣṭhāyāmutsave snapanepi vā ||

dīkṣāyāmālayāraṃbhe bālasthāne tathaiva ca |
pātraṃ caturvidhaṃ proktamvaṅgalāṅkurakarmaṇi ||

śaṃkhaṃ śarāvaghaṭikā pālikāsu caturvidhā |
sauvarṇaṃ rajataṃ tāmraṃ kāṃsyaṃ vai mṛṇmayañca vā ||

pratyekaṃ dvādaśagrahya sarvayogeṣu kīrtitam |
śaṃkhākārantu śaṃkhasya vartulañcāṣṭamaṃgulam ||

tadardhañcaiva vistāraṃ mūlantasya pramāṇataḥ |
agre padmadalākāramaṣṭapatrasamanvitam ||

tatpadme śaṃkharūpaṃ syāt śaṃkhākāraṃ tamucyate |
ṣoḍāśāṃgulamāyāmaṃ tryaṃśamāyāmameva ca ||

kīṭakoṭi samākāraṃ mukhantasya prakīrtitam |
āpastryaṅgulañcaiva udarañca daśāṃgulam ||

gokarṇarūpaṃ tatpucchamevaṃ śaṃkhasya lakṣaṇaṃ |
aṣṭādaśāṅgulotsedhaṃ śarāvaṃ bhinnavarjitam ||

dvitālantu bhaved vaktraṃ kṛṣṇamaṇḍalavarjitam |
aṣṭādaśāṃgulāyāmaṃ ghaṭikā pañcatrikam ||

ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ bhavet pādaṃ tanmadhye caturaṃgulam |
kuṃbhañcāṣṭāṃgulaṃ nāhaṃ vaktrāssyuścaturaṃgulam ||

<p. 10>

pālikāratnimātrantu nālantasya prakīrtitam |
ṣoḍaśāṃgula vistāraṃ tadvaktrañca (****) ||

(************) vidyāttatpīṭhaṃ ratnameva ca |
tadarthaṃ kaṇṭhavistāraṃ tadarthaṃ bilamucyate ||

(************) ktaḥ svarṇādīnāntu kāmataḥ |
maṇṭapassavidhiṃ vakṣye maṃgalāṃkurakarmaṇi ||

daśahastapravistāraṃ viprasya tu vapurbudhaḥ |
kṣatrasya navahastaṃ ca aṣṭahastaṃ tu vaiśyakaḥ ||

saptahastantu śūdrāṇāṃ tārāyāmaṃ prakīrtitam |
ṣaṭtriṃśat ṣoḍaśastaṃbhaṃ dvādaśastaṃbhameva ca ||

aṣṭahastaṃ kramātproktaṃ tathā vistārarūpakam |
caturaśrasamaṃ kṛtvā darpaṇodarasannibham ||

maṇṭapañco bhayoḥ paścāt yathāvidhi purassaram |
caturbhistoraṇairyuktaṃ aṣṭadik dhvaja śobhitam ||

catudvārasamāyuktaṃ maṇṭapaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam |
vaṭodumbaramaśvatthaṃ lakṣaṃ vṛkṣādibhiḥ kramāt ||

toraṇaṃ kārayet taiśca yathāvidhi purassaram |
pañcahastāyataṃ proktaṃ vistāraṃ tadvihastakam ||

ūrdhvaṃ śūlā kṛtiṃ kuryāt hastaṃ bhūmi niveśayet |
śvetaṃ raktaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ dhūmrañca vāruṇaṃ tathā ||

<p. 11>

śyāmantu kapilaṃ pītaṃ dhvajānāṃ pūrvato nyaset |
vitāne cordhvamāścarya kaṇṭhacāmarabhūṣitam ||

dukūlapaṭṭakārpāsa vastraiśślakṣṇaistataḥ kramāt |
staṃbhānāveṣṭya paścāt tu pallavairapyalaṃkṛte ||

dhūpadīpasugandhaiśca pūjayen maṇṭapaṃ śubham |
evaṃ kṛtvā tu pūrvantu tataścāṃkuramārabhet ||

gomayena samālipya tanmūlāni prakalpayet |
śālibhistu daśadroṇai tadardhakairvā tadardhakaiḥ ||

droṇārdhañcādhamañcaitattadardhaṃ taṇḍulorapi |
vikireyāttaṇḍulaiśśardhai dakṣiṇetonye ||

śāhastaṃ vā trihastaṃ vā vistārahastamathārhikam |
caturaśrāṇi na yathākrama (****) kārayet ||

āsanaṃ kalpayitvā tu padmākāraṃ vicakṣaṇaṃ |
gandhapuṣpaśca saṃpūjya yathāvidhi purassaram ||

raktā karālī caṇḍākṣī mahocchiṣṭādi devikā |
śaṃkhādi vinyaset paścāt kośakṛt pāṃsupūrayet ||

āmrapallavasañcchannaṃ gandhādyairarcayecchubhān |
bījāni pūrayet paścāt yavapūrvādini kramāt ||

yavamāṣa kulasthāni cambavaiṇavakāni ca |
śālī priyaṃgurapāmārgaṃ śyākāniṣpāvakāni ca ||

<p. 12>

tilasarṣapamudgāni bījāni ca trayodaśa |
yathā lābhaṃ gṛhītvā tu deśakālānurūpataḥ ||

vāriṇā kṣālayitvā tu gokṣīreṇāpi vai kramāt |
tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet tatra sarveṣāṃ mātṛvoginām ||

ācāryassaviśeṣeṇa tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet tataḥ |
ācārya śśuddha bhūtātmā śuddhagandhānulepanam ||

navavastraparīdhānaṃ coṣṇīṣañcottarīyakam |
sāṃgulīyakapāṇistu sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ ||

ati dīrghā vāmakubjo cakṣuhīnā visarjakāḥ |
badhirāḥ kukṣirogāśca lājapāta visarjayet ||

vikaṭañcāṃgahīnañca śipiviṣṭā visarjayet |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ sarvāṃgaṃ sarvaśobhanam ||

mātṛ gāyatri mantreṇa brahmayāmala pāṭhakān |
sarvatantra kriyāyuktaṃ (************) ||

(************) gaṃ mamadhu vacanam |
guruśiṣyaṃstathaiva ca (****) nindā (**) ||

nindā (************) kulanindā visarjayet |
etairvā vāpayedbījaṃ navākṣareṇa mantravit ||

brahmaghoṣaiśca vividhai svastivācakamaṃgalaiḥ |
śaṃkha duṇṭhābhinirghoṣairgītavādyādi nisvanaiḥ ||

<p. 13>

etairvā vācayed bījaṃ navākṣareṇa mantravit |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa bījānāṃ vāpayedguruḥ ||

mātramantrābhi japtena vāruṇañcaiva secayet |
sadaśaiścādayed vastraissusūkṣmaiśca pṛthak pṛthak ||

rātriṃ tu mātṛgāyatrīṃ maṃgalāṃgura rakṣaṇaiḥ |
lakṣaṇe cocyate tasminnācārya mantravigrahaḥ ||

payodhi (*) kṣaṇa sevyāha vistāsāṃ pradāpayet |
pāvakā devatā pañca havistāsāṃ pradāpayet ||

evaṃ kṛtvā pratidinaṃ evaṃ puṣpādibhiryajet |
aṃkurārpaṇaṃ vakṣyāmi varṇabhedānanekaśaḥ ||

śvetāni rajatābhāni kuñjarābhāni tāni ca |
haridra hāni tānyeva komalāni śubhāni ca ||

śvetābhaṃ sarvakāmārthaṃ rajatābhaṃ vivarddhidam |
kuñjarābhaṃ tu (**) dhanaṃ chrītaṃ komalaṃ bhavet ||

svarṇābhaṃ svarṇa vṛddhiḥ syāt haridrāpuṣṭivardhanam |
mṛddhani putrapautriṃ syāt jīrṇatāṃ prakīrtitam ||

kṛṣe dhūma mṛtunāśaṃsyājaṃjāniha vardhanam |
tathā tiryaggataṃ caiva vasu palaṃ palam ||

kṛṣṇābhoccāṭanañcaiva dhūmrābhaṃ kalahaṃ bhavet |
nīlābhamambu nāśaṃ syāt apamṛtyurbhaviṣyati ||

<p. 14>

adhogataṃ cekalābhaṃ tiryagaṃ caiva rogadam |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena anābhāni vivarjayet ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa paśumekantu ghātayet |
prāyaścitta viśudhyarthaṃ homaṃ tatra vidhi kramāt ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa aṣṭottaraśataṃ (**) |
(**) eka dhāravaktra hiraṇyañca pālikānantu pūjanam ||

aṃkūrārpaṇa kāle tu bījāni ca sañcayam |
tatsarvaṃ dāpayed brahman ācāryantu tāni vai ||

pūrvokta maṇṭape ramye guptena nikṣipet tataḥ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ aṃkurārpaṇa pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 5 ||


sthāpanam |

devatāsthāpanaṃ vakṣye yathāvadanupūrvaśaḥ |
grāme ca narake caiva pattane kheṭakepi vā ||

āyurārogyadaścaiva dhanadhānya vivardhanam |
putrapautra pravṛddhiśca subhikṣaṃ tāsu vardhanam ||

grāmamadhye navapaṭaṃ brahma(ṇa)sthānamuttamam |
indrāyamaśvinosthāna śriyāvāsthānameva ca ||

indrāgneyayormadhye vadhaṃ sthānamuttamam |
sarasvatyāśca cāgneyaṃ kāmasthānantu kalpayet ||

āgneya yamayormadhye pitarasthānamuttamam |
sāvitraṃ sthāpayed yāmye yātudhānañca kalpayet ||

<p. 15>

yāmya nair(-)ṛtayormadhye gaṇapatisthānamucyate |
nair(-)ṛtyāmāsurasthānaṃ nava devān varānane ||

nair(-)ṛtyāṃ vāruṇe madhye nāgasthānaṃ vidhīyate |
vāruṇyāṃ sthāpayed viṣṇū lakṣmīsthānantu kalpayet ||

nabhasvadvaruṇayormadhye garuḍasthānamucyate |
vāyavye kalpayeddomaṃ gandharva sthāna mucyate ||

soma mārutayormadhye sthāna muktaṃ prajāpateḥ |
vitteśaṃ sthāpayet saumye mārtāṇḍañca prakalpayet ||

soma śaṃkarayormadhye rudraścaikādaśassudhīḥ |
īśānaṃ śaṃkarasthānaṃ śivagaurī samanvitam ||

īśānacakrayormadhye dvādaśādityamucyate |
catuṣṭayamṛgādikṣu durgāsthānaṃ vidhīyate ||

grāmamadhyeṣu karṇikāṃ brahmasthānaṃ vidhīyate |
mātṝnvai pūjayet tatra gandhapuṣpaistu pūjitam ||

kalaśaṃ navakaṃ grāhyaṃ sāpidhānaṃ sakūrcakam |
savastraṃ navavastraṃ vā navārṇe naiva mantritam ||

subrāhmī māheśvarī caiva kumāri vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī caiva māhendrī bhadrakāli tathaiva ca ||

agnibījaiśca īśānaiḥ pūrvamārabhya vinyaset |
devīśīmarcayet tatra pūjayed vidhinā saha ||

<p. 16>

vidyāhṛdayamantreṇa ācāryo homayet kramāt |
