grāmasyottaradigbhāge jyeṣṭhā sthānaṃ vidhīyate ||

jyeṣṭhāyāmuttare dikṣu koṭṭavisthānamucyate |
grāma bāhye tu kartavyaṃ koṭṭavyāśramuttamam ||

jyeṣṭhāvasavayormadhye mātṛsthānaṃ vidhīyate |
grāme vā nagare vāpi patanam vāpi kārayet ||

vāruṇyāṃ sthāpayed viṣṇumaiśānyāṃ śaṃkare bhavet |
anyathā tvirayedyastu vyādhiśokabhayaṃ bhavet ||

durbhikṣaṃ kalahaṃ ghoraṃ sarvahāniṃ tu nirdiśet |
marmamadhve na kartavyaṃ rajjuvedhañca varjayet ||

vidhivedhaṃ bhavennyastvāraṇantu vinirdiśet |
triśūle śūladaṃ proktaṃ ṣaṭkakā tu kṣayamāpnuyāt ||

marme mṛtyumavāpnoti rajvo garbhavināśanam |
kṛṣṇe grāmanāśaṃ syāt tasmādyetāni varjayet ||

<p. 17>

sahasrabhūsurairyuktaṃ grāmamityabhidhīyate |
cāturvaṇa savāstavya nānā jātisamanvitam ||

nallamalla samākīrṇaṃ nāṭakā gaṇikaistathā |
nagaranta dvijānīyānnānā jāti samāyutam ||

aneka jāti saṃkīrṇaṃ potanā vāsamapitam |
vaṇikjana samākīrṇaṃ pattanaṃ vidhinā budhaḥ ||

caturaṃga balairyuktaṃ dvārakeṭasamanvitam |
vividhairaratnaloścaiva yuktantat kheṭakaṃ bhavet ||

grāmād dviguṇa vistāraṃ nāgarasya varānane |
nagarād dvipattanaṃ caiva dviguṇaṃ kheṭakaṃ bhavet ||

evaṃ vidhikrameṇaiva kārayet saha sundari ||

(****) subhave teṣāmiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ devatāsthāpanaṃ nāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 6 ||

pratiṣṭhāvidhiḥ |

pratiṣṭhāvidhiṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇubrahmanyathā kramam |
prāsādasyāgrataḥ kuryāt maṇṭapañcaturaśrakam ||

uttamaṃ madhyamañcaiva adhamaṃ trividhaṃ tathā |
caturbhistoraṇairyuktaṃ caturdvārañca śobhitam ||

ṣoḍaśastaṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ daśadvādaśa hastakam |
dvātriṃśatstaṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ tathā ṣoḍaśahastakam ||

<p. 18>

(*) ttare paṭṭikā yuktaṃ staṃbhaiścaikopaśobhitam |
maṇṭapaṃ vā pyatho vopi sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam ||

ṣoḍaśastaṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ daśadvādaśahastakam |
dvātriṃśat staṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ tathā ṣoḍaśa hastakam ||

darbhairmālyaiḥ parikṣiptaṃ puṣpamālāvalambitam |
ghaṇṭācāmarasaṃyuktaṃ kuśadarbhāñca gopalam ||

pavitraṃ kanakasaṃyuktaṃ (************) |
navapañca trīṇi saṃyuktamaṃgulañca (*) gulam ||

nālaṃ tryaṃgulaṃ proktaṃ granthirekāṃgulaṃ bhavet |
mātṛgāyatri mantreṇa yojayet tu viśeṣataḥ ||

aṇḍajanmaparamāṇena avyaktaṃ devagirām |
(************) vāṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

suvarṇe rajate tāmre alābhe mṛṇmaye'pi vā |
abhinnarukṣasphuṭitaiḥ kalaśaiḥ kālavarjitaiḥ ||

akālamūlakalaśaiḥ sūtrairāveṣṭitairapi |
sakūrcaissāpi dhānaiśca savastrairveṣṭitairapi ||

īdṛśaiḥ navabhiḥ kumbhaiḥ śuddhambu paripūritam |
śālimudgapriyaṃgāni yavasarṣapameva ca ||

kalaśānvinyaset tatra sarvagandhāni tāni tu |
caturdikṣu nyaset kumbhān pūrvādi kramayogataḥ ||

<p. 19>

(****) vā śāli yavāstilān koṇeṣu vinyaset |
pañcaratnena saṃyuktā navākṣareṇa mantravit ||

madhye tu vinyaset kuṃbhaṃ vīreśītantramucyate |
raktākṣī vinyaset pūrvaṃ karālīṃ dakṣiṇe nyaset ||

caṃḍākṣī paścime nyasya mahocchiṣṭhottare nyaset |
ambikā caṇḍikā caiva ghorāghoreśvarī tathā ||

koṇeṣu kalaśānyasya śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
svasvenaiva tu bījena navākṣarayutena ca ||

kalaśaṃ vinyased vidvān śūlamudrāṃ pradarśayet |
gandhapuṣpādibhiścaiva vastrayugmena veṣṭayet ||

kalaśānte tu mantrāṇā pratyekantu yathākramam |
devyāśca pratimaṃ grāhyaṃ tāmrajandārukantu vā ||

sthāyirūpañca kartavyaṃ kṣālayecchuddhatoyakaiḥ |
vastrayugmena saṃpūjya gandhapuṣpādibhiryajet ||

praṇavaṃ vinyaseccitte vadane mūrtivinyaset |

navākṣaraṃ nyaset paścāt pratimāṃge yathākramam |
mukhe ca hṛdaye śiro nābhistu guhyake ||

ūrośca pādayoścaiva padmamudrāṃ pradarśayet |
hṛdaye hṛdayaṃ nyasya śiraścirasi vinyaset ||

<p. 20>

śikhāyāntu śikhāṃ nyasya kavacaṃ tanamastake |
astraṃ hastapradeśe tu netraṃ netreṣu vinyaset ||

sarvāṃgantu nyasenmantrī ekavīrī śarīrataḥ |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||

vārāhī caiva māhendrī vīrabhadragaṇādhipa |
ekavīrī śarīre tu vinyasedvaikamudrayā ||

vīrabhadrantu śirasi gaṇādhyakṣantu pādayoḥ |
svasvenaiva tu mantreṇa ekacitto dṛḍhavrataḥ ||

brahmāṇī tu mukhaṃ nyasya hṛdimāheśvarī nyaset |
kaumārī gudare nyasya vaiṣṇavīnnābhi mantrake ||

vārāhīṃ kaṭimadhye tu jānā vaindrīntu vinyaset |
udare vinyaset sarvaṃ jagatsthāvarajaṃgamam ||

candrādityaṃ nyasennetraṃ lalāṭekṣeru vinyaset |
śrotre diśantu vinyasya ākāśe hṛdaye nyaset ||

pādayoḥ pṛthivīṃ nyasya trimurtiścaiva vinyaset |
devā yakṣa yathā nāgā kinnarāpsarastathā ||

gatān svasvena mantreṇa hṛdaye vinyased budhaḥ |
evaṃ tasya vidhānena hārakeyūra kalpitam ||

pūjayitvā vidhānena ācāryastu nivedayet |
śayanaṃ kalpayet tatra kalaśasya ca dakṣiṇe ||

<p. 21>

aṇḍajairmuṇḍajairvāstraiḥ kārpāsaiḥ kaṃbalaiḥ kramāt |
tasyopari nyasennetre devadevāṃgakairbudhaḥ ||

kūrcaṃ tatraiva vinyasya lakṣaṇena vicakṣaṇaḥ |
evaṃ vinyasya vidhinā ekavīrīñca śayayet ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa jayaśabdayutena ca |
prākśirantu kartavyaṃ pādayoranyathā kṛtam ||

devyopari nyasedvastraṃ sadeśairyugmato haram |
īdṛgvidhañca vastraṃ vā netra nirvāṇameva vā ||

(****) vidhānena gandhapuṣpādibhiryajet |
nivedyaṃ dāpayet tatra smaraṇena tu saṃyutam ||

kalaśodakena saṃspṛśya hṛdayenābhimantrayet |
homodaye tatassarvān sarvamantrairyathā kramam ||

mūrtipairlakṣaṇopetairaṣṭabhistu yathā vidhi |
mantrajñaiḥ kuśalaiśśuddhai brahmayāmalatatparaiḥ ||

pāraśaiva kulodbhūtai mātṛdikṣo samanvitaiḥ |
nāṃgahīnairna badhirai netrahīnaiśśaṭhaistathā ||

naghradvaiśvā bālaiśca homayet tulyavarṇajaiḥ |
ācārya lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye śṛṇuṣva caturānanaṃ ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇaṃ samayācārapālakam |
śaktivratadharaṃ śāntaṃ nāṃgahīnaṃ naroginam ||

<p. 22>

ekavīravidhanajñaṃ brahmayāmala tatparam |
mātra tantra kriyāyuktaṃ mātratantraviśāradam ||

mātṛmaṇḍalavettāraṃ mātrasphūrti vicāragam |
dīkṣāsaṃskārayuktañca pratiṣṭhākramavittamam ||

śubhadeśe samutpannaṃ abhiṣeka kriyānvitam |
ekavīravidhānajñaṃ śakti vratadharaṃ śubham ||

samukta pādanayanaṃ kālamaṇḍalavarjitam |
raktaṃ raktoṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ raktapāṇiṃ vicakṣaṇaṃ ||

manojñaṃ vā pravaktāraṃ śāstrānuṣṭhānatatparam |
śīlācārasamāyuktaṃ guṇāsaṃbhogavarjitam ||

guṇāśāntaṃ samudbhūtaṃ sadbhiścaiva tu saṃpadam |
salakṣaṇaiśca saṃyuktamālola dīrghalocanam ||

mṛdupādaka sagrañca śubhakaṇṭhasamadhvalam |
evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktamācāryaṃ vidhivatsadā ||

bilvañca khadirañcaiva palāśaṃ vaṭameva ca |
aśvatthodumbarañcaiva padmañcaiva śaraṃ tathā ||

vaikaṃgatohyapāmārgaṃ arkañcaiva yathākramam |
apāmārgaṃ vāstu home homayet tatra vittamaḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśatañcaiva homayet sarva mūrtipaḥ |
ācārya dviguṇaṃ hutvā samidhājyādibhiḥ kramāt ||

<p. 23>

pratyekāṣṭaśatañcaiva homayet sarvamūrtiṣu |
aṣṭamūrtiṣu mantraiśca pṛthak vai homayed budhaḥ ||

svatāmapadasaṃyuktaṃ navākṣarasamanvitam |
svaraṇyantasasaṃyuktaṃ homayenmūrti dhārakān ||

pṛthivī āpinī te jīva yaśakhaḍginī tathā |
saurī candrī tathā pātnī aṣṭamūrtiḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

tāsāṃ mūrtistu mūrdhnīnāṃ mārayenmūrtivārakaḥ |
pṛthivī pūjanaṃ pūrvaṃ āpinī vāruṇena tu ||

tejī agni pradeśe tu vāyavī vāyugocare |
khaḍginī nair(-)ṛte bhāge saurī īśānagocare ||

candrī some tu vinyasya hyastī dakṣiṇe nyaset |
evaṃ nyastvā na vidhānena cāṣṭamūrtiṣu yojayet ||

mūrtīnāñcaiva sarvāsāṃ svanāmnā caiva homayet |
avargaṃ juhuyātpūrve kavargamagni gocare ||

cavargaṃ yāmyadeśe tu vargattrainnair(-)ṛte hutam |
tavargaṃ vāruṇañcaiva pavargaṃ vāyu gocare ||

pavargaṃ somadeśe tu ṣavargamīśagocare |
etaissarvaistu saṃyuktamācāryo homamārabhet ||

pūrvavatprakramādeva lokapālānnyaset kramāt |
saptajihvā nyasestasya yathāsthāne yathākramam ||

<p. 24>

aṣṭamasya tu khaṇḍasya tṛtīye lakṣaṇānvitam |
saptamasya tu khaṇḍasya dvitīya lakṣaṇānvitam ||

ṣaṣṭhenaiva samopetaṃ mūrdhni bindu suśobhitam |
bahurūpā bhavejjihvā nyastavyā saṃgarediśi ||

saptakhaṇḍā tṛtīyā ca dvitīyena samanvitam |
ṣaṣṭhena tu samāyuktā bindunā paribhūṣitam ||

rajatābhājasā jihvā saindre caiva vyavasthitam |
dvitīye cāṣṭamakhaṇḍānye dvitīyakam ||

ṣaṣṭhenaiva samārūḍha caindra khaṇḍānyathā kramam |
bindunoparisaṃyuktā raktā jihvā ca saṃbhavet ||

agnibhāge sthitā sā ca saktapāpavināśinī |
khaṇḍasya cāṣṭamasyaiva mātīyā śāntidā śubhā ||

saptamasya tu khaṇḍasya dvitīyena samanvitam |
ṣaṣṭhenaiva samayuktaṃ bindunoparibhūṣitam ||

kṛṣṇākhyā tu bhavejjihvā nair(-)ṛte diśi saṃsthitā |
saptamasya tu khaṇḍasya cādibījāsu śobhanā ||

punaragnisamāyuktaṃ ṣaṣṭhasvarasamanvitam |
bindunoparisaṃyuktaṃ sarvakāmārthasādhanam ||

suprabhā śobhanā jihvā vāruṇyaṃ diśisaṃsthitā |
saptamasya tu khaṇḍasya cādibījā śubhaṃkarī ||

<p. 25>

dvitīyena samāyuktā ṣaṣṭhabījena saṃyutā |
vindunoparisaṃyuktā sadāvijayavardhanī ||

atiraktā bhavejjihvā vāyavyāṃ diśisaṃsthitā |
saptajihvā samākhyātā śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

evaṃ saptavidhāṃ jihvā cāgnikuṇḍe prayojayet |
evaṃ vai sthaṇḍile jihvā yojayed deśikottamaḥ ||

etaissarvaissamāyuktaḥ ācāryo mantrahomayet |
samiddhutvā spṛśetpādamājyaṃ hutvā yadi spṛśet ||

caruṃ hutvā spṛśedbinduṃ tilān hutvā hutispṛśet |
lājaṃ hutvā mukhaṃ spṛśya śūlamudrābhimantrayet ||

kṛgākṣare spṛśet paścāt kṣvakākādīni vai budhaḥ |
hutvā hutvā spṛśenmantrī pādādi śirasāntakam ||

hṛdaye hṛdayaṃ spṛśya śiraśśirasi vinyaset |
śikhāyāntu spṛśennyasya kavacaṃ stanamadhyakam ||

stanamadhyaṃ spṛśet mantrī sarvamantrairyathā kramāt |
ājyaṃ hutvā bhavet tatra hṛnmantrādi yathākramam ||

pañcapañcabhirāhutyā ṣaḍaṃśena vidhurbudhaḥ |
ekavīraśataṃ hutvā navākṣareṇa buddhimān ||

caturmūrtiścaturhatvā aṣṭamūrtistu cāṣṭhadhā |
dvādaśaiva tu munīnāṃ dvādaśāhutirucyate ||

<p. 26>

ṣoḍaśaiva tu mūrtīnāṃ ṣoḍaśāhuti homayet |
dvātriṃśanmūrtibhiścaiva dvātriṃśāhutirucyate ||

tat tatpūraṇahotavyaṃ svanāmapadasaṃyutam |
yoginīnāṃ daśaṃ hutvā parivāreṇa pañcadhā ||

evaṃ hutaṃ vidhānena vāriṇā prokṣayed gṛham |
pañcagavyena saṃprokṣya navākṣareṇa buddhimān ||

bāhye cābhyantare caiva parivāra graheṣu ca |
prokṣayet pañcagavyena paścāt sthāpanamārabhet |

adhivāsana velāyāṃ paśūn sapta ca pātayet |
rudhiraṃ māṃsamasthiñca homayenmūlamantrataḥ ||

tato diśā baliṃ dadyāt raktamāṃsaiśca vinyaset |
śaṃkhabheryādibhirghoṣairḍamarukaiśca kāhalaiḥ ||

mātṛghoṣaiśca saṃyukta paṭahamadalasaṃkulaiḥ |
nṛttagītādibhistatra hrādayet tat pradakṣiṇam ||

adhivāsavidhi hyetannā brahma udāhṛtam |
sumuhūrte tu saṃpanne prabhāte sthāpanaṃ bhavet ||

ratnādivinyasetpūrvaṃ paścāt sthāpana mārabhet |
ratnāni loha dhānyāni bījānyoṣadhayastathā ||

krameṇa vinyaset brahman śāstra dṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
vajrantu marakatañcaiva mauktikaṃ padmarāgakam ||

<p. 27>

vaiḍūryaṃ puṣparāgañca indranīlaṃ pravālakam |
gomedakantu māṇikkaṃ navaratnaṃ prakīrtitam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa pūrvādikramayogataḥ |
suvarṇarajataṃ tāmramāyasaṃ trapusīsakam ||

āruḍhaṃ ca vipulaṃ pūrvādi kramato nyaset |
haritāraṃ gañjakañca mākṣiraṃ gunapītathā ||

saurāṣṭra gairikañcaiva vat (****) garantathā |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa pūrvādi kramato nyaset ||

tilasarṣapa mudgāni vrīhiniṣpāvakāni ca |
yavamāṣa priyaṃgūni navākṣareṇa vinyaset ||

lakṣmī ca sahadevī ca viṣṇu krānti balaṃ tathā |
garikañjīvravallī ca vāhrī ca pāksava calān ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa krameṇa vinyased dvaye |
kārayet tu navapuṭaṃ tāmraiṇaiva śobhitam ||

brahmasthānaṃ nyasenmantrī ekatvañca na kārayet |
kūrmañca pṛthivī caiva śaṃkhañcaivāta patrikam ||

vajrañcaiva tu śūlañca gadā khaḍgan tathaiva ca |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa smaraṇenaiva saṃyutam ||

nyasedvījāni mārgañca rajānyoṣadhi lohakān |
brahmasthānaṃ nyaset pūrvamāyurārogyadaṃ śubham ||

<p. 28>

evaṃ nyasya ca vidhinā pāyasena tu lepayet |
sumuhūrte ca sudine śaṃkha dundubhi nisvanaiḥ ||

sthāpayed vidhinācāryo brahmasthānantu kautukam |
kūṭākṣaraṃ navairbījairnavākṣara yutairapi ||

sumuhūrte tu kartavyaṃ ūrdhvasthāpanamācaret |
arghyandatvā tato mantrī vīradhyāna parāyaṇaḥ ||

paśūnvai ghatayet tatra pratiṣṭhā kālike tathā |
saputraṃ vā japairdarvaiḥ yajamāna purassaraiḥ ||

kavitukasya tu saṃmantryasya sthāpayed vidhinā tathā |
devabhāgaṃ nyaset sthāpya brāhme carcāṃ prakalpayet ||

kṛtākṣara navabījairnavākṣarayutairapi |
smaraṇena samāyuktaṃ tribhirjaptaṃ praveśayet ||

arghyandatvā tu tatraiva bhadrakālīṃ praveśayet |
sakalaṃ niṣkalaṃ rūpaṃ dhyātvā devyaḥ punarnyaset ||

āvāhayet tato devīṃ bhīmarūpa kapālinīm |
triśūla khaḍga khaṭvāṃga kheṭakaiśca samanvitaḥ ||

ghaṇṭāḍamarukañcaiva nāgapāśa samanvitā |
muṇḍamālādharīṃ devīṃ triṇetriṃ raktalocanīm ||

śyāmavarṇāñca sughanīṃ raudrīṃ caiva parātparām |
bhūtapreta gaṇaissarvai mātṛyoni gaṇairyutām ||

<p. 29>

etaissarvaiḥ paribhūtaiḥ devīmāvāhayedbudhaḥ |
acintyāṃ paramāṃ sūkṣmāṃ avyaktāṃ akṣayāṃ dayām ||

nānārūpa jagadyoniṃ viśvamūrtiṃ maheśvarīm |
aneka vadanāndevīṃ naikahastāṃ maheśvarīm ||

naikarūpa ghṛtaśyāmāṃmanekā ghrāṇasaṃyutām |
anekaśśrotrasaṃyuktamanekastanasaṃyutām ||

aneka mukhasaṃyuktāṃ samudrāṃbarabhūṣitām |
indraśrapavicitrāṃgī vinyaset tantravittamaḥ ||

kalaśodakena saṃprokṣya svāpi rūpantu vinyaset |
parivāranyaseccaiva svasvenaiva tu mantravit ||

devyodakena saṃprokṣya nyasetsvaralipinyathā |
nivedayet tadā dehamarcayitvā vidhānataḥ ||

pāyasaṃ kṛsarānnañca pītānnañca gulodanam |
śuddhānnaghṛtasaṃyuktandadhimadhughṛtānvitām ||

bhakṣya bhojyañca pāyañca lehyaṃ śoṣyaṃ tathaiva ca |
baulakāmaṇḍakā caiva pūrikā ghṛtakantathā ||

madhumāṃsañca pānañca gulapiṣṭaṃ madhuntathā |
trividhā tu bhaved devī lakṣamāṃsena saṃyutā ||

nivedayed viśeṣeṇa arghyaiśca bahukādakān |
diśābaliṃ tato dadyāt māṃsānāṃ lājasaṃyutam ||

<p. 30>

ācāryaṃ pūjayet saṃmyak gorumikāñcanādibhiḥ |
pratiṣṭhā vidhāyāṃ proktaṃ rāṣṭraśāntyarthakāraṇam ||

garbhagehe tu matimān saptakoṣṭhāni kārayet |
pratiṣṭhāpya pūjayet taṃtra vittama (****) ||

dhruvārcādevikaṃ sthāpya bhūtātmā raṇabhāgike |
paiśān paiśātu bhāgetu svārpayet tantravittamaḥ ||

evaṃ tu trividhaṃ lekhyaṃ yathāvidhipurassaram |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ pratiṣṭhāvidhirnāma saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 
7 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi nyāsakarma vidhikramāt |
nyāsānāṃ trividhaṃ proktaṃ sarvakāmārtha sādhanam ||

sṛṣṭisaṃhārabhedañca sthitinyāsaṃ tathaiva ca |
mūrdhnādi pādaparyantaṃ sṛṣṭinyāsaṃ prakīrtitam ||

pādādi ca śirāntantu nyāsañca saṃhṛtirbhavāt |
nāsādi hṛdayāntantu sthitinyāsaṃ taducyate ||

prathamantu jalasnānaṃ mṛdāsnānamataḥ param |
japasnānavidhiṃ paścāt dhyānayogī samācaret ||

padmāsanantu kartavyamañjalī puṭamudrayā |
pūrakaṃ pūrayet pūrvaṃ brahmā tatrādhidevatā ||

<p. 31>

kumbhakaṃ hṛdimadhyasthaṃ deśaṃ niṣkala bhāsitam |
niṣkalaṃ paramāśakti mantrāsanasamanvitam ||

kālīṃ caiva karālī ca virālī mālinī tathā |
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhye tu mūrtiṃ dhyātvā yathākramam ||

paścāt karāṃgulīnyāsa nirmalākṣa samanvitam |
nāgahastasamaṃ kuryāt maṇimaṇḍasamanvitam ||

dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭhakaṃ brāhmaṃ tarjanī tu maheśvarī |
madhyamāṃgulakaumārī vaiṣṇavī ca tvanāmikā ||

kaniṣṭhikā ca vārāhī dakṣiṇāṃgula vinyaset |
vāmahaste kaniṣṭhādi indrāṇintatra vinyaset ||

anāmikāyāñcāmuṇḍā vīrabhadrā tu madhyamā |
tarjanī tu mahāvighnaṃ karālyaṃguṣṭhavinyaset ||

evaṃ sṛṣṭikramaṃ kuryāt saṃhāraṃ tadanantaram |
vāmāṃguṣṭhādi cārabhya navaśaktiṣu vinyaset ||

śāntī cāṃguṣṭhavinyāse soṇī tarjani vinyaset |
khaḍvāṃgī madhyamaṃ kuryāt anāmī caiva tu nāsikā ||

kaniṣṭhikā nyaset kāntimaṃgulyagre pratiṣṭhitam |
mauktikī kaniṣṭikā nyasya agre ca tarjanīṃ nyaset ||

krodhī cāṃguṣṭhavinyasya sthiti nyāsaṃ prakīrtitam |
aṃgulyaṃ praṇavaṃ nyasya phaṭkāraṃ tarjanīṃ nyaset ||

<p. 32>

phaṭkāraṃ madhyamāṃgulyaṃ phaṭkārañcaiva nāmikā |
kaniṣṭhāṃguli huṃkāraṃ kaniṣṭhākāramucyate ||

anekāyāntu phaṭkāra phaṭkāraṃ madhyamaṃ nyaset |
śvetantu tarjanīṃ tasya huṃkārāṃguṣṭhavinyaset ||

dakṣiṇe kaṭimadhye tu caṇḍī raudrī tu vinyaset |
vāme tu maṇimadhye ca caṇḍī raudrī tu vinyaset ||

vāme tu maṇimadhye tu bhairavīṃ tatra vinyaset |
dakṣiṇe bahuvīre tu ekavīre tu vāmake ||

hastābhyāktāla pṛṣṭhe tu arkamātme tu vinyaset |
karanyāsamidaṃ prokta mahānyāsamataḥ param ||

praṇavaṃ vinyasen mūrdhnī brahmā tatrādhi daivatam |
khakāre tu lalāṭaṃ syāt skandastatrādhi daivatam ||

vakāraṃ vaktramadhye tu vighnantatrādhi daivatam |
makāraṃ hṛdaye madhye durgāṃ tatrādhi daivatam ||

saddhastaṃ puruṣaṃ devaṃ bhakāraṃ tatra vinyaset |
evaṃ sṛṣṭimahāmudrā sṛṣṭinyāsan taducyate ||

oṃkāraṃ pādayornyasya bhūmistatrādhi daivatam |
jrekāraṃ jānumadhye tu durgāsūtrāsu daivatam ||

drekāraṃ vahnivinyasya umāstatrādhi daivatam |
hreṃkāraṃ stanamagre tu śriyai tatrādhi daivatam ||

<p. 33>

hroṃkāraṃ caiva bāhubhyā jyeṣṭhaṃ tatrādhi daivatam |
hreṃkāraṃ cakṣuvinyāsaṃ sarasvatyādhi daivatam ||

skandadeśe tu phaṭkāraṃ iti nyāsādhi daivatam |
pṛṣṭhe caiva huṃkāraṃ pāliṃ tasyādhi daivatam ||

padanyāsantu hṛdaye hakāraṃ nāyaśakti sa daivatā |
eteṣāṃ ca sthiti nyāsamuṣṭikaṃ bindumudrayā ||

vīrabhadrantu mantreṇa śirasopari vinyaset |
tadūrdhvaṃ bhaktavinyāsaṃ sa tu dhyānarūpiṇam ||

vighnamantrān lalāṭasyāt tasyordhvaṃ padavinyaset |
brahmāṇī mūlamantreṇa catuśyāntatra vinyaset ||

mantropari tathā caturvaktrā caturbhujā ||

evaṃ dhyātvā tu manasā brahmāṇī tatra vinyaset |
māheśvarīti mantreṇa āsya madhye pratiṣṭhitam ||

tasyordhvamīśvarī caiva caturbāhustriṇetriṇī |
kaumārī mūlamantreṇa karṇāgre tatra vinyaset ||

mantrasyopari vinyāsaṃ kāmārī tu caturbhujā |
vaiṣṇavī mūlamantreṇa bāhyābhyantara vinyaset ||

mantropari ca vinyāsaṃ vaiṣṇavī caikahastinī |
vārāhī mūla mantreṇa hṛdayañcaiva vinyaset ||

tasya mantropari nyāsaṃ vārāhī ca caturbhujā |
indrāṇi mūlamantreṇa nābhi madhye pratiṣṭhitam ||

<p. 34>

tasya madhyopari nyāsaṃ indrāṇī vajrahastinī |
cāmuṇḍī mūlamantreṇa sarvāṃgeṣu pratiṣṭhitam ||

tasya mantropari dhyātvā cāmuṇḍā ugraveṣiṇī |
evaṃ mātṛmayaṃ dhyātvā yāgapūrve pravartate ||

sakalaṃ niṣkalañcaiva niṣkalaṃ sakalaniṣkalam |
sakantu śarīrasthammahānapi yathāśaktiyantāramanuvartate ||

tathaivendriya saṃghātañcittamevānuvartate |
dṛṣṭvā tārkṣyaṃ yathā sarpaṃ kampatetha muhurmuhuḥ ||

amantramarcakan dṛṣṭvā kampate śivamutsayā |
śivaśikṣā samāyogāt śivahṛṣṭamihocyate ||

pāraśavakule jāto snānaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣataḥ |
kṣaurañca danta śuddhiñca mantrasnānantu lepanam ||

uṣṇīṣañcopavītañca śuddha vastrottarīyakam |
karṇakuṇḍalasaṃyuktaṃ hemāṃgulya pavitrakam ||

pravālamauktikā kāntaṃ rudrākṣamālikāyutam |
tripuṇḍrantu viśeṣeṇa candanenānulepanam ||

bherikā poṣaṇañcaiva pāraśaivamiti smṛtam |
prokṣaṇe ca pratiṣṭhāyāṃ utsvave balikālake ||

dīkṣayā mālayāraṃbhe bālasthāne tathaiva ca |
yāvat karma samārabhya bherikāṃ tāḍayet kramāt ||

<p. 35>

bherikāyoṣṭahīnañca rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati |
anyathā tāmunañcaiva rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati ||

tad doṣa śamanārthāya saptaśuddhi samāharet |
annapādyasamāyuktaṃ ghoṣayet sarva karmasu ||

[iti śrībrahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ nyāsavidhiṃ nāma aṣṭamaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 8 ||


pīṭham |

vakṣyehaṃ balipīṭhasya lakṣaṇaṃ kramaśodhunā |
mūlagehe talottheyaṃ bhūtapīṭhasya vistṛtam ||

pādabāhye tu madhye vā pādābhyantarameva vā |
vistāramutsedhamardhādhika mathāpi vā ||

pādādhikaṃ tathā kṛtvā vidhipīṭhasya cocchrayam |
homādi karṇikāntañcet dvātriṃśadaṃśakaṃ bhavet ||

kumudoccantu bhūtāṃśaṃ kaṃpemekāṃśamucyate |
ṣaḍaṃśaṃ caraṇoccaṃ vā kampamānaṃ śivāṃśakam ||

kalāṃśantu mahāpadmaṃ padmotsedhaṃ yugāṃśakam |
pakṣotsaṃ karṇikotsedhaṃ homādupari vinyaset ||

athavānya prakāreṇa dvāramānavidhiṃ śṛṇu |
hārocchreyaṃ tāraṃ pādahīnaṃ dvipādakam ||

<p. 36>

uttamādhamamadhyañca tuṃgaṃ pūrvoktamācaret |
homākarṇika paryantamaṣṭāviṃśati saṃkhayā ||

upānoccaṃ kaloccaṃ vā rasāṃśañca pramāṇakam |
kuṃbhotsedhaṃ śarāṃśaṃ syāt kaṃamekāṃśamucyate ||

yugāṃśaṃ kaṇṭhamānantu śivāṃśaṃ kampamūrdhvakam |
śivākṣyaṃśa mehapaṭṭī pakṣāṃśaṃ vā viśeṣataḥ ||

vedāṃśa padmantu vinyasya śivāṃśaṃ karṇikodayam |
pīṭhatāraṃ yugāśrantu niṣkalasya śarīrakam ||

sthitaṃ vai ātmakaṃ vidyātsakalañcalito bhavet |
āyukṣā tu samākhyātā ātmanena tu dṛśyate ||

kṣetraṃ kṣetrasya rūpeṇa vibhedā paṭhyate mayā |
tilamadhye sthitaṃ tailaṃ kṣīramadhye yathā dhruvam ||

tilavat kṣetramityāhuḥ tailaṃ kṣetrasya ucyate |
ubhayoritaraṃ nāsti ākāśavivibhunnayet ||

mātṛkaṃ kṣetramityuktaṃ kṣetrajñotha prabhurucyate |
akṣaraṃ paramādhāramadheyaṃ śaktirucyate ||

anunātmānamityuktaṃ ātmāstu sa bhairavam |
mantraṃ paramāśaktiśśakti bhairavamucyate ||

bhairavaṃ bhairavodbhūtaṃ śaktyāmuna vivitrayam |
anyathā devatā śakti bhairaveṣu samudbhavā ||

<p. 37>

nānābhedasvarūpāṇi nānāśāstrakalāṃ dharet |
evaṃ śaktyā bhaved brahman brahmaśakti tataḥ param ||

mātṛdīkṣā kramañcaiva arcanaṃ nātra kārayet ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ pīṭhalakṣaṇaṃ nāma navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] 
|| 9 ||


snānam |

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi snānakarmavidhikramam |
āgneyaṃ vāruṇaṃ snānaṃ ātapaṃ dvicaturvidham ||

āgneyaṃ dīkṣitā snāne valmīke darbhamulake |
nadīkūpa taṭāke vā anyebhyaścaiva mantravit ||

tailaṃ maladantakāṣṭha śucau deśe tu nikṣipet |
prakṣālya pāṇipādena dantakāṣṭhañca kārayet ||

upaspṛśya śucistasmin snānātsaṃpāraśaivakaḥ |
sadyoja mṛttikāṃ gṛhya vāmena kṣepaṇañcaret ||

abhimantreṇa ghoreṇa vaktreṇaiva tribhāgikam |
nivedanamīśa mantreṇa vighnanāśāya sādhaka ||

bhāgamekaṃ bhaved dikṣu bhāgamekasya cāṃbhasi |
saṃgṛhya likhya cātmānaṃ kuryāt snānaṃ yathākramam ||

gaṃgā ca yamunā caiva kojinī kāṇṭhakī tathā |
sindhussarasvatī caiva sindho pañcanadī smṛtā ||

<p. 38>

catussāgaramadhyastha dhyānantu salīlaṃ tathā |
sarvatīrthāni puṇyāni asmin tiṣṭhantu vāṃbhasi ||

gaṃgāhradaṃ japet pūrva paścācchrukṣye tu muttamam |
pāvaṇaṃ sarvatīrthebhyo śivatīrthantu yadbhavet ||

paripūrṇāñjaliṃ kṛtvā śirasyopari nikṣipet |
nimagnadaṇḍavat tatra smaredīśānamuttamam ||

uttīrya salilāt paścāt sadyojātamanusmaran |
niṣkramya jalamadhyāt tu upaviśyottaraṃ mukham ||

vidhinā camya gāyatrī locanādi talaṃ spṛśet |
prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyeddhṛdayamaṃ śivam ||

nirodhājjāyate vāyurvāyoragnistu jāyate |
tapo nāmāpi jāyante tatontaśśuddhirucyate ||

bahirabhyantare śuddhe śivahastantu kārayet |
paścādātma śivaṃ kuryāt tritatva sahita dvija ||

upaspṛśya jalaṃ tatra kūrcahaste jalaṃ spṛśet |
devānṛṣi pitṝṃścaiva krameṇaiva tu tarpayet ||

dhyānamārgaṃ samāptena sādhakasya vidhīyate |
jalasnaṃ purā kṛtvā bhasmasānaṃ yathākramam ||

śvetaṃ raktaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ kapilaṃ jarayākramāt |
gomayena susaṃgrāhya oṃkāramabhi mantrayet ||

<p. 39>

nakāraṃ sthāpanaṃ kṛtvā makāraṃ śodhayet kramāt |
śikāraṃ muṣṭikāṃ kṛtvā vakāraṃ śodhayet kramāt ||

yakāramagni dagdhantu oṃkāraṃ gṛhasādhakaḥ |
bhasmabhūtaṃ tathā kṛtvā punassaṃskāra karmaṇi ||

pātrantu sthāpayet tatra agninā dahena kramāt |
pañcākṣaraṃ tato japyamanya pātrasya saṃgraham ||

gandhapuṣpasamāyuktaṃ śuddhadeśena dāpayet |
amṛtasvatparaṃ bījaṃ yāmyaṃ saṃspṛśya nityaśaḥ ||

dīkṣitā pūjayennityaṃ sarvapāpaharaṃ param |
jñānadīkṣā tapodīkṣā mantradīkṣā krameṇa tu ||

jñānadīkṣā tu viprāṇāṃ tapo dīkṣā nṛpasya tu |
mantradīkṣā tu vaiśasya śūdrasyaiva tathaiva ca ||

anyeṣāñcaiva jātīnāṃ śūdrāṇāñca tathaiva ca |
anyeṣāñcaiva jātīnāṃ karmayogyaṃ na kārayet ||

dīkṣā krameṇa kartavyaṃ gurumārādhya vartate |
agnimātā pitārudra dīkṣito yasya pūjakaḥ ||

tasya jantu kulojāta pūrvajanma vivarjitaḥ |
maṇḍale sthaṃḍile caiva sphaṭike vā maṇiryathā ||

bhitti citrapaṭe vāpi hṛdaye vāpi kārayet |
pūjayed vāpi piṇḍātmā dhyānaṃ kūrvita sādhakaḥ ||

<p. 40>

brahmacārī gṛhasthaśca vānaprasthaśca bhikṣukaḥ |
śaivaṃ pāśupataṃ soma traya siddhāntameva ca ||

pūrvañca dakṣiṇañcaiva paścimaṃ cottaraṃ tathā |
ūrdhvamūrdhnābhisaṃyuktamīśānaṃ parikalpayet ||

īśānapūrvato mūrtiṃ īśvaro caiva dakṣiṇe |
paścima brahmamūrtistu uttare tu śivastathā ||

ūrdhvaṃ sadāśivaṃ caiva pañcamūrtiridaṃ kramāt |
tat tanmukhena dīkṣāyā tat tadbhāvantu pūjayet ||

sṛṣṭisthitiśca saṃhāraṃ mūrtibheda krameṇa tu |
brahmāṇaṃ pūjayennityaṃ bhasmoddhūlita vigraha ||

sarvasaṃga parityājya ekatvaṃ bhāvayet kramāt |
viṣṇuñca pūjayennityaṃ japahoma kriyādibhiḥ ||

gṛhasthasya viśeṣeṇa dīpākāra sa ucyate |
dīkṣitānāñca sarveṣāṃ naranāryassubhaktitaḥ ||

tryaṃgulyantu parikramya tripuṇḍrassavidhīyate |
tryaṃgulaṃ paridhe yattu sarveṣāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

evaṃ vidhi krameṇaiva pūjayitvā viśeṣataḥ |
ekatvaṃ bhāvayet tatra kulajātassamāpnuyāt ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ dīkṣābheda śuddhasnānavidhirnāma 
daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 10 ||
<p. 41>

mātṝṇāmarcanaṃ vakṣye śrūyatāṃ ca varānane |
aharahārcanaṃ vakṣye ahaḥ pāpavināśanam ||

grāmaśāntimimaṃ śrutvā rakṣaśśatru vināśanam |
āyuśśrīputra vṛdhyarthaṃ dhanadhānya vivardhanam ||

ārādhana vidhiṃ devyai strīśūdrāśca varjayet |
grāme vā nagare vāpi pattane keṭakepi vā ||

maṃtraḥ snānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā bhasmasnānaṃ tataḥ param |
uttarābhimukho bhūtvā dhyānaṃ kurvīta sādhakaḥ ||

tannāmakasya mantreṇa pūrvādīni yathārcayet |
arcayitvā yathānyāyaṃ gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt ||

dvārastho yoginīnāṃ vā snānādagnisvarūpiṇī |
puṃliṃgī gomarīcī ca ugrī ca sumukhī tathā ||

vijayī jṛṃbhiṇī caiva ityete dvārayoginī |
gandhapuṣpādibhirdhūpaiḥ svanāmnā cārcayed budhaḥ ||

śuddhinī pūrvadeśe tu āgneyyāntu sukeśinī |
viṣukaṇṭhī ca yāme tu nair(-)ṛtyāṃ sundarī tathā ||

vāruṇyāṃ jāvalī devī vāyavyāṃ koṭarākṣasī |
somestadarśinī devī īśānyāṃ śatrumardinī ||

daṇḍakuṇḍodarī bhīmī kīḍī vijayavinyayā |
vyālāmukhī virūpākṣī rājadevī raśaktayā ||

<p. 42>

nīlakeśī vikarṇī ca vyālakeśī tathaiva ca |
ugrapaiśācinī devi vetāli ca nāmataḥ ||

indraścāgni yamaścaiva nir(-)ṛtirvaruṇastathā |
vāyusaumyamīśāne kauberyāṃ śaṃkarī tathā ||

vighneśa vīrabhadrañca brāhmī māheśvarī tathā |
kaumārī vaiṣṇavī caiva vārāhī cendrāṇī tathā ||

cāmuṇḍī caiva nāmāni mātṝṇāmeva tattat |
tat tadgāyatri mantreṇa arcayitvā yathākramam ||

śuklavāsañca vīrañca brahmāṇī sitavāsasā |
īśvarī śvetavāsā tu kumārī sindhuvāsasā ||

vaiṣṇavī pītavāsāstu vārāhī kṛṣṇavāsasā |
indrāṇi ca dukūlantu cāmuṇḍī raktavasasā ||

vighneśaṃ khaḍgavāsāstu pratyekaṃ vastramucyate |
mukhaṃ hiriberañca brahmāṇī gandhamucyate ||

īśvarīmāñca gandhañca kaumārī kuṃkumaṃ tathā |
vaiṣṇavī rājakastūrī vārāhī ca niyāsakam ||

ārdrameṣañca indrāṇī cāmuṇḍī raktacandanam |
śuklacandana lepe tu vīravighnaṃ tathārcayet ||

ketakī jātipuṣpantu gaṇeśañca tathārcayet |
karavīraṃ vīrabhadra brahmāṇī śvetapadmakam ||

<p. 43>

śvetārkamīśvarī caiva kaumārī kumudantathā |
vaiṣṇavī tulasī caiva vārāhī mallikā tathā ||

jātipuṣpantu śūdrāṇi cāmuṇḍā raktapadmakam |
guggulāṃ vīrabhadrañca śitārī ca caturmukham ||

īśvarī agaruñciva kaumārī devadārugam |
vaiṣṇavī vanadhūpañca vārāhī ājya dhūpakam ||

indrāṇī catuniryāsa cāmuṇḍī jātudhūpakam |
vighneśamagaruñcaiva śītārī sarva devatā ||

gandhamantrantu gandhañca puṣpamantrantu puṣpakam |
dhūpamantrantu dhūpañca dīpamantrantu dīpakam ||

tat tadgāyatri mantreṇa tat tanmūlaṃ japet kramāt |
tat tad bimbantu saṃpūjyamāvāhyābhyarcayet kramāt ||

śuddhānnaṃ vīrabhadrañca vighneśantu nivedayet |
brahmāṇī pāyasānnañca īśvarī kṛsarānnakam ||

haridrānnañca kaumārī vaiṣṇavī ca gulānnakam |
vārāhī caiva māṣānnaṃ indrāṇī mudgamannakam ||

raktānnañca tilānnañca cāmuṇḍī ca nivedayet |
naivedyamantramuccārya tat tadevaṃ nivedayet ||

ūrdhvaṃ pṛthak pṛthak vakṣye śrūyatāṃ caturānana |
vighneśaṃ vīrabhadrañca samidbilvaṃ tathocyate ||

<p. 44>

brahmāṇī ca palāśañca arkamāheśvarī tathā |
audumbarīntu kaumārī aśvatthaṃ vaiṣṇavī tathā ||

vārāhī plakṣamevaṃ syāt indrāṇī khadirantathā |
nyagrodhañcaiva cāmuṇḍī samidhastatra kīrtitāḥ ||

ūrdhvaṃ pṛthak pṛthak vakṣye hūyate samidhastathā |
eteṣāmapyalābhe tu palāśaṃ sarva hūyate ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ mātṛrcanaṃ nāma ekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] 
|| 11 ||


agnikāryam |

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi agnikāryavidhi kramam |
sthaṇḍilañcāpi kuṇḍaṃ vā cāgnīnāṃ tu gṛhaṃ dvidhā ||

aśraṃ yonyardha candrañca aśraṃ vartulaṃ tathā |
ṣaḍaśraṃ padmamaṣṭāśraṃ pañcāśrantu yathākramam ||

caturaśrā kṛtīkuṇḍaṃ sarvakāmārtha sādhanam |
prajā ṛddhikaraṃ yonau cārdhacandraripukṣayam ||

guṇāśre śāntidaṃ proktaṃ parjanyārthantu vartule |
ṣaḍaśre sasya vṛddhiśca jayārthañcaiva padmake ||

vasvaśre puṣṭidaṃ jñeyaṃ pañcāśre roganāśanam |
kuṇḍānāntu phalañcaiva sthaṇḍilañca vinocyate ||

<p. 45>

kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāpi hastamātreṣu kārayet |
mekhalāstribhi kurvīta catustri dvyaṃgulena tu ||

mekhalāmadha (*) stākṛtārotsedha (*) vyaṃgulam |
tryaṃgulostravistāraṃ madhyamāyāṃ tu mekhalā ||

caturaṃgulocchritaṃ vāramūrdhvāvāstatramekhalā |
kuryānnābhiṣaḍaṃgulyāṃ paścimaṃ dakṣiṇeva tu ||

aśvattha patravannābhi ekāṃgulasamanvitam |
gomayā lepikā bhūmindarbhaissammṛjya vai hṛdā ||

kuṇḍañcet śodhanañcaiva kṣālanaṃ śoṣaṇaṃ tathā |
pācanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ caiva sadyādi brahma pañcakaiḥ ||

nakradyokaramādāya prokṣya saumye visarjayet |
śuddhadeśottha sikatairanādrairhastavistṛtam ||

aṃgulatrayamānoccaṃ samanimnonnataṃ tathā |
prāgagrādi trirekhāstu tadvau saumyāgra rekhayā ||

madhyasūtrantu brahmāṇi vaiṣṇavī dakṣiṇena tu |
kālī cottarasūtriṃ syāt adhidevā prakīrtitā ||

trisrāṇāṃ prāgagrāṇāmadhidevāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
cāmuṇḍī madhyasūtrīntu paścime tu gaṇādhipaḥ ||

pūrve tu yogamūrtīnāṃ adhidevāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
ullikhya tribhiḥ pūrvāgramidhmamekena kārayet ||

<p. 46>

madhyamaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ saumyaṃ trīṇi rekhā ca kārayet |
ūrdhvarekhestu me saumyamullekhya samidhaṃ tyajet ||

lekhyamantramidaṃ jñātvā astramantraṃ tathaiva ca |
sūryakāntodbhavaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ kāṣṭhajaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet ||

śrotryāgāra vahnistu kanyasastviti kīrtitaḥ |
śarāve tāmrapātre vā pāvakantu samānayet ||

gṛhītvā nava śarāve ca āgneyāndiśi vinyaset |
hetāturagre vinyasya saṃprokṣya bahurūpiṇā ||

gandhādibhirhṛdābhyarcya varmaṇā cāvakuṇṭhayet |
prakṣipyendhanamagnau tu vahnerāyatanānvare ||

nābhimadhye tu vāgīśīnnīlotpaladalaprabhām |
ṛtusnānāsya kūrcasthāṃ dhyātvā tanmūlamantrataḥ ||

mantreṇa saṃskṛte kuṇḍe vāgīśīmagnimātaram |
vāgīśvarañca pitaramāvāhya sthāpya cārcayet ||

triṇetrañcaturbhujañcaiva padmarāgasamaprabham |
varadābhayadañcaiva śūlapāśadharaṃ karaiḥ ||

vāgīśī puṇḍarīkābhāṃ caturhastāṃ ghanastanīm |
vyākhyānapustakadharāṃ kamaṇḍalvakṣa dhāriṇīm ||

evaṃ dhyātvā samabhyarcya kūrcamadhye vinikṣipet |
iti dhyātvā samabhyarcya vāgīvāgīśvara dvayam ||

<p. 47>

saṃpūjyāgni samādāya saṃbhrāmyā yatanaṃ tridhā |
yonimārgeṇa nikṣipya vahnibīja manusmaran ||

ityagniṃ triḥ paribhrāmya asurāṃśaḥ vivarjayet |
yoni mārgeṇa cāgniñca jānau bhūmau nidhāya ca ||

hraṃ iti smaran śrutvā oṃ hāṃ agnaye namaḥ |
ityagniṃ samidhamādāya tredhāgniṃ sudāpayet ||

astreṇa kaṃkaṇaṃ badhvā arcayed gandhapuṣpakaiḥ |
sadarbherindhanaṃ kṣiptvā datvārghyaṃ hṛdayena tu ||

abhyarcya gandhapuṣpeṇa taṇḍulenāhuti trayam |
garbhādhānamiti khyātaṃ kuryāt puṃsavanantathā ||

hṛdayena yajedvahnimetat puṃsavanaṃ smṛtam |
puṣpaṃ dadyāt puṃsavane tilenaivāhuti trayam ||

aghoreṇa dadedarghyaṃ sīmantaṃ syāt tadantataḥ |
taṇḍulena trayaṃ hutvā vaktreṇa kusumākṣataiḥ ||

agnaye namaḥ prajvālya paścāt tatpuruṣeṇa tu |
nikṣipya śirasā mantrī jātakarma vidhismṛtaḥ ||

gandhapuṣpākṣataṃ dadyāt śirasā caiva jātakam |
tilena trayamāhṛtyā sūtakaṃ śuddhirucyate ||

astreṇaiva tu saṃprokṣya īśānena samarcayet |
mānase vahnirūpantu dhyātvā vāhanaṃ śubham ||

<p. 48>

saṃprokṣyeśāna mantreṇa datvārghyaṃ puṣpamiśritam |
tannāmakaraṇaṃ proktaṃ evaṃ saṃskārapañca yuk ||

āvāhanādi sadyānnaṃ tanmudrādi viśeṣataḥ |
darbhairindhanamagnau tu upasthānaṃ hṛdākṣipet ||

darbhaiścaivāsanaṃ kalpya darbhaiścottara visarjayet |
darbhaiścaiva paristīrya hṛdagni daśabhistathā ||

dakṣiṇā cottarā caiva uttarādagharastathā |
pūrvāgre cottarāgraśca prāgādīni kramāt kṣipet ||

raktākṣī caiva kālī ca caṇḍākṣī ca tathaiva ca |
ucchiṣṭeśvarī caiva pragādīni paristare ||

pūrve ca paścime caiva uttarāgraṃ paristaret |
dakṣiṇe cottare caiva pūrvāgrañca paristaret ||

uttamaṃ daśadarbhāśca atha pañca kuśena ca |
brahmāsanantu dakṣiṇyāṃ sthālyāsanañca paścime ||

uttare praṇitā caiva agre pātrāsanaṃ tathā |
vāṇī vāgīśvarau caiva udvāsanamataḥ param ||

sruksruvau ca ghṛtasthālīṃ praṇītāṃ prokṣaṇīṃ tathā |
samitkūrca caru darvī sirīñca kamaṇḍalum ||

dravyapātrāṇi sarvāṇi vāmakāśopari nyaset |
adhomukhāni pātrāṇi dvandvarūpāṇi sādhayet ||

<p. 49>

prokṣaṇī pātramādāya jalenaiva prapūrayet |
vitastimātramādāya tanmadhye granthasaṃyutam ||

aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāntu udakotplavanaṃ kuru |
saṃskṛte naiva toyena prokṣya pātrāṇi varmaṇā ||

sruksruvau cendhanādīni hemadravyāṇi dakṣiṇe |
samidhājya caruṃ lājān sarṣapañca yavaṃ tilam ||

mudgañca vaiṇavaṃ caiva śrīpatraṃ kadalī phalam |
ajamāṃsarudhirañca matsyañcāsavasaṃyutam ||

saṃsthāpya tena toyena prokṣayet tāna śeṣakān |
dravyahoma carvādīni pātrāṇyurdhvānanaṃ kuru ||

badhvātha saptabhirdarbhai kūrcaṃ hotuśca dakṣiṇe |
āsanāmantrasaṃyuktaṃ aṣṭamudrā prakīrtitā ||

āvāhanantu brahmāṇīmaṃganyāsamataḥ param |
gandhapuṣpañca dhūpañca saṃpādyabhyarcayet tathā ||

prokṣaṇīñcennir(-)ṛte sthāpya kūrcaṃ jalapūritam |
japyantu vāruṇī mantraṃ (**) cāgnau tu prokṣayet ||

dvidarbhairgranthi saṃyuktaṃ nāsikaṃ tantu gṛhyate |
aiśānye sthāpanañcaiva (************) ||

praṇītānnair(-)ṛte sthāpya kūrcaṃ vā jalapūritam |
pūrvamantraṃ japaṃ kṛtvā (************) ||

<p. 50>

paścime cājyapātreṇa sthāpitantu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
kūrcantu sthāpitaṃ madhye tanmadhye ghṛtapūritam ||

dvidarbhairdahanañcaiva ājyamadhye tu saṃspṛśet |
uttare visarjanañcaiva paścād darbhantu dāhanam ||

sarpimadhye tu saṃyojya agnīnāntu pradakṣiṇam |
pūrvavatsarjanaṃ kṛtvā agnimekantu sarjayet ||

sruksruve gṛhītvā tu agne sparśanameva ca |
sparśanaṃ bandhanaṃ kṛtvā ājyapātre tvadhomukham ||

ājyena prokṣaṇīmindhamekaviṃśati saṃkhyayā |
pūrvadakṣiṇa paścāt tu uttare madhyame hunet ||

sadyādi kaṇṭhavedhantu hṛdayānna prāśanam |
sadyena ca caulaṃ kuryād vāmadevenopanītakam ||

aghoreṇa vrataṃ kuryāt puruṣeṇa samāpanam |
īśānena vivāhañca yathāvidhi purassaram ||

sruksruveṇa gṛhītvā nair(-)ṛtyāndiśamādikam |
aiśānyāntaṃ hunet kṛtvā paścādvāyavamādikam ||

āgneyāntaṃ hunet paścāt pūrvādyaiśānyamantakam |
indrādināmamantrantu homayet tu viśeṣataḥ ||

mandroddhāra krameṇaiva mantrakośa vidhikramāt |
svāhānte devikā homaṃ nagaraṃ śāntivardhanam ||

<p. 51>

putrapautrādi vṛddhiñca śrīdevī sannidhistathā |
asurādi pārśvaśvāntaṃ phaṭkārāntena homayet ||

oṃkāraṃ saṃpuṭaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ huṃkārantu daśākṣaram |
puṣparthe ca vaṣaṭkāraṃ mūlamantreṇa kārayet ||

evaṃ jñātvā tu mantrasya homayet tu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
homadravyāṇi sarvāṇi devayuktena sādhayet ||

matsyantu śirasaṃ gṛhya māṃsānviṃ tu vai gṛhī |
khaṇḍamāmalakaṃ prakhya madyena saha homayet ||

devi homantu śāntyarthaṃ nagarasya tu vardhanam |
kuṇḍañca sthaṇḍilañcaiva nalināmadhidevatā ||

sruksruvādhi daivatyaṃ virālī śaktirucyate |
maṇṭapañca vitānañca namaskṛtaṃ (****) ||

devī caiva tu (****) saumya mūrtiriti smṛtam |
yahyasthāpayedastramidrādi kramayogataḥ ||

pūrvantu dāpayed vajraṃ āgneyāṃ śaktimeva ca |
daṇḍantu sthāpayedyāmyāṃ nair(-)ṛtyāṃ khaḍgameva ca ||

vāruṇyāṃ sthāpayet pāśaṃ vāya (************) |
gadāñca sthāpayet saumyaṃ aiśānyāṃ śūlameva ca ||

(************) mūrdhvantu padmavinyaset |
ityevaṃ lokapālānāṃ astrāṇāñca tridhāmataḥ ||

<p. 52>

cayitvā vidhānena nirmālya jvālinīṃ dadet |
nirmālya jvālinīn dadyāt paścād devaṃ visarjayet ||

devyā pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā stuti japyopahāra ca |
praṇamya daṇḍavadbhumau devyā dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ ||

gomayena tataḥ paścāt ghaṣayet susamāhitaḥ |
śudrakanyādvijānāntu udbhavo śāstrapāṭhakāḥ ||

sarvatantra samācāra pāraśaivā prakīrtitāḥ |
pūjā homa viśeṣajñā iti śāstrassaniścayaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ agnikāryavidhirnāma dvādaśa paṭalaḥ] || 
12 ||


dvimukhañcaika hṛdayañcatuśśrotraṃ dvināsikam |
āsyadvayañca ṣaṇṇetraṃ piṃgalaṃ saptahastakam ||

trimekhalaṃ tripādañca saptajihvā samanvitam |
catuśśṛṃgaṃ vṛṣārūḍhaṃ bālāditya samaprabham ||

upavīta samāyuktaṃ jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam |
savyabhāge caturhastaṃ trihastamapasavyake ||

sruksruvau cākṣamālāñca śaktiṃ dakṣiṇato kare |
tomaraṃ vyajanañcaiva ghṛtapātrantu vāmake ||

hiraṇyā kanakā raktā kṛṣṇā caiva tu suprabhā |
atiraktā bahurūpā saptajihvā prakīrtitā ||

<p. 53>

hiraṇyādi catasrastu jihvā dakṣiṇa vastrake |
tisrastu suprabhādyāsyurjihvā vai vāmavaktrake ||

hiraṇyāvāruṇī jihvā kanakā madhyame sthitā |
raktā cottara jihvā syāt kṛṣṇā yāmyāṃ diśi sthitā ||

suprabhā pūrva jihvā syādatiraktānale sthitā |
bahurūpeśa jihvā syājjihvā sthānaṃ prakīrtitam ||

hiraṇyā śvetavarṇābhā kanakā raktavarṇikā |
raktā sā pītavarṇābhā kṛṣṇāyā dhūmravarṇakā ||

suprabhā kṛṣṇavarṇābhā atiraktāruṇa varṇakā |
bahurūpā śyāmavarṇā sā jihvā varṇaṃ prakīrtitam ||

śrotrāṇāmāhutiṃ kuryāt sarvavyādhibhayaṃ bhavet |
nāsikāyāṃ mahāpuṃkhaṃ cakṣuṣo sarvanāśanam ||

keśe tu daridratā caiva tajjihvāyāntu homayet |
yātraṃ kāṣṭhaṃ tathā śrotraṃ yātradhūmantu nāmikā ||

yātravajjvālanaṃ netra yātrabhasmantu tacchiram |
raktāyāṃ sarṣapaṃ hūyāt kṛṣṇāyāṃ lājahūyate ||

suprabhāyāmapūpānāṃ atiraktāṃ tilaṃ hunet |
siddhārthaṃ bahurūpāyāṃ sarvāsu carurucyate ||

śeṣadravyāṇi sarvāṇi kanakāyāntu hūyate |
anyajihvā sutaddhutvā sarvaṃ bhavati niṣkalaḥ ||

<p. 54>

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena tat tajjihvā suhūyate |
sruksruvau caturaṃgulaṃ vicchinnaṃ ghṛtamāhutiḥ ||

annamakṣa pramāṇaṃ syāt lājamuṣṭimitaṃ bhavet |
avataṃsa pradakṣiṇyāṃ ājyena juhuyāt tathā ||

sati yadvādaśāṃgulyaṃ ṣoḍaśena tu homayet |
ājyenāṣṭaśataṃ hutvā havistatsamameva vā ||

lājaṃ śatāṣṭakaṃ kṛtvā (************) |
yajñapātrañca bhūmiñca darbhakūrca munistathā ||

mānasī praṇitā jñeyā samidhā naiva śaktiṣu |
dinaṃ pratihutañcaiva atiraktā ca ṣaṭhayoḥ ||

saptabāhusvarūpā ca agnijihvā prakīrtitā |
hiraṇyameka jihvā ca gaganañca dvijihvikā ||

trijihvā raktavarṇañca kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ caturthakam |
pañcacaivātiraktā ca ṣaṣṭhayoḥ (************) |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ agnisvarūpaṃ nāma trayodaśa paṭalaḥ] || 
13 ||


mātṝṇāmarcanaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu tatvaṃ yathākramam |
ahardīpārcanaṃ vakṣye sarvapāpavināśanam ||

āyuḥ putra vivardhante dhanadhānya vivardhanam |
ārādhanavidhiṃ pūrvaṃ strīśūdrāṇāntu varjayet ||

<p. 55>

ārādhana viśeṣeṇa brāhmaṇādyādi varjitam |
pāraśava kule jāto devāgni gurupūjakaḥ ||

śaivācāravrato nityaṃ śāktacāroviśeṣataḥ |
āryadeśasamutpanno dīkṣitaścāpi sarvadā ||

vaidikaṃ tāntrikañcaiva devīnāmarcanā kramam |
yāmalokta prakāreṇa pratiṣṭhā homamārabhet ||

grāme vā nagare vāpi pattane keṭakepi vā |
ācāryaśśiṣyasaṃyuktassnānaṃ kuryād yathākramam ||

mantrasnānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā bhasmasnānaṃ tataḥ param |
uttarābhimukho bhūtvā snānakārye viśeṣataḥ ||

kālāgnimāditaḥ kṛtvā sadāśivaṃ tataḥ param |
virūpākṣaṃ japitvā tu kalpamantraṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

hṛdayañca śiraścaiva śikhā kavacameva ca |
netraṃ triṇetramastreṇa mantreṇa (**) yāmantu dhāriṇam ||

karanyāsaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā daśanyāsaṃ daśākṣaram |

samrā (**) guṃ samāpte mantrasnānaṃ praviśyati |
pātraśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā mātrapuṇyāha vācanam ||

sarvatra prokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā pañcagavyantu sādhayet |
arcayitvā tu pātreṣu pratimuñcāpi vāruṇam ||

<p. 56>

arcanantu sa pūjyena pādārghyācamanīyakam |
snānaṃ tatra tathā gandha dhūpadīpaṃ haviḥ kramam ||

prathamadvāra devīnāṃ pūjayitvā viśeṣataḥ |
rakṣohaṇīṃ balihīni purvāyāṃ dvārapālakau ||

sumukhī kāladaṇḍī ca dakṣiṇa dvārapālinī |
aditī muditī caiva paścimadvārapālinī ||

kalinī śuktakarṇī ca uttaradvārapālinī |
(************) ktaṃ pūrvadvārādīni pradakṣiṇam ||

pramodinīnāṃ pūrveṇa abhayī tathā |
saṃginī paścime caiva saṃhitī cottare tathā ||

vijayī raṃbhiṇī caiva ityete dvārayoginām |
gandhapuṣpaṃ tathā dhūpadīpañcaiva tu cārcayet ||

daṇḍakuṇḍodarī bhīmī kīḍī vijaya vidyayā |
vyālāmukhī tathā caiva rājadevī triṇetriṇī ||

nīlakeśī gatā caiva vāgīśvarī piśācinī |
iti vetāla bhūtāśca mātṝṇāmañjayastathā ||

svanāma ca praṇavādye pūjayitvā yathākramam |
pādau prakṣālya cācamya garbhagṛhaṃ praviśati ||

prathamaṃ vīrabhadraṃ ca mūlamantreṇa cārcayet |
brahmāṇī caiva sāvitrī mānastokā maheśvarī ||

<p. 57>

yujatiścaiva kaumārī idaṃ viṣṇuśca vaiṣṇavī |
mānastokā tu vārāhī indrāṇīndrabalā tathā ||

śanno devī ca cāmuṇḍī snānamantraṃ prakīrtitam |
śuklavāsaśca vīrañca brahmāṇī sitavāsasā ||

īśvarī śvetavāsāstu kumārī sindhūravāsasā |
vaiṣṇavī pītavāsāstu vārāhī kṛṣṇavāsasā ||

indrāṇi ca dukūlañca cāmuṇḍīraktavāsasā |
vighneśaṃ khaḍgavaṃsañca pratyekaṃ vastramucyate ||

mukhaṃ hariberañca brahmāṇī gandhamucyate |
īśvarīmāñca gaṇḍañca kaumārī kuṃkumaṃ tathā ||

vaiṣṇavī rājakasturī vārāhī tu niryāsakam |
ārdrameṣañca indrāṇi cāmuṇḍā raktacandanā ||

śakyacandana lepe tu vīravighnaṃ samāpayet |
ketakī jātipuṣpantu gaṇeśañca tathārcayet ||

karavīraṃ vīrabhadraṃ ca brahmāṇī śvetapadmakam |
śvetārkamīśvarī caiva kaumārī kumudantathā ||

vaiṣṇavī tulasī caiva vārāhī mallikā tathā |
jātipuṣpantu indrāṇī cāmuṇḍāraktapadmakam ||

gugguluṃ vīrabhadrañca śitārī ca caturmukhīm |
īśvarī agaruñcaiva kaumārī devadārukam ||

<p. 58>

vaiṣṇavī sūnadhūpañca pañca vārāhī ājya dhūpakam |
indrāṇī caiva niryāsaṃ cāmuṇḍī jātidhūpakam ||

vighneśamagaruñcaiva śitārī sarvadevatā |
gandhamantreṇa gandhañca puṣpamantreṇa puṣpakam ||

dhūpamantreṇa dhūpañca dīpamantreṇa dīpakam |
tat tadgāyatri mantreṇa tat tanmūlaṃ japet kramāt ||

tat tadbimbantu saṃpūjyamāvāhyābhyarcayet kramāt |
śuddhānnaṃ vīrabhadrasya vighneśañca nivedayet ||

brahmāṇī pāyasānnaṃ ca īśvarī kṛsarānnakam |
haridrānnañca kaumārī vaiṣṇavī ca gulānnakam ||

vārāhī caiva māṣānnāmindrāṇī mudgameva ca |
raktānnaṃ rudhirañcaiva cāmuṇḍyāstu nivedayet ||

naivedyamantramuccārya tat tadbherīṃ nivedayet |
ādyodyādi kramaṃ kuryāt vīramāśravaṇaṃ tathā ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ mātrarcanaṃ nāma caturdaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] 
|| 14 ||


vighneśaṃ vīrabhadrañca samidbilvaṃ tathocyate |
brahmāṇī ca palāśañca arkamāheśvarī tathā ||

audumbarantu kaumārī aśvatthaṃ vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī vṛkṣamevaṃ syāt indrāṇī khadirantathā ||

<p. 59>

nyagrodhañcaiva cāmuṇḍā samidhastatra kīrtitāḥ |
ūrdhvaṃ pṛdhak pṛdhak vāhye hūyate samidhantathā ||

eteṣāmapyalābhe tu palāśaṃ sarvahūyate |
ekaikanāmahūyante svanāmāvāhayet tathā ||

pādasyācamanīyādi snānamantraṃ yathārcayet |
gandapuṣpantathā dhūpandīpañcaiva haviḥ kramāt ||

geyādi tālasaṃyuktaṃ bahuvīrārcanaṃ bhavet |
sarvalokahitaṃ puṇyaṃ sarvadhānya samṛddhidam ||

duṣṭagrahavināśārthaṃ viśiṣṭāgrahameva ca |
sarveṣāmeva rakṣārthaṃ mātṛloke mahīyate ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ bahuvīrārcanavidhirnāma pañcādaśaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 15 ||


garuḍauvāca ||

namastubhyaṃ lokānāṃ jayakāraṇaṃ |
sarveṣāmeva lokānāṃ bhaya śāntivivakṣita ||

sarveṣāmeva bhūtānāṃ lokālokanibaṃddhanam |
tvayā ca pālitaṃ sarvaṃ prajānāṃ hitakāraṇa ||

rākṣasai paribhūyiṣṭhā tārakādiṣu tatvavit |

viṣṇuruvāca ||

sṛṣṭisthitiśca saṃhāra kāraṇaṃ trividhaṃ bhavet |
trividhaṃ lokasaṃsṛṣṭistrividhaṃ lokacāritam ||

<p. 60>

yajanaṃ caturvidhaṃ bhogaṃ prāṇināñca caturvidham |
caturvidhañca caritaṃ sarveṣāñca sukhāvaham ||

evamācaritaṃ lokaṃ brahmamantrasamudbhavam |
tātkālika paritrāṇaṃ rākṣasānāmupādhitaḥ ||

rākṣasānāṃ vadhārthāya navaśaktyādi bhedataḥ |
navaśaktyā navākārā lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā ||

yadbhuvaṃ nāśayet kartuṃ tadrūpaṃ tribhisaṃyutam |
tatkālena tu saṃrūḍhaṃ ghorarūpaṃ bhayaṃ bhavet ||

śaktīnāṃ nāśayogantaṃ (************) |
tasya śāntiṃ prakurvīta (************) śakti ||

(************) nāśayogamataḥ param |
tasya śāntiṃ prakurvīta tisrastāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

śakti śāntiṃ viśeṣeṇa mātṛśāntiṃ vidhīyate |
grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi pattanaṃ vāpi kārayet ||

tatra śāntiṃ viśeṣeṇa prajānāṃ hitakāraṇam |
mātṝṇāṃ sthāpayet tatra sarvabhūtasukhāvaham ||

grāme vā nagare vāpi uttare cālayaṃ bhavet |
prācyāmatha prakūrvīta pūrvadvārādibhiḥ kramāt ||

śilāmayaṃ lohamayaṃ maṇimadvṛkṣameva ca |
śilāmayaṃ mokṣakāmasya lohānāṃ kīrtivardhanam ||

<p. 61>

ratnānāṃ śrīkaraṃ kuryāt mṛṇmayaṃ śāntikaṃ bhavet |
prāsādagarbhamānena dvāramānaṃ tathaiva ca ||

athavā yajamānena daśatālakrameṣu ca |
pratiṣṭhāyāṃ viśeṣeṇa yajamānaṃ yathākramāt ||

sakalaṃ niṣkalañcaiva niṣkalaṃ vakulaṃ tathā |
mūlamantreṇa saṃyuktaṃ śaktimantreṇa vinyaset ||

tat tatkīrtiṃ pratiṣṭhāpya tat tad devantu bhāvayet |
gandhapuṣpaṃ tathā dhūpadīpañcaiva haviḥ kramāt ||

nivedyaṃ tatra vidhivadyathā śāstrakrameṇa tu |
pratiṣṭhotsavakarmāṇi yathālābhaṃ krameṇa tu ||

dhvajārohaṇa pūrve tu aṃkurārpaṇa karma ca |
ekaviṃśati nakṣatraṃ ṣoḍaśāhaṃ caturdaśa ||

dvādaśāhaṃ navāhaṃ vā dīkṣayen mātrakotsavam |
kujavārādi bhaumāntaṃ arkavārādi bhaumakam ||

somavārasya rātrau tu adhivāsamataḥ param |
