<p. 62>

purāyudhasamāyuktaṃ ṣaḍvargaṃ sahasaṃyutam |
śaktirvai toraṇairyuktaṃ sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam ||

tanmadhye balinikṣipya pañcāyudhasamanvitam |
putrakaścitrakaścaiva sahamudrāṃ prayojayet ||

brahmasthānaṃ viśeṣeṇa mudrāpīṭhaṃ prakalpayet |
prāsādapūrva bhāge tu yāgamaṇṭapamuttamam ||

madhye vedīṃ prakurvīta catustāla pramāṇataḥ |
ekatālasamuttheyaṃ pramāṇaṃ parikīrtitam ||

vṛttaṃ vā caturasraṃ vā agnikuṇḍaṃ yathākramam |
diśeṣu caturaśrantu videśe vṛttamuttamam ||

catuṣṣaṣṭistadardhañca ṣoḍaśañcāṣṭa homayet |
navāṃgahīnā na badhirā na śaṭhā na jalastathā ||

sarvāvayavasaṃyukta svarūpa priyadarśana |
mātṛdīkṣā ca saṃyuktassarvaśāstraviśāradaḥ ||

yāmalānāntu sarveṣā vācyavācakasaṃyutān |
sarvabhūtadayāyuktān mantratantra parāyaṇān ||

evantu lakṣaṇairyuktamācāryantu viśeṣataḥ |
devāgniṃ pūjayet pūrvaṃ īśānādi yathākramam ||

makuṭaṃ tatra khacitvā tu hastamātra pramāṇakam |
trivedīṃ tatra kurvīta caturaśraṃ samaṃ tathā ||

<p. 63>

catustridvyaṃgulaṃ kuryāt pramāṇaṃ tatra kārayet |
ācāryassādhakaścaiva samayī putrakastathā ||

kelake paricāreṇa śāntiṃ kuryād viśeṣataḥ |
devyāgni janitaḥ pūrva īśānyāṃ diśi yojayet ||

dakṣiṇe bhairavāgnistu pūrve vā ca tathaiva ca |
mayitvāgniṃ viśeṣeṇa śrotriyāgnimathāpi vā ||

athavā mantrasaṃskāramagnibīje samanvitam |
dravyādi viśvasaṃyuktaṃ mūlamantreṇa homayet ||

dravyahīnaṃ viparīte ca tadbhavet ||

dravyā (************) ca kriyāyā sahavartate |
prāyaścittaṃ prakurvīta (************) homayet ||

miyājya caruṃścaiva (****) saktutulastathā |
lājañca sarṣapañcaiva krameṇa vidhiyojayet ||

dravyānte paśusaṃskāra yojayet tu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
homaṃ tatra prakurvīta bhairavāgnimihocyate ||

śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikañcaiva ābhicārakameva ca |
śāntikaṃ yojayet tatra sṛṣṭinyāsaṃ prakīrtitam ||

pauṣṭikaṃ yojayet tatra sthitinyāsaṃ prakīrtitam |
ābhicārakasaṃyojya saṃhāranyāsamucyate ||

<p. 64>

sātvikārājasañcaiva tāmasīñca guṇatrayam |
sātvikaṃ sthāpanaṃ kālaṃ rājasaṃ śāntikarmaṇi ||

tāmasamābhicāreṇa krameṇa sahavartate |
kālañcaivāvakālantu śubhaṃ vā tvaśubhaṃ bhavet ||

dine muhūrte tatraiva yoge ca karaṇānvite |
sarvayogaṃ viśeṣeṇa bandhuyogaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

yatra yogakriyāyogaṃ tatra bhāgyamudāhṛtam |
vedādi ca manuṣyāṇāṃ buddhirbhavati niścalā ||

nirmalaṃ nispṛhasvaste nityāṃśāśvatamavyayam |
ārādhayetsasaṃbandhaḥ yogamokṣa karānvitam ||

sarvayogaphalañcaiva mātṛśāntiṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāmutsavavidhiṃ nāma ṣoḍaśa paṭalaḥ] || 16 
||


athāssaṃpravakṣyāmi ekavīryutsavaḥ param |
mahāśāntikaraṃ puṇyaṃ sarvapāpavināśanam ||

akālamṛtyuśamanamāyurārogyavardhanam |
subhikṣaṃ gobalañcaiva hastyaśvanaravardhanam ||

bhūmikaṃpavināśārthaṃ tathā pretavināśanam |
gṛhajāravināśārthaṃ bhūtadṛṣṭivināśanam ||

<p. 65>

rājasenā sukhārthañca sadasi jayameva ca |
mahāmāri prasaṃkīrṇe pāṣāṇe varṣantayā ||

ulkāpāte niśāndahe (****) tathaiva ca |
tarā pravātane caiva dīkṣāntena tathaiva ca ||

diśopi ca vane caiva mahāvāta pravartane |
durbhikṣe raṣṭrakalahe hastyaśvavyādhipīḍite ||

utsavaṃ kārayen mantrī śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
ekaviṃśed dine pūrve dundubhirbhramaṇaṃ kuru ||

dundubhirlakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye tadvarṣagrahaṇantathā |
(****) ñcavatālañcaśi (**) raktacandanam ||

saptāhaṃ tathā pūrve dundubhiḥ praharaṇe budhaḥ |
pūrvavatkārayetsarvaṃ yathāvidhi purassaram ||

tilacūrṇasamāyuktaṃ gulakhaṇḍasamanvitam |
kadalī phalasaṃyuktaṃ pūrikā khaṇḍasaṃyutam ||

evaṃ baliṃ tato dadyāt navākṣareṇa mantravit |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa kuṭhārañcābhi mantrayet ||

punaḥ prabhāte vimale śubhagrahasamanvitam |
astreṇa codayedvṛkṣaṃ bhakti yukto dṛḍhavrataḥ ||

sānte naiva tu mantreṇa kartavyaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam |
śilpinā tu kṛtā sarvaṃ dundubhiśca manoharā ||

<p. 66>

ṣaṭtālāya tathoktāni uttamaṃ tatra prakīrtitā |
daṇḍannāha saṃyuktaṃ paṃkajāsana saṃyutam ||

śubhadinasamāyuktaṃ cottamā dundubhiḥ śuciḥ |
catustālaṃ samārabhya madhyamā dundubhirbhavet ||

tadardhanāha saṃyukta tatvātmāsanasaṃyutam |
dvitālāyāmasaṃyuktaṃ tadardhannāha saṃyutam ||

athavā dundubhirjñeyā vaktrāsana saṃyutam |
dundubheruktamānañca tryaṃgulā bālanaṃ bhavet ||

dvyaṃgulaṃ bahulaṃ proktaṃ madhyamānañca kīrtitā |
dundubheradhamāyāmamekāṃgulamudāhṛtam ||

uttamā madhyamā caiva adhamā ca prakīrtitā |
evandundubhimutpādya balikāryaṃ samārabhet ||

mānayet śilpinaṃ paścāt vastraiśca candanādibhiḥ |
pariṇāhaṃ ca kuṇḍasya pūrvaṃ vai yojayedbudhaḥ ||

tryaṃgulaṃ dundubhiścaiva madhyamañcottamaṃ bhavet |
dvyaṃgulamadhamañcaiva dundubhiśca prakīrtitāḥ ||

kuṇḍalaṃ kanyasaṃ proktaṃ dundubhiścaiva cāṃgulam |
uttamādi krameṇaiva kuṇḍalaṃ procyate kramāt ||

dundubhiṃ chādayet tatra bhavāvai carmaṇā budhaḥ |
chādayau vaiddha kālaiśca dundubhiśca manoharā ||

<p. 67>

evaṃ dundubhimutpādya saghoṣa (************) |
