daśahasta pravistāra (*) tulāṃkuratobhitam |
tanmadhye vedikāyāntu tanmadhye maṇḍalaṃ kuru ||

śālibhistaṇḍulaṃ kuryāt aṣṭadroṇaiśca tat tathā |
taṇḍulaiśca tadardhaiśca tilaiḥ kuryād yathā kramam ||

pañcaikoktasūtrāṇi kārayet taṇḍulopari |
sūtrāṇi kārayet samyag yathāvidhi purassaram ||

ekaikāntaritastasmin ekaścaiva padā hunet |
śobhitaśca tilai (****) koṣṭheṣu vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

dundubhiṃ vinyaset padme navākṣareṇaiva buddhimān |
kalaśān vinyaset tatra sūtreṇaiva viceṣṭitān ||

kalaśānaṣṭau tu vinyasya śuddhagandhodakānvitān |
madhye tu vinyaset brahman pañcaratnaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

ekavīraṃ nyaset tasmin navākṣareṇa buddhimān |
aṣṭadikṣu nyaset kuṃbhān navākṣareṇa buddhimān ||

cūtapallavasaṃyuktān gandhacandanamanvitām |
agnikāryaṃ tathā kuryāt yathāvidhi purassaram ||

<p. 68>

ekavīryārcana sahita saptanyaset budhaḥ |
vīrabhadrādisaṃyuktaṃ gaṇeśānasamanvitam ||

dakṣiṇe caiva vedyāṃ vā agnikāryañca kārayet |
(śuklapakṣe tu śānti śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||)

agnikāryaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā prokṣayet (****) punaḥ |
dundubhiṃ tatra vinyasya tataḥ prabhṛttiṃ yojayet ||

īdṛgbhūtamanojñāñca dundubhiñca samāharet |
śuklapakṣe tu śāntī śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktā sarvābharaṇabhuṣitā |
ekavīrañca paramāṃ haṃsārūḍhāṃ manoharām ||

navarūpāṃ muktakeśīmekavīrī manusmaran |
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ manojñā lakṣaṇānvitā ||

dundubhiṃ praharedvāpi navākṣareṇa buddhimān |
kṛtayugermared devimekavīriṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

brahmāṇāṃ paramāṃ śuddhāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
īdṛgbhūtāṃ parāṃ dhyātvā dundubhiṃ tāḍayet punaḥ ||

navākṣareṇa saṃtāḍya devīṃ dhyātvā tu tatparam |
evaṃ saṃtāḍya yatnena utsavaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ ||

ekavīryā (**) brahma dundubhiṃ tāḍayet kramāt |
dundubhestāḍanaṃ vakṣye yathāvidhi purassaram ||

<p. 69>

devyālayaṃ purastāttu maṇḍapaṃ caturaśrakam |
gomayena samālipya sitacūrṇena śobhitam ||

maṇṭape caturaśrantu dvihastāyāmasaṃyute |
śālibhiścāṣṭabhi droṇairmaṇḍape sthaṇḍilaṃ kuru ||

sūtrāṇi kārayet tatra taṇḍulena vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pañcottarāṇi sūtrāṇi cottarāṇi mukhāni ca ||

dakṣe tathaiva sūtrāṇi sūtrayet tatra vittamaḥ |
sadarbhaistaṇḍilaiśśubhraiḥ vikiret tu samaṃ tathā ||

ekaikāntaritaṃ koṣṭhaṃ caturdikṣu haret punaḥ |
navapadeṣu padmaṃ syāt aṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

tilāḍhakena vā likhyamaṣṭapatradalānvitam |
karṇikā kesaropetaṃ caturgātrasamāyutam ||

navākṣareṇa japtena vastrapūtena vāriṇā |
prokṣya ca taṇḍulaṃ paścāt dravyāṇi prokṣayed budhaḥ ||

āsanaṃ kalpayitvā tu gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt |
devyāstu dundubhintatra nyastvā saṃpūjya ca kramāt ||

raktasūdagandhapuṣpadhūpadīpa samanvitam |
raktavastre tu paridhānaṃ raktacandana carcitam ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ mātṝṇāmutsavepi ca |
ekavīraṃ tadāvāhya ekavīrañca deśikaḥ ||

<p. 70>

āvāhayet tato devīṃ kalaśeśaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
kalaśasya dakṣiṇe bhāge dundubhiñcāpi vāsayet ||

tasyaiva dakṣiṇe bhāge homaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
tasminnadhivāsayed devamācāryaṃ mantravigraham ||

prabhāte vimalādevīṃ kalaśasya ca deśikaḥ |
nivedyantu pradātavyaṃ naktacārīḍakena tu ||

kalaśāya niveditvā yathā codbhavameva ca |
evaṃ kṛtvā samāsena dhvajārohaṇa tatkṣaṇāt ||

nagare pattane vāpi grāmaṃ grāmāgrake pure |
kheṭake ca tathā brahman āśīrvādaṃ samuccaran ||

antarikṣe tu ye devā bhūpātāleṣu ye sthitā |
parvatāgreṣu ye devā mahāmerau ca saṃsthitā ||

navakhaṇḍeṣu ye devā samudrādhivāsinastathā |
pādamārge ca ye devā saptadvīpeṣu ye sthitā ||

yoginī śākinī caiva ḍaṃbhinī ca vilāsinī |
cāriṇī maghavāsi ca ganībhakta parāyaṇī ||

catuṣṣaṣṭistathā devā upavāsaparāyaṇā |
aṃbubhakṣāśca ye devā vāyubhakṣāśca ye sthitā ||

utsave ekavīryāśca vāgacchantu manoharā |
evamuktaṃ krameṇaiva dundubhestāḍanaṃ kuru ||

<p. 71>

śatakoṭi sahasrāṇi pretavetālakāstathā |
āyuṣmikasahasrāṇi piśācāyāstu jātayaḥ ||

āgachantu mahādeva ekavīryutsave śubhe |
nānākoṭi sahasrāṇi ye śiṣṭā siddhajātayaḥ ||

aṣṭakoṭi sahasrāṇi aṣṭakoṭi piśācakā |
aṣṭakoṭi gaṇāssarve āgachantu mahotsave ||

ekavīryutsave śubhre saptakoṭi śatāni ca |
ayutañcaiva pañcāśīnmātṛbhedāśca ye sthitā ||

āgachantu mahādevya ekavīryutsave pare |
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca dvādaśāditya eva ca ||

vasvaṣṭāpsarasañcaiva munaye deva parvata |
brahmādi samagāpīyat tathā cendrasamāmatāḥ ||

ete cānye ca bahavo ekavīryutsave pare |
āgachantu mahāśīghramekavīryutsavārthakam ||

indrāgniśca yamaścaiva nir(-)ṛtī varuṇastathā |
vāyuścaiva kuberāśca īśānaścaiva eva hi ||

āgachantu mahādevya ekavīryutsave śubhe |
asurāśca surāścaiva gandharvāśca piśācakāḥ ||

yakṣāśca garuḍāścaiva kinnarāśca marudgaṇāḥ |
āgachantu mahādeva ekavīryutsave śubhe ||

<p. 72>

nāgāśca bhūtavetāla brahmarākṣasa eva ca |
anekaśobhā saṃyukte grahadhvaja samākule ||

pūrṇakuṃbhasamāyukte kadalī toraṇairyute |
dhūpadīpasamāyukte divyavīthi samanvite ||

sadāsī gaṇasaṃkīrṇe sakīrṇe yo vīthī mātṛśobhite |
nṛttagītasamāyukte divyastrī pariśobhite ||

āhṛtenagare caiva pattane kheṭake tathā |
grāme grāmāgrake caiva ekavīryutsavaṃ prati ||

purogāścaiva he devā āgachantu yathāvaham |
baligrāhantu vassarve yathāvidhi viśeṣataḥ ||

kadalyodanasaṃyuktamajanāḍī śataṃ yutam |
pūrikhaṇḍāgrasaṃyuktaṃ ajānāṃ rudhiraṃ yutam ||

matsyamāṃsasamāyuktaṃ apūpakhaṇḍamanvitam |
tilacūrṇasamāyuktaṃ lājasaktu samanvitam ||

dundubhirbhramaṇe kāle baliṃ sarvatra kārayet |
dundubheśca baliṃ dadyāt ajasapta ca pātaye ||

grāmavīthi pathe caiva daśadikṣu baliṃ haret |
ācāryaṃ pūjayet tatra vastra hemāṃgulīyakaiḥ ||

naikābharaṇajālaiśca gobhūmikāñcanādibhiḥ |
pūjayet tu viśeṣeṇa ācāryastu viśeṣataḥ ||

<p. 73>

mātṛdīkṣā samāyuktaṃ abhiṣeka trayānvitam |
evaṃ saṃpūjya taṃ brahman bhaktiyuktaṃ dṛḍhavratam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa sarvakṣetra baliṃ kṣipet |
asmatamravyeyatamraṃ sarvakāryeṣu yojayet ||

kalaśantu triśulañca ghaṇṭāḍamarukantathā |
mātṛghoṣasamāyuktaṃ divyastrībhissamākulam ||

vitānadhvajasaṃyuktaṃ dharajālasamanvitam |
kṣurikā khaḍgasaṃyuktaṃ sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam ||

grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi pattanañca purañca vā |
grāmaṃ nagarake vāpi dundubheḥ praharaṃ kuru ||

aṣṭadikṣu catusandhau brahmasthāne viśeṣataḥ |
pūrvoktāścaiva ye devā tattatsthāneṣu yojayet ||

pūrvoktañca baliñcaiva tattatsthāne tu dāpayet |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa svanāmapadasaṃyutam ||

baliñca dāpayet tatra daśadikṣu yathākramam |
ekavṛkṣe ca prāsāde catuṣpatre śṛṃkhalānvite ||

tripathe dvipathe caiva sarvasandhiṣu nikṣipet |
vāpī kūpataṭāke ca puradvāre baliṃ haret ||

śmaśāne balidānañca hastakṛte baliṃ kṣipet |
evaṃ samāsataḥ proktaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇantu dundubhiḥ ||

<p. 74>

pīṭhaṃ tatra prakartavyaṃ śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
catuśśṛṃgaṃ bhaved dikṣu ekahastasamanvitam ||

vidikṣu vartulaṃ kuryāt lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
hastāndhikamugrataḥ proktaṃ mekhalātrayasaṃyutam ||

brahmasthāne caturhastaṃ tadardhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet |
mekhalātrayasaṃyuktaṃ kāraṇena samanvitam ||

nagaradvāradeśe tu sāśrañca pīṭhamucyate |
devālayānāṃ purataḥ pīṭhaṃ vai caturaśrakam ||

pūrvavat kārayet pīṭha lakṣaṇenasamanvitam |
evaṃ pīṭhaṃ prakartavyaṃ daśadikṣu yathākramam ||

evaṃ saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ dundubhiḥ bharmaṇaṃ param |
devānāmāgamārthañca bhūmidānaṃ tathaiva ca ||

baliñca nikṣiped brahman yāvad deva vratāntakam |
pūrvoktañca baliṃ teṣu pīṭheṣu ca vinikṣipet ||

navākṣareṇa matimān ekavṛkṣabaliṃ dadet |
grāme ca nagare caiva pattanaṃ kheṭakaṃ tathā ||

utsavabhrama kālosi yātrāhomantu kārayet ||

[iti brahmayāmale utsavavidhāne dundubhiḥ praharaṇaṃ nāma saptadaśapaṭalaḥ] || 
17 ||


<p. 75>

mātṛśānti vidhiṃ vakṣye sarvaśāntikaraṃ śubham |
sarvavyādhiharaṃ śubhraṃ sadāvijayavardhanam ||

akālamṛtyuśamanaṃ putrapautrādi vardhanam |
mahāvighnapraśamanaṃ mahāśāntikaraṃ param ||

saptāha tritaye pūrve utsava prahed budhaḥ |
taddine cārdharātre tu dundubhestu paribhrame ||

brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca sadāśiva śivastathā |
vasubhiścāṣṭabhiścaiva dvādaśāditya eva ca ||

rudra ekādaśassarve arcayitvā samanvitān |
indrāgniśca yamaścaiva nir(-)ṛtī varuṇa vāyavaḥ ||

someśānagaṇāssarve āgachantu mahotsave |
śuciṣṭā ca piśācāśca bhūtavetāla jātayaḥ ||

kūśmāṇḍaguhyakā nāgā siddhā yakṣāmarudgaṇāḥ |
vidyādharāśca gandharvā āgachantu mahotsavam ||

bhūloke ca yathā deva bhuvarloke ca devatā |
svarloke ca ye deva maharloke ca devatā ||

janaloke ca ye devā tapo loke ca devatā |
satyaloke ca ye devā āgacchantu mahotsavam ||

atalādiṣu pātāle āgacchantu mahotsavam |
divyantarikṣa ye devā bhūpātālepi ye sthitā ||

<p. 76>

āgachantu ca ye devā ekavīryutsavārthakam |
girikandaradurgeṣu śmaśāne vana devatā ||

prāsāde garbhagehe vā prākāre parivārake |
gopurābhyantare devā āgachantu mahotsavam ||

dundubhiṃ prahared devīṃ tadrātrau balidāpayet |
dhvajamāropayeddhīmān daśvihantaṃ dinepi vā ||

saptāhe ca tathā kuryāt mūlamantreṇa dāpayet |
candanaṃ campakañcaiva kramukanālikerakam ||

yājñikaṃ veṇudaṇḍaṃ vā prāsādadviguṇocchrayam |
pañcadaṇḍāśca purataya dhvajānāṃ vidhīyate ||

utsavasya tu pūrve tu saptārthe maṃgalāṃkuram |
balibhramaṇavelāyāṃ vāmamārgeṇa gamyatām ||

ehikāmādri phaladaṃ baliṃ sarvatra dāpayet |
śāntyartha sarvamārgeṇa apasavyena puṣṭidam ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena vāmamārgeṇa gamyatām |
pālikā ghaṭikā caiva śarāvā trividhā bhavet ||

pratyekaṃ nava gṛhṇīyāt sapte vātha samācaret |
tilasarṣapamudgāni yavamāṣa kulutthakam ||

priyaṃguśimamālī ca nava bījaistu |
navākṣareṇa matimān sajapatvā tu samāhitam ||

<p. 77>

tāmbulandāpayet tatra sarvebhyaśca yathākramam |
āṣāḍhe kṛṣṇapakṣe va aṣṭamyāntu viśeṣataḥ ||

utsavaṃ kārayet samyak pūjayet tu sadeśikaḥ |
trikālaṃ vā dvikālaṃ vā balibhramaṇayorapi ||

tasya vāmena mārgeṇa balibhramaṇakaṃ kramāt |
prathamaṃ brāhidivasaṃ dvitīyamīśvarīṃ viduḥ ||

trayakaumāri divasaṃ caturthaṃ vaiṣṇavī tathā |
pañcamī pañcadivasaṃ ṣaṣṭhīmindrāṇireva ca ||

saptamaṃ bhadrakālī ca divasaṃ balimucyate |
śatadroṇi tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakam ||

ṣaṣṭhadroṇamathā caiva caturdroṇamathāpi vā |
dvayadroṇamathā caiva kanyasaṃ śivameva ca ||

āḍhakenaiva vāsiddhaṃ śālitaṇḍulasiddhakam |
śvetapadmasamāyuktaṃ gandhokasamanvitam ||

pāyasena baliṃ dadyāt brahmāṇī divase budhaḥ |
śvetārka kusumairyuktaṃ kṛsarānnantu saṃyutam ||

balimetadvijānīyānmāhegrī divasaṃ kramāt |
kumudotpalapuṣpantu haridrānnasudodakaiḥ ||

kaumārī divase kuryāt ekacitto sadā dadet |
vaiṣṇavī tulasī caiva gulānnantu baliṃ dadet ||

<p. 78>

mañjikāmāṣamannaṃ ca vārāhī divase yutam |
jātipuṣpantu mudgānnaṃ indrāṇī balimucyate ||

raktapaṃkajasaṃyuktaṃ raktānnaṃ raktamiśrakam |
cāmuṇḍī divase kuryāt vidvānmantreṇa mantritam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa tattannāma samanvitam |
tat tad dine baliṃ dadyāt tat tanmudrāṃ pradarśayet ||

catuṣpathe tripathe ca dvipathaika padandadet |
nava pīṭhe ca dātavyaṃ grāmadvāre tathaiva ca ||

ekavṛkṣe taṭāke ca prākāre dīrghikeṣu ca |
śivālaye sabhāsthāne viṣṇusthāne ca dāpayet ||

durgājyeṣṭhālaye caiva āryasthāne tathaiva ca |
śrīsthāne skandasthāne ca vighnasthāne viśeṣataḥ ||

bauddhasthānantu kartavyaṃ arhasthāne tathaiva ca |
indrāgni yamasthāne nir(-)ṛti varuṇa vāyavaḥ ||

someśānake caiva kramād datvā baliṃ dadet |
kanyāyāṃ darśane caiva brāhmaṇānāntu darśayet ||

bhinnanāsikayaścaiva cakravākastathaiva ca |
atra cevetarādevya dūtyaścaiva sa yoginīm ||

etānnadṛṣṭamātreṇa baliṃ sarvatra dāpayet |
paribhramaṇavelāyāṃ mudrānṛttaṃ samācaret ||

<p. 79>

tat tad dineṣu kartavyaṃ tat tanmudrāṃ samācaret |
anyathā kārayed yastu vyādhiśokabhayaṃ bhavet ||

brahmāṇī divase kuryāt brahmāṇī krīḍameva ca |
māheśī divase caiva māheśī krīḍameva ca ||

kaumārī tad dine caiva tat krīḍānāṃ samācaret |
vaiṣṇavī dinamevantu vaiṣṇavī krīḍamucyate ||

vārāhī divasenaiva vārāhī krīḍameva ca |
indrāṇī divase kuryāt indrāṇī krīḍakārayet ||

cāmuṇḍī divase kuryāt cāmuṇḍī krīḍakārayet |
ekavīrīṃ tataḥ kṛtvā kāmarudrāntu kārayet ||

kailāsamudrayā kuryāt caṇḍikāmudrayā kuru |
tat tad deva na vā kuryāt mudrā nṛttaṃ yathā kramam ||

mudrā nṛttaṃ tu kartavyaṃ hāsanakrīḍanādiśet |
mudrānṛttaṃ viśeṣeṇa kārayet sarvayatnataḥ ||

nṛttakastu śivaṃ proktaṃ pāṭhakastu pitāmahaḥ |
prekṣaṃ bhadrakālādi tasmāt tu putrakastathā ||

(************) caiva tasmāt pādaśivasmṛtaḥ |
śivapāde samutpannaṃ tena pādapa ucyate ||

sarvaśāntisthitānyatra mudrānṛttaṃ tu kārayet |
grāmamadhye prakartavyaṃ mahāmudrāṃ samācaret ||

<p. 80>

subhikṣaṃ kṣetramārogyaṃ putrapautra vivardhanam |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena grāmamadhyeṣu kārayet ||

mudrālakṣaṇamevoktaṃ ayāgamadhunā śṛṇu |
karakañcākṣamālā ca brahmāṇī cāṃgamudrayā ||

hariṇaṃ paraśuñcaiva māheśī cāṃgamudrayā |
vajraśakti dharañcaiva kaumārī cāṃgamudrayā ||

śaṃkhacakradharañcaiva vaiṣṇavī cāṃgamudrayā |
halañca musalañcaiva vārāhī cāṃgamudrayā ||

vajraśakti dharañcaiva indrāṇī cāṃgamudrayā |
śūlakhaḍgadharañcaiva kaṭvāṃgaṃ nāgapāśakam ||

keṭakañca kapālañca ghaṇṭā ḍamarukaṃ tathā |
aṃgantu caṃḍikānāntu idānīṃ śṛṇumudrikām ||

nṛttakāle prayoktavyaṃ eṣāṃ sarvātmanā budhaḥ |
lohena kārayet sarvaṃ matsavāṃga yathākramam ||

pañcaraṃga triraṃgaṃ vā ekaraṃgamathāpi vā |
strīṇāṃ nṛttaṃ prakartavyaṃ geyavādya samāyutam ||

rathe vā kūṭayantreṇa pratimā saptadāpayet |
haṃsokṣahañca gāruḍhaṃ harināgapiśācakam ||

svasvenāyudha mukhyeṣu pārśve sthāpya viśeṣataḥ |
pratyekaṃ kūṭayantraṃ sthāpayetsusamāhitaḥ ||

<p. 81>

navanāṭya baliñcaiva yatpustvāstu gamyatām |
naityakūṭabaliñcaiva dharme dhvajasamāyutam ||

kṣarikā pāṇinassarve tatpurastāt tu gamyatām |
devyā dhvajāntare yastu mārgocchedaṃ yathā bhavet ||

gajaṃ vā turagaṃ vāpi uṣṭravo mahiṣantu vā |
narāṇāmaruṇañcaiva vanasūkaramāvikam ||

kukkuṭāśca navānāntu cheditaṃ devatā purā |
tanmārge yadi chedaṃ syāt navahatyā sadā budhaḥ ||

havikalpena bhāve tu hutvā devānnivedayet |
brāhmaṇākṣatriyā vaiśyā striyāmannaṃ sabhairavam ||

tanmārga yadi chedaṃ syāddhantavyaṃ śāstravittakaiḥ |
bauddhamārṣataṃ vāpi saṃnyāsa vratadhāriṇaṃ ||

śaivaṃ pāśupataṃ vāpi iti (yadi) mārgantu laṃghayet |
namaskṛtvā vidhānena kartavyantu sadā budhaḥ ||

evaṃ paribhrame grāme nagare pattanepi vā |
nagare kuñjare vāpi tīrthe vāpi samāhitaḥ ||

nānā janasamāyuktaṃ nānākrīḍasamanvitam |
nānā kuhaka saṃyuktaṃ nānāvidyā samāyutam ||

nānā citrasamāyuktaṃ nānāvidha samākulam |
nānādhvaja samāyuktaṃ nānāyogini saṃkaram ||

<p. 82>

nānābrāhmaṇa saṃyuktaṃ nānāmeṣasamākulam |
nānāgajasamāyuktaṃ nānāturagasaṃyutam ||

nānārājasamāyuktaṃ nānāśāstrasamākulam |
ekāhaṃ tryahañcaiva pañcāhe saptame dine ||

evaṃ devyāstu caivoktaṃ navāhaṃ vāpi kārayet |
athavā ṣoḍaśāhaṃ vā māsamekantu kārayet ||

balibhramaṇavelāyāṃ yātrāhomantu kārayet |
apāmārgasamidbhistu aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutam ||

ājyenāṣṭaraśataṃ hutvā tvaṣṭaśataṃ hutam |
aṣṭame divase rātrau rakṣāṃ kṛtvā tu baṃddhayet ||

ācāryaṃ pūjayet tatra ajaṃ vā mahiṣantu vā |
ajaṃ vinda paśuṃ vāpi pratisaraṃ bandhayet tathā ||

tatpaścāt pañcaviṃśairvā saptacācaikameva vā |
paśuṃ nibaṃddhayet sūtraṃ raktasūtraṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

tatrādau jāgaraṃ vāpi grahe vā ālaye budhaḥ |
kalaśaṃ sthāpayet tatra raktavastreṇa veṣṭayet ||

kalaśe vāmabhāge tu rakṣāsūtraṃ nyased budhaḥ |
śālimadhye nyaset sarvamekaikaṃ pañcadroṇakam ||

tadardhaṃ taṇḍulaṃ grāhyaṃ padmamaṣṭadale nyaset |
sūtraṃ navākṣaraṃ nyasya tacchakti kalaśaṃ tathā ||

<p. 83>

kalaśodakena saṃspṛśya sūtreṇaiva tu bandhayet |
bandhayitvā tu sūtraṃ vā paśunā rakṣayed budhaḥ ||

prāsāde tu baliṃ dadyāt pūrvokta vidhinā budhaḥ |
ikṣukhaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ raktatoya samanvitam ||

madhyāhne dāpayet tatra sarva dikṣu yathākramam |
ātape tu paśuṃ hatvā yathāvidhitunu kramāt ||

raktaṃ vai māṃsakhaṇḍañca tad devyāntu nivedayet |
evaṃ śāntividhiṃ proktaṃ paścāt paśuvidhirbhavet ||

[iti brahmayāmale vidyāpīṭhāvatārite pratiṣṭhātantre ekāśīti vidhānāṃge 
mātṛśāntividhiṃ nāma aṣṭādaśapaṭalaḥ] || 18 ||


paśuvidhiṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvakāmārthasādhanam |
gajaṃ vā turagaṃ vāpi uṣṭraṃ vā mahiṣantu vā ||

kṛte tu gajamevoktaṃ tretāyāmahamucyate |
dvāpare uṣṭramevoktaṃ kalau mahiṣameva ca ||

mahiṣālābhe janiṃ prāktaṃ ajālābhe tu pauṣṭikam |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇa śubhalakṣaṇa rakṣitam ||

surūpavandhyā praśastāstu māṃ peśalamuttamam |
śṛṃgahīne tu varjitvā karṇahīne tu varjayet ||

nāsihīnai tathā caiva arahīne tu varjayet |
paśūnāñca śithile puchrahīne tathaiva ca ||

<p. 84>

ativṛddhamati bāla kṛśaṃ varjaṃ sadā budhaḥ |
śṛṃgahīnantu durbhikṣaṃ badhiraṃ kuṇḍahīnake ||

mukhanāsika hīne tu durbhikṣaṃ kalahaṃ bhavet |
khurahīne prāṇināśaṃ paṃkunā paṃkujanmanaḥ ||

kāṇe kāṇatvamāpnoti tathāgre kukṣirogakam |
pucchahīne ca dāridryaṃ ativṛddhiṃ mṛtirbhavet ||

bālā pañcavarṣe tu madhyamā |
saptavarṣā bhaved vṛddhā tadūrdhvamatimṛddhidā ||

etān parīkṣya yatnena sapaśuṃ śodhayed budhaḥ |
pāyasaṃ snāpayet pūrvaṃ dadhinā tu tathaiva ca ||

snāpayitvā ghṛtenaiva snāpyatā taṃbunābudhaḥ |
gandhāmbu snāpayet paścāt gandhapuṣpādinārcayet ||

arghyapādyācamanīyañca pañcaratnāmbujā budhaḥ |
mātresotkṛtāṃ sṛṣṭvā spṛṣṭvā spṛṣṭvā tu deśikaḥ ||

akārādikṣakārāntaṃ saptavargaṃ kramān nyaset |
śiro phālabhruvau kīrṇe netre nāsikapālayoḥ ||

oṣṭhayordantapaṃktau ca jihvā ca cibukaṃ tathā |
yeṣu tenaiva sarveṣu avargaṃ vinyaset punaḥ ||

kaṇṭhe grīve tathā skandhe vārau hṛdi viśeṣataḥ |
kavargaṃ vinyasenmantrī eṣu sthāneṣu pūrvavat ||

<p. 85>

cavargā ca ṭavargā ca catuṣpādeṣu vinyaset |
śṛṃgayonyati pṛṣṭhau ca guhyasthānastaneṣu ca ||

nāse pucchāgra pāne ca kakutsthāne nyaset kramāt |
sāsramṛtsamedosthi majjaśuklādi dhātuṣu ||

īrute aśrake caiva navabījaṃ kramān nyaset |
payasā vinyaset paścāt huṃkāraṃ sarvavinyaset ||

śṛṃgayo brahmaviṣṇuśca rudrassadāśivastathā |
vasavaścāṣṭabhiścaiva rudramekādaśādi ca ||

āditya dvādaśaproktā aśvinau dvau prakīrtitau |
brāhmaṃ māheśvarī sandhyā yajñāya vāsu (****) ||

(**) ttikaralī caṇḍamaheśāṣṭākramaṇaset |
vāmadevī ca rudrī ca jyeṣṭhī kālā tathaiva ca ||

kalavikaraṇī caiva balavikaraṇī tathā |
balapramathinī sarvabhūtadamanonmanī ||

śirādra pādayoścaiva kramādvinyasya devatā |
gandhodakaṃ tato dadyāt navākṣareṇa buddhimān ||

vastre yugme saṃpūjya praṇavena tu dāpayet |
hārañca kaṭisūtrañca kuṇḍalaṃ makuṭaṃ tathā ||

nivedyaṃ dāpayenmantrī śvetapītañca kṛṣṇakam |
karṇe mantraṃ videnmantrī navākṣarasakṛt sakṛt ||

<p. 86>

pādasthāne khanet kūpaṃ tatra sthāpya paśuṃ budhaḥ |
āgacha padaṃ tatraiva tatra sthāpya paśuṃ budhaḥ ||

devyācābhimukhe sthāpya caturdaṇḍī tadantare |
bilvaṃ vā khadiraṃ vāpi pañcahastaṃ pramāṇataḥ ||

ṣoḍaśāṃgulanāhantu agre padmākṛtirbhavet |
patraṃ karṇikāyuktaṃ syāt yatnākāraṃ samaṃ tathā ||

sūpaṃ saṃsthāpayet tatra devyāścaiva purākṛtam |
paśuṃ saṃveṣṭayet tatra balarajāti saṃyutam ||

nālikerastu carmantu yantrayitvā tu rajjubhiḥ |
kaniṣṭhāṃgula parīṇāṃhaṃtrīrāvṛtti krameṇa tu ||

nicchindreṃvajayet tatra nāgapāśamanusmaran |
kuśavajrasamāyuktaṃ sāpakaṃ viratairyukam ||

vidvān saṃsṛṣṭamātreṇa annaṃ pāñcamarujjakaiḥ |
savyāpasavyamātreṇa krāmayitvā tu sāpakam ||

paścāt khaḍgaṃ gṛhītvā tu khaḍgaśāstravicārakaḥ |
khaḍgadevāsure lakṣmī padme brāhmaṇadevatā ||

ghaṇṭāyā vighnadaivatvaṃ śuddhāśe viṣṇudaivatam |
kaṭikāskanda daivatyaṃ yārayoścandrasūryayoḥ ||

madhyame rudradaivatyaṃ agre saṃhārakālikām |
ityantu khaḍgadaivatyaṃ pūjayet khaḍgadevatām ||

<p. 87>

oṃ khaṃ khaḍgāya śatrasaṃhārāya namaḥ |
paśūnāṃ sarvakarṇe tu jīvanmukteti mantrataḥ ||

oṃ paśujīva muktiprade devī sāyujya dehaṃ svāhā |
ekena prahareṇaiva grīvāścedaviśāradaḥ ||

śatamardhaṃ tadardhaṃ vā cottamantu praśasyate |
mahābali prakāreṇa vadhaṃ pīṭhe baliṃ kṣipet ||

tadbhāgaṃ prokṣayitvā tu gandhādīnāṃ tu pūjayet |
vastrayugmena saṃpūjya svarūpapriyadarśanam ||

yathālābho paśuṃ chitvā tathā lābho phalaṃ bhavet |
tatpaśuṃ jīvamuktantu sadyassāyujyamāpnuyāt ||

ityete balimuddiśya kartṝṇāntu phalaṃ śṛṇu |
sarvasaṃpatkaraṃ bhadraṃ jayadaṃ sarva siddhidam ||

romaromeṣu kalpaṃ vā svargaloke mahīyate |
sarvaroma samāpteṣu paścāt sāyujyamāpnuyāt ||

brāhmaṇādi krameṇaiva paśuṃ hatvā viśeṣataḥ |
anyeṣāñcaiva jātīnāṃ paśucchedaṃ na kārayet ||

chedane caiva tatraiva rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati |
prāyaścittaṃ prakurvīta punaśśāntiṃ samārabhet ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇaṃ sarvāvayavaśobhitam |
evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ taṃbhadachedayetpunaḥ ||

<p. 88>

grīve tu praharenmantrī tadraktaṃ vinivedayet |
vasandṛṣṭyā bhavet tatra prāyaścittaṃ samācaret ||

punaḥ paśuṃ hunettatra udāpūrvamūdīrakam |
homaṃ kṛtvā tu mantrajñastaddoṣaśamanāya ca ||

maṇḍalaṃ kārayet tatra tribhirvarṇairlikhed budhaḥ |
caturaśraṃ bārhyato likhya śūlenaiva subhūṣitam ||

madhye padmaṃ samālikhya aṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam |
mātṛn vai pūjayet tatra gandhapuṣpañca dhūpakaiḥ ||

kalaśaṃ navakaṃ sthāpya sāpidhānaṃ sakūrcakam |
saṃjñārakta samāyuktaṃ navākṣareṇa mantritān ||

vyomaṃ pāraśavaṃ kṛtvā catvastu caturdaśī |
mātṛdīkṣā kramañcaiva paraṃ paryāyameva ca ||

anyatkarṇa na kartavyaṃ yāmalācārasaṃyutam |
samayī putrakaścaiva sādhakācārya eva ca ||

citrakaṃ pāraśaiva syāt putrakāṇāṃ śivadvijaḥ |
mātṛdīkṣā samāyuktaṃ caturvarṇantu yośrakam ||

ādau pāraśavāścaiva nityaṃ devyāstu pūjakāḥ |
dīkṣitā karmayogyānāṃ pāraśaiva viśeṣataḥ ||

brāhmaṇān śūdrakanyāyāmmantrayuktena saṃgrahaḥ |
jātastayośca jātyādāvaśaktaḥ pāraśavastathā ||

<p. 89>

ṣoḍaśa kriyayā yuktaṃ sarvasaṃskārasaṃyutam |
mātṛdīkṣā ca kartavyaṃ janmāpāraśavasmṛtaḥ ||

anyeṣāñcaiva yogyānāṃ sarveṣāntu viśeṣataḥ |
na dīkṣitaśca yatkarmaṃ tatkarmaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena pāraśaiva na pūjanam |
homaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣeṇa caturdikṣu samaṃ tathā ||

raktā karālī caṇḍākṣī mahocchiṣṭā pṛthak pṛthak |
khadirāśvattha bilvañca vaṭaścaiva caturdiśam ||

pṛthagaṣṭottaraśataṃ brahmā vai tvekaviṃśati |
samidhājya caruṃ lājaṃ sarṣapañca yavantilam ||

mudgañca vaiṇavañcaiva śrī patraṃ kadalīphalam |
tat tan mantreṇa hotavyaṃ caturdikṣu yathākramam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa samiddravyeṇa homayet |
kulavidyā vidhānena paścād grāma parigrahe ||

saptāhe tridine vāpi kārayedutsavaṃ kramāt |
athavā ekarātraṃ vā grāme samyak paribhramet ||

bhramaṇānte viśeṣeṇa pūrvokta vidhinā hunet |
pūrvaṃ padmavidhi kṛtvā snapanaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ ||

snapanaṃ kārayitvā tu snapanoktavidhānataḥ |
brāhmaṇān bhojayet tatra yathāvittānusārataḥ ||

<p. 90>

dīnānāṃ kṛpaṇānāñca annapānādi dāpayet |
garbhadoṣodbhave tatra ete naiva tu śāmyati ||

avanna kuryādajñānāt mṛtyudoṣaṃ bhaviṣyati |
durbhikṣaṃ kalahaṃ ghoraṃ anāvṛṣṭirbhaviṣyati ||

garbhiṇī vayadoṣārthaṃ kriyā caiṣā prakīrtitā |
evaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena sarvaśāntirbhaviṣyati ||

dhanamāya śucau (****) prabhāmatulaṃ bhavet |
hṛddeśaṃ praṇavenaiva ṣaṭkāreṇa tu gṛhyatām ||

phaṭkāraṃ mukhadeśe tu huṃkāreṇa śirastathā |
sadalantadvaye naiva pārśve hrī māṃ samantritam ||

ṣoḍaśāktena bījena svāhā praṇavayojitam |
tasmāt samṛddhate mantrī yāntejaṃ vā sthitaṃ haret ||

sarvāṃgantu harenmantrī navākṣareṇa mantritam |
saṃ saṃ dṛśya matimān mūlamantreṇa vācayet ||

vācayitvā vidhānena yojayen mūlavidyayā |
taccheṣaṃ homayenmantrī navākṣareṇa śataṃ budhaḥ ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī caiva cendrāṇī cāmuṇḍī vīrabhadrakam ||

gaṇeśaścaiva tatkṣetraṃ lokapālāstathaiva ca |
piśāca pretabhūtāśca kūśmāṇḍā guhyakāstathā ||

<p. 91>

gandharvā kiṃnarā siddhā sarvebhyo balidāpayet |
mūlamantreṇa mantrajño balimeṣāṃ vinikṣipet ||

catuṣpathe tripathe vāpi taṭāke kṣetradīrghike |
prākāre cālaye caiva śmaśāne caityake budhaḥ ||

hutaśeṣaṃ bhavet sarvaṃ bhaktiyukto dṛḍhavrataḥ |
raktānnañca pradātavyaṃ pariyuktena vai budhaḥ ||

baliṃ dadyād vidhānena rakta bhāṇḍaṃ tyajed bahiḥ |
grāmasīmā bahirvāpi kūpe sthāpya ca mantravit ||

paścādvā pāṃsubhirdhīmān kuṇḍañcaiva samukṣipet |
kanyakāṃ bhojayet tatra ekaviṃśati saṃkhyayā ||

evaṃ paśuvidhiḥ prokto lakṣaṇantu praśasyate |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ paśuvidhirnāma ekonaviṃśat paṭalaḥ] || 
19 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi yathā vedānupūrvaśaḥ |
śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikañcaiva ābhicārakamāraṇam ||

brāhmaṇādikrameṇaiva śāntiṃ kṛtvā yathākramam |
asurāṇāṃ vināśārthaṃ mātṝṇāmudbhavaṃ kramāt ||

mātṝṇāṃ śāntikaṃ kṛtvā sarva bhūhitaṃ bhavet |
uttamāmadhyamadhama trividhaṃ paśurucyate ||

<p. 92>

hastīhayanaraṃ hatvā uttamantu vinirdiśet |
madhyaṃ māhiṣamevoṣṭraṃ tvadhamaṃ tvajasūkaraiḥ ||

hariṇamuttamañcaiva kukkuṭañcādhamaṃ bhavet |
lalāṭe śvetavarṇantu saṃyutaṃ netraguggulam ||

saṃkāśamāṃsaṃ (*) ṣṇasudarśanaṃ bhūsvagrīvaham |
bṛhakṣa (************) bṛhat skanda bṛhacchiram ||

(*) sūgdhamedhavarṇantu atikṛṣṇaṃ vilocanam |
(*) ṣṭapādaṃ sujāraśca vṛttapādaṃ sunihṛtam ||

śṛṃgahīnaṃ bhaveddhvādhi dṛṣṭihīnaṃ dhanakṣayam |
śotrahīnaṃ hyanāvṛṣṭi pādahīnantu paṃkunā ||

pucchahīnaṃ bhavenmṛtyu agnidagdhaṃ kulakṣayam |
samapekṣyaṃ sadāridryaṃ dantahīnaṃ nṛpād bhayam ||

garbhanvatra samutpannaṃ prajānāmahitakṣayam |
punaśśāntiṃ pravakṣyāmi yojayitvā vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

pāṣāṇasphaṭikaṃ kuryāt mahāmārī prakopanam |
tasya śāntiṃ prakurvīta punaśśāntirvidhīyate ||

prāyaścittaṃ prakurvīta sarvadoṣantu śamyati |
mahiṣaṃ sarvāṃgayuktaṃ sudarśanaṃ suśobhanam ||

pūrvoktantu paśuṃ tatra sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam | 
śubhavarṇaṃ śubhaṃ proktāṃ vāhanāṃ varṇanāvaham ||

<p. 93>

kṛṣṇavarṇa subhikṣañca dhūmrābhaṃ vāhanaṃ bhavet |
lalāṭe nīlavarṇantu paśuṃ sukhamavāpnuyāt ||

guggulāsadṛśaṃ netra putralābhena saṃśayaḥ |
hrasvagrīvañcirāyuṣyaṃ sulakṣaṇaṃ sukhāvaham ||

evaṃ vidhividhānajño mātṝṇāṃ vṛddhivivardhanam |
pañcarātraṃ paśuṃ śodhya caruṇāpyupalakṣayet ||

mātṝṇāṃ tatra saṃpūrṇa śuddhasnānamalīnakam |
pṛthak pañcāṣṭavargeṣu uttamaṃ paśurucyate ||

bālāti vṛddhasaṃyuktaṃ varjayitvā viśeṣataḥ |
ṣaṣṭhāhaṃ pūrvarātre tu paśuṃ kṛvādhivāsanam ||

vedimadhye prakartavyaṃ maṇḍalaṃ caturaśrakam |
huṃphaṭkāreti mantreṇa aṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

madhye paśaṃ tathā vyāpya saptarohiṇi mantrataḥ |
chedayenmūlamantreṇa bhaktiyukto narottamaḥ ||

utsavādiṣu sarveṣu balikarma samācaret |
vāhanaṃ devi yānasya drasyavidhirucyate ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ śāntividhirnāma viṃśat paṭalaḥ] || 20 ||


<p. 94>

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi dhvajārohaṇamuttamam |
dhvajasya lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye uttamādhamamadhyamam ||

ṣoḍaśahastayuktaṃ tu dvihastārdhantu vistṛtam |
mūle tu ghaṭikopetaṃ kiṃkiṇīkha saṃyutam ||

pārśve kadalikopetaṃ tadagre tu dvidhākṛtam |
brāhmaṇasya dhvajaṃ śvetamuttamaṃ tadvinirdiśet ||

triśūlantu śivañcaiva kapālaṃ kauśikaṃ tathā |
nārācaṃ paraśuñcaiva sarvavastraṃ tathaiva ca ||

mūlamadhye tathānte ca etaiścaiva tu cāṃkitam |
śvetasūtrasamudbhūtaṃ naikacisamanvitam ||

evaṃ dhvajottamaṃ proktaṃ madhyamaṃ dvādaśaṃ bhavet |
pūrvavat kārayed brahman madhyamañca dhvajaṃ kramāt ||

pañcatālantu vistāraṃ pañcavarṇantu samanvitam |
kṣatriyasya dhvajaṃ proktaṃ raktasūtrasamanvitam ||

adhamaṃ daśahastañca dvihastañcaiva vistṛtam |
pūrvavat kārayet tatra nānācitrasamanvitam ||

vaiśyasya pītavarṇena lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
aṣṭahastasamāyuktaṃ dvihastañciva vistṛtam ||

śūdrāṇāṃ kanyasañcaiva naikacitra samanvitam |
pūrvavat kārayet tatra paṭañca kṛṣṇavarṇakam ||

<p. 95>

kārpāsaṃ brahmaṇaḥ proktaṃ kṣaumantu kṣatriyasya tu |
āpiṃgaṃ vaiśya śūdrāṇāṃ dhvajānāṃ parikīrtitā ||

karālī tu likhet tatra paṭe caiva hi buddhimān |
dhvajānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ hyetaduttamammadhyamādhamam ||

dhvajadaṇḍavidhiṃ kuryāt uttamaṃ madhyamādhamam |
prāsādādviguṇaṃ proktamuttamaṃ daṇḍamucyate ||

candanañcaṃpakañcaiva madhukaṃ panasaṃ tathā |
khadiraṃ devadāruñca vakulaṃ bilvameva ca ||

aśokamanasañcaiva śreṣṭhavṛkṣamudīritam |
madhyamaṃ (************) nālikerakam ||

adhamaṃ muni vṛkṣaṃ syāt kramukaṃ yājñikaṃ bhavet |
vaiṇavaṃ tadvijānīyāt mūlānāhamihocyate ||

ete vṛkṣā praśastāśca pūrvoktalakṣaṇānvitāḥ |
śatahastaṃ tadardhaṃ vā viṃśatpañcadaśaṃ tathā ||

dvādaśaṃ hastadaṇḍaṃ vā tathā lābhantu yojayet |
vaiṇavaṃ tadvijānīyāt mūlenāhamihocyate ||

ṣoḍaśāṃgulanāhaṃ syāt madhye cāṣṭāṃgulaṃ bhavet |
tadagre tu tadardhaṃ syāt uttamaṃ daṇḍamucyate ||

madhyamasya tadardhaṃ vā prāsādasya yathākramam |
aṣṭāṃgulañca nāgantu mūlaṃ tasya yathākramam ||

<p. 96>

evaṃ daṇḍaṃ samutpādya dhvajamāropayedbudhaḥ |
atha dārujaṃ vāpi dhvajamāropayetkramāt ||

dhvajamāropayet prātaḥ rāṣṭrantu vijayaṃ bhavet |
madhyāhne rāṣṭravṛddhiḥ syāt sāyāhne tu nṛṇāṃ śubham ||

ardharātrau bhaved brahma sarvasampat karaṃ bhavet |
agnake padavañcaiva (****) ścaiva nāśayet ||

dravyarthamaṃgalānāntu divya bhūṣaṇa bhūṣaṇam |
asaddeva vināśañca ṛṣideva pramodanam ||

śāvamuktā tadācārya sarvabhūṣaṇabhūṣitam |
tāmbūlaṃ dāpayitvā tu sarvebhyaśca viśeṣataḥ ||

dhvajamāropayet tasmin śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
dhvajāropya dhvajaṃ brahma yathāvidhi purassaram ||

upadhvajocyute tasmin hastāyāmasamanvitam |
indre tu śvetavarṇaṃ syāt āgneyaṃ raktavarṇakam ||

yāmye kṛṣṇodbhavañcaiva nair(-)ṛtyāndhūmrameva tu |
vāruṇe tu tadākāraṃ vāyavyaṃ pītavarṇakam ||

saume tu sauvarṇābhaṃ kuṃkumābhantu śaṃkare |
evaṃ dīrghaṃ nijaṃ proktaṃ veṇudaṇḍasamanvitam ||

trayāṇāñca dhvajānāñca dīrghajātaṃ tathaiva ca |
athavā dārudaṇḍañca tatpramāṇantu cocyate ||

<p. 97>

evaṃ kṛtvā samāsena naivedyaṃ dāpayed budhaḥ |
uttamañcaiva naivedyaṃ droṇataṇḍulasaṃyutam ||

piśitantu tadardhañca ghṛtaprasthasamanvitam |
trayāṇāñca dhvajānāñca dadhnāñcopadaṃśakam ||

kadalīphalasaṃyutam nālikeraphalaṃ tathā |
gulakhaṇḍañca māṣañca mudgamūlaphalaṃ tathā ||

bṛhatī kāravalli ca kūśmāṇḍantu viśeṣataḥ |
lavaṇaṃ marīcikañcaiva snehasnigdhantu kārayet ||

nivedyandāpayet tatra kramupadaṃ samiti smṛtam |
madhunā caiva saṃyuktaṃ pāyasaṃ dadhivarjitam ||

svajāti devaṃ vetālaṃ khaḍgahastañca dāpayet |
evaṃ havirnivedyañca dhvajadevāya deśikaḥ ||

tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet tasmin dhvajadevaṃ samarpayet |
evaṃ vai cottamaṃ proktaṃ haviścaiva viśeṣataḥ ||

tadardhaṃ madhyamaṃ vidhyāt tadardhañcāsamaṃ bhavet |
oṃ khaḍgahastāya vidmahe dhvajadevāya dhīmahi ||

tanno dhvajaḥ pracodayāt |
paiśācīnāṃ padaṃ paścāt tatpaścātpracodayāt ||

evaṃ mantraṃ samuccārya sarvaṃ tatraiva kārayet |
dundubhiṃ praharet pūrvaṃ dhvajaṃ paścāt samuddharet ||

<p. 98>

tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet tatra sarvebhyaśca vibhaktitaḥ |
kalaśānvedikāyāntu taṇḍule tu yathākramāt ||

taṇḍulaṃ śālibhiḥ kṛtvā aṣṭadroṇairviśeṣataḥ |
pañcaratnāni sūtrāṇi taṇḍule sūtrayet tathā ||

tiryak tathaiva sūtrāṇi sūtrayed vai vicakṣaṇaḥ |
dvipadaṃ hṛdaye tasmin caturdikṣu tathaiva ca ||

madhye navapadaṃ padmamaṣṭapatraṃ ñakarṇikam |
yavairdhātyairvikiraṇaṃ caturvistāramantataḥ ||

tilaiśca śobhitaṃ padmamāḍhakena vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pañcaratnañca tacchuddhakalaśe caiva tu vinyaset ||

sūtreṇa veṣṭitaṃ raktamāmrapallavaśobhitam |
vastrayugmaṃ samāyuktaṃ gandhodakasamanvitam ||

evaṃ kṛtvā tathā brahman naivedyaṃ dāpayet punaḥ |
pūrvoktañca baliṃ dadyāt kṛtvā devaṃ hṛdāntikam ||

evaṃ kṛtvā samāsena kanyābhojanamācaret |
kanyāśca ṣoḍaśe pātrairbhojayet pāyasena tu ||

dhvajasyottarapārśve tu kṣetrapālasya pīṭhakam |
vṛttapaṃkti trikoṇaṃ vā caturaśramathāpi vā ||

athavā devyālayaṃ syāt aiśānyāṃ pīṭhamucyate |
ekavistāramucchṛtya tāvadeva tu varṇakam ||

<p. 99>

indranīlapratīkāśaṃ ghoradaṃṣtra mahodaram |
daṇḍahastaṃ suhastākṣamūrdhvakeśaṃ bhayānanam ||

meghābhañcaiva sañcintya kṣetrapālabaliṃ kṣipet |
caturviṃśati varṇaiśca mantrasyābhyarcanaṃ bhavet ||

kṣetrasya mantrāghaṃ sarvaṃ kṣetrapālabaliṃ kṣipet |
dundubhiḥ praharaṃ pūrvaṃ kṛtvā tatra baliṃ kṣipet ||

ādau tu cāṃkuraṃ kṛtvā tadante hyasivāsanam |
tadante dhvajamāropya tadante bheritāḍanam ||

tadante śrībaliṃ kuryāt tadante cāṃkurantathā |
tadante yāgapūjā ca tadante śrībaliṃ tathā ||

tadante cotsavaṃ proktaṃ tadante snapanaṃ kuru |
tadante gurupūjā ca śastradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

kṣetrapālabaliṃ vakṣye yathāvidhi purassaram |
śataprasthaiśca pakvaṃ syāt tadardhaṃ vā viśeṣetaḥ ||

ajamāṃsa yutaṃ pakvaṃ talacūrṇasamanvitam |
gulakhaṇḍasamāyuktamikṣukhaṇḍasamanvitam ||

kadalīphala saṃyuktaṃ madhvājyena samanvitam |
evaṃ praharaṇañcaiva sarva vādyena buddhimān ||

tasmāt sarva prayatnena kujavārabaliṃ kṣipet |
tadvārātpūrvavāre tu ||

[iti brahmāyāmale vīravidhāne dhvajārohaṇavidhirnāma ekaviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 21 ||


<p. 100>

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi kujavārabaliṃ śṛṇu |
sarvapāpaharaṃ rājñe sarvasaṃpatpravardhanam ||

brāhmaṇānāṃ hitañcaiva mahāmārī vināśanam |
rājārāṣṭrajayaṃñcaiva putrapautravivardhanam ||

gṛhajvaravināśañca bhūtaduṣṭa vināśanam |
mahāśāntikarañcaiva mahāvṛṣṭivivardhanam ||

rājasenā sukhārthañca hastyaśvanaravardhanam |
taskarānnabhayañcaiva mātṝṇāṃ prītivardhanam ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena kulavārabaliṃ kṣipet |
tadvārātpūrvavāre tu rātrau sūtrantu bandhayet ||

aṣṭadroṇaistu saṃsiddhe paṃkajaṃ tatra cālikhet |
evaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena prokṣayenmūlamantrakam ||

tanmadhye kalaśaṃ nyastvā kṛṣṇamaṇḍalavarjitam |
trisūtraṃ veṣṭayet tatra gandhodaka supūritam ||

pañcaratnasamāyuktaṃ vastradvaya vibhūṣitam |
ekavīrīṃ nyasetkumbhe mūlamantreṇa deśikā ||

gandhapuṣpañca dīpañca arghyañcaru nivedayet |
ajaraktantu saṃpūjya vāmahastantu bandhayet ||

prabhāte vimale śuddhe paraśecanamārabhet |
dviguṇamārādhya yatnena śāstra dṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

<p. 101>

evaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena carulāja phalādibhiḥ |
ekāhantu hunet tatra mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ ||

devyāstu purataḥ kṛtvā kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍilepi vā |
mātṝṇāmarcanañcaiva mātṛmantreṇa deśikaḥ ||

homaṃ tatra prakartavyaṃ taddeśe tu hunetkramāt |
raktaṃ māṃsaṃ ghṛtañcaiva sarṣapañcatilastathā ||

lājāpūpādi saṃyuktamekaikāṣṭaśaṃ hunet |
bhūtapīṭhaṃ nyasenmadhye ajasaptantu pātayet ||

sakalaṃ niṣkalaṃ nyasya tadraktaṃ tu nivedayet |
madhutrayeṇasaṃyuktaṃ rudhiraṃ madhyasaṃyutam ||

madhyamāṃsasamāyuktaṃ kaṭake caiva nikṣipet |
evaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena yojayed deśikottamaḥ ||

śūlaṃ dhvajañca paraśuṃ cānnaliṃgaṃ kriyākaram |
kapālaṃ ḍamaruñcaiva ratnavyāghādakantathā ||

etāṃśca tān samuddhṛtya dīkṣite paraśaivake |
kṣurikāhastasaṃyuktaṃ baliñcaiva hi kārayet ||

nānāpaṭahasaṃyuktaṃ nānāvādyasamanvitam |
ḍamarukadhvanisaṃyuktaṃ sarva (**) samanvitam ||

mātṛbhakti samāyuktaṃ māheśvari samanvitam |
samayī sādhakaścaiva putrakācāryakastathā ||

<p. 102>

kṣurikāśrita hastastu saṃgañcaiva manohare |
kujavārabaliṃ śīghraṃ madhyāhne ca vinikṣipet ||

grāme vā nagare vāpi keṭake kubjakepi vā |
dvipathe tripathe koṣṭhe valmīke ca tathaiva ca ||

catuṣpathe śmaśāne ca baliṃ sarvatra dāpayet |
bali bhramaṇavelāyāṃ narāṇāṃ laṃghanaṃ na tu ||

triśūlaṃ laṃghanaṃ kṛtvā dhānamokṣamavāpnuyāt |
strīṇāñcaiva tu viprāṇāṃ laṃghane tatra saṃbhave ||

nirapekṣañca kartavyaṃ kṛtvā caiva baliṃ bhrame |
vaiśya kṣatriya laṃghe tu māṃsacchedantu kārayet |

śvānamārjāramahiṣā kharoṣṭrāśca tathaiva ca |
mūlamantreṇa mantrajña paśūnāñcaiva ghātayet ||

evaṃ baliṃ kṣiped brahman śṛṇu śāstrasya niścayaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ kujavārabalirnāma dvāviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] 
|| 22 ||


ekāhamutsavaṃ vaṣye śrūyatāṃ kamalāsana |
pūrvavanmaṇṭapaṃ kṛtvā toraṇa dhvajasaṃyutam ||

vaidikā caturaśrantu catvāriṃśatkulaṃ kramāt |
tadbāhye dvārakekṣudaṇḍantatraiva kārayet ||

<p. 103>

ratnimātraṃ pramāṇāni caturaśrasamantathā |
kṛṣṇapakṣe praśastantu aṃgāraka caturdaśī ||

rohiṇyāmutsavaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ aṃgārakadinairyutam |
brahmaṇe vaiṣṇave puṣye aṃgārakadinairyutam ||

pratimāsini kurvīta aṃgārabali nivedayet |
pūrvāhṇe cārcayed devīṃ kūrcānnantu nivedayet ||

śāntihomaṃ prakūrvīta devyagni vidhisaṃyutam |
raktodakaṃ baliṃ pūrvaṃ madhyāhna balikarmaṇi ||

carumāṃsañca rudhiraṃ lājāni ca tulāni ca |
kūrca (************) āpūpāni ca bahūni ca ||

balidravyañca yudhañcaiva arcayenmantra pūrvakam |
dhūpadīpasamāyuktaṃ vitānaṃ vastraśobhitam ||

madhudhvajasahañcaiva pāśaśca majjakaṃ tathā |
khaḍgagarbhidhanussaṃgaikṣurikai kṛca śobhitam ||

balirakṣāṃ prakūrvīta nayet tatra sadeśikaḥ |
balipātramāyudhammārya maunī vrataparāyaṇaḥ ||

brahmacārī tapasvī ca śuciviprasamāsana |
mantrañca mātṛkaṃ nyastvā (************) śobhitam ||

saptamudrāṃ prakurvīta toraṇāni ca saṃjñayā |
kṣetrapālabaliṃ dadyāt sthāpayet tadvicakṣanaḥ ||

<p. 104>

ālayantu paribhramya śannogacchantyathākramam |
grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi pattanaṃ vā pradakṣiṇam ||

brahmasthāne tu prathamaṃ brahmadevi baliṃ dadet |
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ baliṃ kuryāt samantataḥ ||

devī veṣadharo vāpi mudrāṃ vā balyanantaram |
caturaśramaṇḍalaṃ pūrvamāgneyāṃ yonimākṛtim ||

yāmyāyāmardha candre tu nair(-)ṛtyāntu trikoṇakam |
vāruṇyāṃ vartulaṃ vidyāt vāyavyāntu ṣaḍaśrakam ||

padmamaṣṭadalaṃ saumye aiśanye cāṣṭakoṇakam |
hastamātra pramāṇāni maṇḍalantu kārayet budhaḥ ||

(**) catuṣpathe caiva triśūlañcaiva durgake |
vāpī kūpataṭākañca gopurañca tathaiva ca ||

devasthāne sabhāsthāne maṇṭape ca vihārake |
vanāntare saṃsthāne vaṭaplakṣaśmaśānake ||

nagarasya catudvāre ekavṛkṣe śivālaye |
baliṃ dadyād viśeṣeṇa svanāmnā cābhimantravit ||

mudrābandhanamaskāramarcayitvā punaḥ punaḥ |
balimudrāṃ dadet paścāt balimantramanusmaret ||

yātrā homantataḥ kṛtvā pāraśaivaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
catuṣṭaya japitvā tu cāmuṇḍā hṛdayañjapet ||

<p. 105>

tadardharātre tatkāle devī pūjā yaduttamam |
aṣṭāha samahārāvaṃ balidānādanantaram ||

navadvayaguṇāvāhe (************) |
bhanune nāmamantreṇa arcayitvā yathākramam ||

āsyānāñcaiva cārghyañca pādyamācamanīyakam |
arghyāntamarcayed vidvān balin tatraiva nikṣipet ||

śmaśānāntāni sarvāṇi pūjayitvā viśeṣataḥ |
rātrau tu balidānaṃ syāt tat tatsnapana mārabhet ||

viśeṣahaviṣandadyāt paśuṃ hatvā nivedayet |
ācāryaṃ pūjayed vidvān vastrābharaṇabhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

itthaṃ kuryāt tato vidvān sarvaduḥkhavināśanam |
sarvatīrtha phalaṃ puṇyaṃ sahasra godānakalpakam ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ ekāhotsavavidhirnāma trayoviṃśaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 23 ||


evaṃ mahotsavaṃ kṛtvā vabhrathaṃ kārayed budhaḥ |
pūrṇopakramaśo pūrṇe devyāsthāne viśeṣataḥ ||

maṇṭapaṃ gomayenaiva caturaśrandaśa hastakam |
aṃkuraṃ sthāpayet tatra śālinaśca nyased budhaḥ ||

lūkhalaṃ vinyaset tatra samūlaṃ tatra vinyaset |
lūkhalāmusalāmadhye tvarcayet tatra devayoḥ ||

<p. 106>

yoginī vinyaset tatra gandhapuṣpādi yojayet |
devyāyā samudāhṛtya pūrṇakarmantu vādiśi ||

dvijānnīvapeccūrṇamanyathā doṣamāpnuyāt |
taccūrṇaṃ sthāpayet tatra mūlamantreṇa buddhimān ||

parivāraḥ snāpayeccaiva tailābhyaṃgamanantaram |
yajamānaṃ pūjayeccaiva sarvebhyo vā śirasya ca ||

grāmaṃ samyak paribharmya nadīsnānaṃ samācaret |
aninditāṃ diśaṃ gatvā taṭāke vā vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

snānakṣepavidhānena aṣṭabhiḥ kalaśaṃ kramāt |
nadisnānaṃ tadā paścāt rakṣāsūtraṃ visṛjya ca ||

alavṛttāgurāssarve snānaṃ kuryādyayecchayā |
snānādvāmatimān samyak dānaṃ śaktivicakṣaṇaḥ ||

ālayaṃ punarāgamya puṣpayāgaṃ samācaret |
pañcavarṇaiśca kusumaiḥ pūrvoktamaṇḍalaṃ likhet ||

maṇḍale pūjayet samyak mātṝnvai mūlavidyayā |
prabhāte tu dine ramye sarvālaṃkārasaṃyute ||

kutape pātrabaliṃ dadyāt sarvavarṇañcaruṃ budhaḥ |
suvarṇe rajate vāpi tāmre vā kāṃsapātrake ||

niyutairvāyutairvāpi tathā pañcasahasrake |
sahasrairathavāpyardhe tathāvardhārdharārdhake |

<p. 107>

tathā ca snāpayitvā tu raktāmbaravibhūṣitam |
raktagandhānulepāñca tathā pāśāṃkuśaṃ param ||

khaḍvāṃgaṃ śaṃkhacakrañca hastaṃ musalameva ca |
vajraṃ śaktipatākaṃ ca padmaṃ svastikameva ca ||

etaissarvā yathādhārai kanyakā pariveṣṭitam |
grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi śanaiḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇam ||

kṛsarāpūpasaṃyuktaṃ tvetamannaṃ tathaiva ca |
raktānnaṃ puṣpasaṃyuktaṃ navākṣareṇamantritam ||

tat tanmantreṇasaṃyuktaṃ baliṃ sarvatradāpayet |
śirasā dhārayitvā śanaiḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇam ||

kṛtvā vidhinā praviśet devyāśca tadanantaram |
snānaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣeṇa dhūpadīpa havirdiśet ||

nivedayet pṛthumantreṇa kulapāraśavastathā |
bhraṃśo bhāraśca catvāri tilaśāli priyaṃgulam ||

suśobhanaṃ pūjayitvā tatra sarvaṃ nivedayet |
tat tanmuṣṭiṃ gṛhītvā tu homaṃ kṛtvā vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

sādhakassamidhāyāñca (************) |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hūyāt mūlamantreṇa yat tathā ||

tadāsya homavidhinā tilaśālipriyaṃgulam |
tanme nāsṭaśataṃ hūyāt sarvaśāntirbhaviṣyati ||

<p. 108>

punarvai homaśeṣantu daśadikṣubaliṃ dadet |
śeṣaṃ syāt kṣetrapālāya dāpayed balimādarāt ||

kanyakāṃ bhojayet pūrvaṃ yāgānte dvijabhojanam |
ācāryaṃ pūjayet paścāt vastrahemāṃgulīyakaiḥ ||

pariyaṣṭi paricārāśca tathā sarvatra pūjayet |
evaṃ tālabaliṃ proktaṃ sarvavyādhivināśanam ||

subhikṣaṃ vardhanañcaiva putrāpautravivardhanam ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ balividhirnāma caturviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 24 
||


īśvara uvāca ||

utsvānte ca grāmānte paścāt snapanamācaret |
cūrṇasnānaṃ purākṛtvā dadhisnānaṃ tathā kuru ||

sarvagandhasamāyuktaṃ rajanacūrṇasaṃyutam |
lūkhalāmusalāścaiva vastrayugmena veṣṭayet ||

cūrṇayenmūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ putraśālinām |
pūjayet tatra ācāryaṃ aṃkureṇaiva cālaṃkṛtam ||

cūrṇaṃ sarvaṃ gṛhītvā tu snapanaṃ mūlavidyayā |
pṛthagīśīṃ tataḥ snātvā paścānmātrasupūjayet ||

<p. 109>

parivārapiśācāśca yogapīṭhāṃśca yoginīm |
ācāryaṃ pūjayet paścāt yajamānaṃ tataḥ kuru ||

pāraṃparyāśca putrāśca sarvebhyo vā śirasya tu |
nadīsnānaṃ tataḥ paścāt nindika sudiśi vrajet ||

taṭākañca prakartavyaṃ mahādiṣu samāhitam |
jalāśrayaṃ samāgamya taṇḍulaṃ vālukaiḥ kuru ||

sarvānnakalaśaisthāpya paścāt snapanamācaret |
gandhapuṣpasamāyuktamakṣataiścāpi saṃyutam ||

hṛdayena tu manreṇa rakṣāsūtraṃ visarjayet |
alūpattānarāssarve snānaṃ kṛtvā samahitaḥ ||

dānaṃ kṛtvā yathāśakti gobhūmī kāñcanadiśi |
dāne tīrthe phale caiva svargalokamavāpnuyāt ||

ālayaṃ punarāgamya snānabhogaṃ samārabhet |
pañcavarṇamalaṃkṛtya padmamaṣṭadale nyaset ||

karṇikā kesaropetaṃ gandhādibhirathārcayet |
tanmadhye nyasecchaivīṃ gandhapuṣpacarundadet ||

snapanaṃ kārayecchaivīṃ śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
caturaśramaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā daśahastapramāṇataḥ ||

śālibhistaṇḍulaṃ kṛtvā (**) droṇena buddhimān |
athavārdhamathāpyarthaṃ pañcadroṇena vā punaḥ ||

<p. 110>

tadardhaṃ maṇḍalaṃ grāhya madhye padmaṃ samālikhet |
āyudhaṃ vā sahasraṃ vā tadardhaṃ vāpyathārdhake ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi pañcāśītimathāpi vā |
mṛṇmayaṃ kalaśaṃ proktaṃ kālamaṇḍalavarjitam ||

sādhitān kṣālitān śuddhān guggulaiścaiva dhūpitān |
sūtrānvā sūtrasaṃyoktān sakūrcānsāpidhānakān ||

maṇṭapaṃ śobhitaṃ kṛtvā vitānadhvajaśobhitām |
darbhamālā parikṣiptaṃ puṣpadāmasubhūṣitam ||

aṣaṭkasasamāyuktaṃ phalapallavasaṃyutam |
cāmarairdarpaṇairyuktaṃ ghaṇṭādhūpasamanvitam ||

pañcaviṃśācca kalaśān pradhānā parikīrtitaḥ |
pādyamācamanañcārghyaṃ pañcagavyaṃ tilodakam ||

kṣīraṃ dadhighṛtaṃ caiva madhunāgulameva ca |
puṣpodaka phalodañca gandhodaka kuśodakam ||

kāṣāyamṛṣṭavattoyaṃ dhātuvāri triṇodakam |
śāntyodakaraṇyodakaṃ śāṃtyodakaṃ tathaiva ca ||

priyokamikṣurasaṃ lohodakamataḥ param |
aṣṭaratnodakañcaiva pañcaviṃśadanukramāt ||

pādyādikaṃ hṛdā datvā indrādyaiśānyameva ca |
teṣāṃ sarvā navā proktā pradakṣiṇe naiva vinyaset ||

<p. 111>

kalān pañcaviṃśacca pradhāna kalaśairyutam |
abhiṣekañca prakartavyaṃ śuddhavāri supūjitam ||

gandhapuṣpādibhissarvān pūjayitvā muhurmuhuḥ |
pṛthak ca kalaśān nyasya sūtreṇaiva tu veṣṭayet ||

navākṣareṇa (****) pādyasthānaṃ vidhīyate |
nave nācamya mantreṇa ācamanīyaṃ dadet budhaḥ ||

hṛdimantraṃ japitvā tu arghyasnānaṃ samācaret |
mūlamantreṇa mantrajña pañcagavyaṃ nyased budhaḥ ||

śikhāmantreṇa mantrajña tilodakamathā nyaset |
ācārya mantritakṣīraṃ samācaredadhikramāt ||

(**) vityuccacanmantrī devī sthānantu vinyaset |
vidyāmantraṃ samuccārya vratasnānaṃ vidhīyate ||

navākṣareṇa matimān śeṣaṃ sarvaṃ yathākramāt |
astramantreṇa cintyātmā kalaśāṃśca pṛthak pṛthak ||

ācāryo raktavāsastu śucisnānojitendriyaḥ |
devī tatra suguptātmā sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam ||

nāgahīnena badhiran na śaṭhairnajastathā |
nakūro nāgaraktāṃgo notmorthe vidhipīḍitau ||

sarvāṃgamamṛtatvajña mantra śivadvija |
ṣaḍadhvāja tathā dhīmān tena lakṣaṇasaṃyutam ||

<p. 112>

snapayitvā vidhānena saptavarja carun dadat |
raktaṃ pītaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ haridraṃ śyāmādikameva ca ||

pāyasaṃ kṛsarañcaiva havissapteti kīrtitam |
upahārapaśūn sapta ajaṃ śvetaṃ praśasyate ||

nivedya ca vidhānena pañcasthānaṃ baliṃ kuru |
sahasraṃ vā śataṃ vāpi pañcāśatpañcaviṃśakaiḥ ||

kumārīśirasā dhāryagandhapuṣpairalaṃkṛtam |
citradhvajapatākañca śaṃkhadundubhisaṃyutaiḥ ||

grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi pradakṣiṇamathācaret |
devālayaṃ samāgamya yugapad bali(vi)nikṣipet ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ snapanavidhirnāma 
pañcaviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 25 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi maṇḍalavidhimuttamam |
maṇḍalaṃ sarvakāmārthaṃ sarvalokahitāvaham ||

mātṛśāntiñca yogañca balikarmaṇi likhyayā |
navahastāṣṭahastantu saptahastantu cottamam ||

pañcahastañcaturhastaṃ madhyamaṃ maṇḍalaṃ tathā |
tridvekona hastantu kaniṣṭhaṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhavet ||

uttamaṃ maṇḍalaṃ vipro madhyamaṃ nṛpavaiśyakam |
adhamaṃ maṇḍalaṃ śūdro sarveṣāṃ maṇḍalāyutam ||

<p. 113>

devāyā yeṣu sandheṣu ācāryastatra laṃghayet |
pūrve tu cottarāgrantu pūrvoktaṃ dakṣiṇena ca ||

paścime cottarāgre tu pūrvāgrañcottareṇa ca |
pūrvañca dakṣiṇañcaiva paścimañcottarantathā ||

caturdvārantu kūrvīta caturdikṣu ca madhyame |
rakṣohaṇa phalañcaiva pūrvadvārādhipālakau ||

āgreyyāṃ jvālinī devī nair(-)ṛtyāṃ viṣukarṇinī |
vāyavyāṃ ghātakī devīmaiśānyāmīśvarī tathā ||

bāhyāvaraṇamālikhya saptamaṃ parivardhate |
indraścāgni yamaścaiva nir(-)ṛtirvaruṇastathā ||

vāyuścaiva tu somaśca īśānaścāṣṭadevatāḥ |
indrāgniśca dvaryormadhye aśvinau kalayet kramāt ||

āgneya yamayormadhye pitṛsthānaṃ prakalpayet |
yamanair(-)ṛtayormadhye yakṣāṃścaiva tu vinyaset ||

nir(-)ṛtirvaruṇayormadhye rakṣasāṃ caiva vinyaset |
varuṇavāyavyayormadhye ṛṣisthānaṃ prakalpitam ||

vāyusomakayormadhye sarpānvaṣṭau prakalpayet |
somakaiśānayormadhye rudraikādaśavinyaset ||

indra īśānayormadhye somastatrādhi devatā |
aṣṭamaṃ parivartante devatāsthānamuttamam ||

<p. 114>

vimalī ca tathā bhadrī kālakaṇṭhī sukaṇṭhinī |
lambinī cottamī caiva vikṛtiśśuddhamohinī ||

hāṭakī ca mahāghorī virūpī tuṃgadaṃṣṭriṇī |
vilāsinīvirūpākṣī śaṃkhacakrī caturbhujī ||

pañcamaṃ parivartante pūrvādīni pradakṣiṇam |
caṇḍācaṇḍamukhī cogrī siṃhanādamahāravī ||

dvākuṭī bhīmarūpī ca ākāśīmandabuddhinī |
lakṣmī ca satyavādī ca krodhinī ca tathaiva ca ||

manavī mādhavī rudrī caturthaṃ parivartate |
cakrī caiva hutāśī ca yāmyānī bhūtavāruṇī ||

vāyavī caiva kauberī śaṃkarīśūlahastinī |
kaṭvāṃgī candradhārī ca caṇḍadhārī cakāriṇī ||

triṇetraṃ vīrabhogī ca vedarūpī tathaiva ca |
vartante yad dvitīyantu indrādīni yathākramam ||

brāhmyādi vīravighnāntaṃ indrādīśānamācaret |
vartante caiva madhye tu yogeśvarīṃ nyaset ||

budhaḥ kālī caiva karālī ca virālī ca caturdaśa |
etasya tasya mūrtistu maṇḍalābhyantare tu vai ||

anyathā maṇḍalaṃ kuryāt tasya paścimapārśvataḥ |
caturhastapramāṇantu vistāraṃ lakṣaṇānvitam ||

<p. 115>

tanmadhye śūlaṃ vinyasya pārśve sīni sa pūtrakam |
tadbāhye nṛttakāsthānaṃ caturdikṣu ca kelaka ||

nṛttageyañca vādyañca mudrāmabhinayed budhaḥ |
diśamudrādiśānāla indrādyaiśānamudrayā ||

pūrvāyāntu diśi kṛtvā ghoraṃ gacchecchivārugam |
dakṣiṇāyāṃ diśi kṛtvā raudraghora bhayāvaham ||

paścimāyāṃ diśi kṛtvā rodanāṃguli yojayet |
uttarasyāṃ diśi kṛtvā arkāsyañcaiva yojayet ||

raudrakalukilaśśabdaṃ ghoraṃ kṛtvā śivārudam |
pūrṇakumbhantu kamalaṃ darśanaṃ daṇḍakāsu ca ||

dvārapālānnamaskṛtvā arcayitvā yathākramam |
oṃkārādi namontañca sthāpanamarcayed budhaḥ ||

svanāmabandhamadhyasthaṃ pūjayitvā svamantravit |
vajraṃ śṛṃkhantu pātena agniprākāra eva ca ||

śailaṃ śūlañcaturbandhaṃ (**) yaśūlamudrayā |
tatodvāyya namaskāraṃ śūlamūle tathārcayet ||

ghaṇṭākṣurikakhaḍgādi gadāntaṃ saṃpradarśayet |
kriyāyāṃ mantramudrā ca balikarma prayojayet ||

balinā patitaṃ kuryāt āyudhe patite yadi |
cyutamānantu kurvīta punassaṃskāramarhati ||

<p. 116>

ācāryo balimārabhya avasānañca kārayet |
pramādānavadhānāni rudhiraṃ gṛhyasādhakaḥ ||

diśāṃ baliṃ pradatvā tu āgachantu bhairavā |
ājñāñcaiva hitaṃ kṛtvā hiṃsā kartā ca hiṃsayet ||

athavā ajahiṃsā ca homañcaiva diśāṣṭakam |
paścācca carusaṃpūjya prāyaścittantu kārayet ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ maṇḍalavidhirnāma ṣaḍviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] 
|| 26 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ kalakavādyakam |
tatassaṃkalasaṃvādyaṃ kṛtvā caiva pradakṣiṇam ||

dvitīyaṃ jalamāśritya tṛtīyaṃ naṭamārabhet |
caturthaṃ pañcanāṭyañca pañcamaṃ karmanāṭyakam ||

ālīṭañca tṛtīyantu pratyālīṭañcaturthakam |
pañcamaṃ śayanañcaiva pañcanāṭyamiti smṛtam ||

aṣṭabandhaṃ tathā kṛtvā aṃguṣṭhākuñcitaṃ bhavet |
kaniṣṭhāṃguli tarjanyo kavacamudrā vidhīyate ||

pūrvasyāntu diśiśastraṃ pūrvasyāṃ diśi daivatam |
pūrvasyāṃ tu diśi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

<p. 117>

pūrvasyāṃ daivataṃ kṛtvā ityete daivataṃ bhavet |
brāhmaṇasya kulaṃ vṛddhi āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

dakṣiṇasyāṃ diśimantraṃ dakṣiṇasyāṃ diśidaivatam |
dakṣiṇasyāṃ diśibrūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

yadeva dakṣiṇasyāstu yamo vai daivataṃ bhavet |
kṣatriyasya kulaṃ vṛddhi āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

paścimāyāṃ diśimantraṃ paścimādiśidaivatam |
paścimāyāṃ diśibrūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

paścime varuṇandevaṃ daivaṃ tatra prakīrtitam |
vaiśyānāntu kulaṃ vṛddhi āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

uttarasyāṃ diśimantraṃ uttarādiśi daivatam |
uttarasyāndiśi brūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

uttarasyāntu taddaivaṃ kubero daivataṃ bhavet |
śūdrasyeva kulaṃ vṛddhi āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

ekādhyāyāṃ diśāmantraṃ ūrdhvāyāṃ diśidaivatam |
ekārdhāyāndiśi brūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

ekadhvān diśi devāstu sarvadeva samāhitam |
mātṝṇāṃ kulavṛddhyarthaṃ āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

adhastācca diśāmantraṃ adhastād diśi daivatam |
athastāddiśi ca brūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

<p. 118>

ekordhvā diśidevāstu sarvadeva samāhitā |
mātṝṇāṃ kulavṛdhyarthaṃ āpaścāñjalinā haret ||

adhastācca diśāmantraṃ adhastād diśi daivatam |
adhastāddiśi ca brūhi brūhi me mātṛputrakam ||

adhastāccaiva yaddaivaṃ viṣṇuścaiva tu daivatam |
pṛthvī sarve gaṇāścaiva āpaścāñjalināharet ||

caturaśraṃ maṇṭapaṃ kṛtvā caturdvāropaśobhitam |
pūrve vidyādharañcaiva dakṣiṇe garuḍantathā ||

paścime maṇḍalamevoktaṃ uttaraṃ piṃgalaṃ bhavet |
evaṃ mukhāvadhā mudrā ghaṇṭāśabdaṃ prayojayet ||

khaḍgamuṣṭistathācāryaḥ khaḍgena pariveṣṭitam |
pūrvasyāntu diśi kṛtvā nāṭyañcaiva prayacchati ||

diśāmudrā diśānāṭyaṃ caturācārya vyavasthitam |
ālīḍhañcaiva sthānañca padmamudrā tathaiva ca ||

dakṣahastaṃ śikhādyantu vāmapāda ghṛtaṃ bhavet |
dakṣapādaṃ pādanāpyaṃ vāmahastaṃ ghṛtaṃ bhavet ||

yakṣogaṇaphaṇañcaiva pūrvasyāṃ dvārapālakau |
sumukho kāladaṇḍaśca dakṣiṇadvārapālakau ||

sakalaḥ kumbhakarṇaśca uttaradvārapālakau |
airāvata kuśañcakrandhanurbāṇantathaiva ca ||

<p. 119>

vajraśca mudrarañcaiva pāśañcaiva tathā bhavet |
ete mudrā samākhyātā aindre caiva diśi kramāt ||

dhūpo vedistathā mudrā agnikuṇḍahṛdaṃ bhavet |
proḍhāśaṃ praṇavañcaiva āgneyān diśi mudrayā ||

kūpodaṇḍastathā pāśaṃ śārvalīnarakastathā |
vetālī mahiṣañcaiva thāmpāyān diśi mudrayā ||

vāsaṃ bhalaṃ bhiṇḍi pālañca mudgarantomarantathā |
kuntañcāpi vijānīyānnair(-)ṛtyān diśi mudrayā ||

gatāparaṃgasaṃghoṣaṃ vimānaṃ padmameva ca |
pūrṇa kumbhañca kamalaṃ bhūtalegni pradakṣiṇam ||

hṛdayaṃ spṛṣṭamātrañca bhūmimudrā prakīrtitā |
tadvacca somasūryaśca grahanakṣatra tārakāḥ ||

brahmā ca saptarṣaya ūrdhvāyān diśi mudrayā |
jaṭāmakuṭadhārañca triṇetraṃ nāgabhūṣaṇam ||

triśūlaṃ paraśuṃ pālaṃ khaṭvāṃkaṃ cāṣṭamaṃ bhavet |
vīreśa cāgamudrā ca sarvakāmārtha sādhakāḥ ||

akṣasūtrañca padmañca kamaṇḍaluṃ kuśameva ca |
daṇḍaṃ kṛṣṇājinañcaiva upavītantu haṃsakam ||

brahmāṇī cāṃgamudrā ca sarvakarmārtha sādhakaḥ |
śūlaṃ paraśumṛgañca nāga(-)ṛṣabhameva ca ||

<p. 120>

gajacarma jaṭācaiva vyāghracarmantathaiva ca |
vāmeśī cāṃgamudrā tu sarvakarmārtha sādhakaḥ ||

vajraṃ śaktiñca ghaṇṭā ca prahī kukkuṭameva ca |
ubhayañcopavītañca iṣṭimusalameva ca ||

kaumārī cāṃgamudrā ca sarvakāmārtha sādhakaḥ |
padmañca navamālā ca garuḍañcāṣṭamaṃ bhavet ||

vaiṣṇavī cāṃgamudrā tu sarvakāmārtha sādhakaḥ |
daṃṣṭraṃ daṇḍahalañcaiva vārāhī mahiṣantathā ||

khaḍgañcakraṃ gadā caiva vārāhī cāṃgamudrikā |
vajraṃ gadāṃ tathā śakti dhanunārācameva ca ||

tomaraṃ bhiṇṭapālañca valayañcāṣṭamaṃ bhavet |
indrāṇī cāṃgamudrā tu sarvakāmārtha sādhakaḥ ||

śūlaṃ khaḍgadhanuścaiva śaraṃ kheṭakameva ca |
kaṭvāṃgañca kapālañca ghaṇṭāḍamarukantathā ||

cāmuṇḍī cāṃgamudrā tu sarvakāmārtha sādhakaḥ |
gajānanaṃ gajakaraṃ gajadantaṃ bṛhodaram ||

akṣasūtrañca kabalaṃ kūrcaśāṣakameva ca |
gaṇeśaścāṃga mudrā tu sarvakāmārtha sādhakaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ mudrālakṣaṇavidhirnāma 
saptaviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 27 ||


<p. 121>

śivāptantu sarvāṃgaṃ ekamevaṃ maheśvaram |
kathitaṃ vā śivatvaṃ hi sarvaṃ melanameva ca ||

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi prakārāṇāntu lakṣaṇaṃ |
vakṣyehaṃ vidhinā brahmam yathāvadanupūrvakam ||

garbhagṛhālayaṃ proktaṃ ālayaṃ daṇḍamucyate |
daṇḍārdha maṇṭapaṃ kṛtvā sadaṇḍamantarhārakam ||

madhyāgāraṃ dvidaṇḍantu caturdaṇḍantu madhyayā |
mahāmaryādibhittiśca saptadaṇḍaṃ samaṃ bhavet ||

śailairvā iṣṭakairvāpi kārayet sudṛḍhaṃ kramāt |
ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā trihastaṃ vā tato bhavet ||

pādāntamunnatasyāntaṃ galāntaṃ trividhāyatam |
evantu tatkrameṇaiva prākāraṃ paripūritam ||

sudhākāryaṃ tathā kṛtvā sukhāsanaṃ suśobhitam |
prākāraśailayā mārgaṃ prākāraṃ maṇṭapaṃ tathā ||

pākāraṃ mātṛto vāpi pākāraṃ trividhaṃ smṛtaṃ |
pavitraṃ citrarddhikaṃ vā ardhacitramathāpi vā ||

bhūtapretagaṇāścaiva piśāca vetālarūpakam |
eteṣāṃ kārayet tatra yathāvibhavavistaram ||

pārśve pṛṣṭhasamañcaiva agre tu dviguṇaṃ tathā |
antarhāraṣvidaṃ proktaṃ antarhāre tu cālayam ||

<p. 122>

aṣṭau tu parivārāṇāmālayāṣṭamatatsamam |
dvāraṃ gopuramānena devyālayasamaṃ bhavet ||

ālayārthamathārthaṃ vā ādiśedgopurasya tu |
sopānasyāgrataḥ kāryaṃ maṇṭapañcaturaśrakam ||

maṇṭapañca prakartavyaṃ kūṭaṃ vāpi tathaiva ca |
antarhārāntaraṃ pīṭhaṃ aindre pīṭhaṃ tathārcayet ||

madhyāhāre tataḥ kuryāt vāhanālayamagrataḥ |
anyeṣāṃ parivārāṇāṃ ālayaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet ||

ālayasya tu tatpūrve ādityālayameva ca |
āgneyāṃ vanaṃ sthānaṃ pacanālayakramantathā ||

yāmye mātṛgṛhe vāpi pṛṣṭhe pārśve tathaiva ca |
nair(-)ṛtyāṃ gogaṇasthānaṃ dhānyasaṃgrahamaṇṭapam ||

vāruṇe lakṣmīsthānaṃ pacanālaya kramantathā |
(yāmye mātṛgṛhe vāpi pṛṣṭhe pārśve tathaiva ca ||)

skandālayantu vāyavyāṃ some tu dhanasaṃgraham |
durgālayantu caivaṃ syāt sarpālayaṃ tathaiva ca ||

aiśānyāmudakasthānaṃ āryasthānantu bhairavam |
purastādbhūtapīṭhañca dhvajapīṭhaṃ tathaiva ca ||

paśupīṭhaṃ surāpīṭhaṃ piśācapīṭhantu bāhyataḥ |
śivameva yathā proktaṃ kuryācca vidhipūrvakam ||

<p. 123>

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ prākāralakṣaṇavidhirnāma 
aṣṭāviṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 28 ||

(ekontriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ - chapter 29
and
triṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ - chapter 30 is not available in this ṭranscript.)


athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi sthānadeva vidhikramam |
catuṣpathe tripathe caiva koṇe caiva kapardine ||

brahmasthāne sabhāsthāne devasthāne tathaiva ca |
maṇṭape gopure tatra siddhidaṃ kṣetrameva ca ||

catuṣpathe caturaśraṃ tripathe ca trikoṇake |
dumbarairmālinī devī kapardīviśvarūpiṇī ||

devasthānaṃ tathā proktaṃ (************) |
caturmukhī grāmamadhye tu pūrve caiva tu gomukhī ||

āgneyyāṃ ṣaṇmukhī devī nīlakeśī yamasya tu |
siṃhī ca nair(-)ṛte sthāne vāruṇe mahiṣamardinī ||

vāyavyāṃ ghātakī devī some caiva sudarśinī |
aiśānyāṃ piṃgalākṣī ca grāmapīṭhañca devatā ||

grapañca ātmagopī ca taṭāke caiva koṇakī |
parvate aṣṭahāsī ca vāpī vai caturbhujī ||

vane ca vajrakālī ca śāstā sthāne tu śālinī |
śivasthāne vajrapāṇi viṣṇusthāne śrībhūtakam ||

bilve sarasvatī devī koṣṭe ca gaṇarājinī |
durgāsthāne tu durgā ca jyeṣṭhā sthāne tu jyeṣṭhanī ||

<p. 124>

maṇṭape aṣṭasahasrī ca gopure pīṭhanāsinī |
gosthāne gomukhī caiva nadīnāṃ sarvadevatā ||

mahāvṛkṣe ugradaṃṣṭrī abhimukhī namo namaḥ |
oṃ namo bhagavatī nāgarājī nāgādikīrtitā ||

śmaśāne namo bhagavatī kuśalī viśvarūpiṇī |
oṃ namo bhagavatī ugradaṃṣṭrābhimukhī namaḥ ||

oṃ namo bhagavatī kṛcchrīpriyadarśī namo namaḥ |
oṃ namo bhagavatī kuṭilī ugramālādharī namaḥ ||

oṃ namo bhagavatī dhātu hrīṃkāriṇī namo namaḥ |
oṃ jvālādhipataye jvālā hemarūpāyi vimaladhruvāya namo namaḥ ||

jvālādhipati mantram |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ sthānadeva vidhirnāma 
ekatriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 31 ||


bhūmidoṣavidhānantu pravakṣyāmyanupūrvaśaḥ |
sarvavyādhiharaṃ śubhraṃ sadā vijayavardhanam ||

akālamṛtyuharaṇaṃ vasūrīdoṣanāśanam |
mahājvaravināśārthaṃ mahāśāntikaraṃ śubham ||

anāvṣṛṭestu śamanaṃ ativṛṣṭivivardhanam |
mahotpāte bhūmikampe mahāvāte tu kārayet ||

<p. 125>

lambā mūṣikākīrṇe śivotkṛṣṭe tu kārayet |
svacakra paracakraṃ vā kalahe janasaṃbhave ||

mahāvyādhisamākīrṇe narāṇāṃ vyādhipīḍite |
deva pratimarodhena devaprāsāda bhedane ||

sabhāsthānādi bhedena phalapuṣpanipātane |
mahāvāte prajāmāre gajānāṃ maraṇepi vā ||

akasmādaśvamaraṇe śastrāṇāṃ patanepi ca |
aśanipāte tu kartavyaṃ mātṛyāge tu śāntikam ||

āṣāḍhe vā bhādrapade durbhikṣe tu tathaiva ca |
mahāpīṭhe ca nirbandhe durbhikṣe sasyanāśane ||

bhūmidoṣeṇa kartavyaṃ mātṛyāge tu śāntikam |
āṣāḍhe bhādrapade ca phālgune caitrameva ca ||

vaiśākhe jyeṣṭhamāse ca kārtike puṣyameva ca |
kṛṣṇapakṣe caturdaśyā bhūmidoṣantu kārayet ||

sūryodaye vā kartavyaṃ pūrvā (**) vāyaśonam |
pratyūṣe vāpi kartavyaṃ madhyodayañca uttamam ||

ardhodaye tu mohaṃ syāt sarvakāmārthasādhanam |
grāmamadhye tu kartavyaṃ sarvavyādhi nivāraṇaṃ ||

sammārjanañca tatkṛtvā gomayena tu lepayet |
gandhapuṣpairalaṃkṛtya dhūpadīpasamanvitam ||

<p. 126>

puṇyāhaṃ jayaśabdaiśca śaṃkhadundubhinisvanaiḥ |
kāhalair(-)allarīśabdai vaṃśaisūryaravaiśśubhaiḥ ||

brāhmaṇān bhojayet tatra pañcāśad vedapāragāḥ |
kanyakā bhojayet tatra catuṣṣaṣṭi manuttamam ||

gandhapuṣpairalaṃkṛtvā surabhindhūpadīpakaiḥ |
pūrvottaramukho bhūtvā brahmasthāne tu dohayet ||

anyāssarvāstu tatraiva bhūmau dohyarvidhānavit |
mūlamantreṇa mantrajñaḥ prathamaṃ dohayet tathā ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa dohayet sarva dohanam |
bhūmidohana velāyāṃ vāsoddhārantu kārayet ||

dviratni mātrakuṇḍantu mekhalātrayabhūṣaṇam |
ratnimātrantu khataṃ syāt nābhinemi samanvitam ||

mekhalāntu cetsarvaṃ tripradeśaṃ suśobhanam |
ṣaḍaṃgulantu vistāramekaikaṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

aśvattha patravatkāryaṃ yoniṃ prādeśamātrakam |
nābhirvai tālamātrantu aṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

kaṇṭhaṃ kṛtvā yathānyāyaṃ homaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa mūlamantraṃ hunet kramāt ||

vāsoddhāraṃ punaḥ kuryāt palāśa vṛkṣādikam |
triratnimātramutsedhaṃ yathālakṣaṇaṃ (****) ||

<p. 127>

aśvatthaṃ khadiraṃ vāpi palāśañcaiva kārayet |
sandhānañca sahasrantu tadardhaṃ vāpi kārayet ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi sarṣapādi caruṃ budhaḥ |
tatpuraṃ tu homaṃ kṛtvā paścādvāraṃ tu kalpayet ||

putrasūtreṇa matimān samidhāñcaiva homayet |
hṛdāmantreṇa pūrveṇa dakṣiṇe mūlavidyayā ||

paścime kavacaṃ japya uttare cāstramantrataḥ |
yathādvārasamāpte tu pīṭhayuktasamāhitam ||

prathamaṃ bījamantreṇa tatastu kulavidyayā |
tatraiva mūlamantreṇa tatastu kālimantrataḥ ||

bṛhatīrantarañcaiva mahāvratajyeṣṭhasomaka |
vakaṇaṃ vā kuṇḍamantrañca bahiḥ pavanameva ca ||

śikhāyāntu śikhāṃ nyasya netre netre tu vinyaset |
hṛdaye hṛdayasye hastamantrantu hastakam ||

piṃgalā mūlamantreṇa vyomavyāpi tathaiva ca |
cāmuṇḍā hṛdayañjapya tathā pāraśavottamam ||

ācāryo homayet tatra śaktimantrantu pāṭhakaḥ |
suvarṇa kalaśaṃ vāpi rajataṃ mṛṇmayepi vā ||

ślakṣṇatāramavicchinna dyotako cetayed budhaḥ |
srajate sratadevyā ca yāraṃ tu cayet ||

<p. 128>

tatkṣaṇācchāntimāpnoti rogantu nāśayet |
pāṃsunā śīghramāpnoti sarvarogavināśanam ||

yathā gachanti śānti (************) |
trailokyaṃ śāntimāpnoti asurāṇāntu nāśanam ||

vasūrikājvarañcaiva kṣayaṃ vātha mahābhayāt |
tatkṣaṇānnāśamāyāti vasudhārāprabhāvataḥ ||

ācāryaṃ pūjayet tatra brāhmaṇānāntu bhojayet |
brāhmaṇān pūjayet paścāt samyagvastrairābharaṇaiśca vā ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ dohavasudhārārdha vidhirnāma 
dvātriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 32 ||


vāsārdhalakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye sarvakāmārthasādhanam |
mahāpātre bhūmikampe anāvṛṣṭisamudbhave ||

sūrikā jñānamekasya mahāvyādhi pathena ca |
śaratamuṣikākīrṇe durbhikṣe kārayedbudhaḥ ||

grāmadhye tu kartavyaṃ agnikuṇḍaṃ suśobhitam |
ratnidvayañca vistāraṃ tadardhaṃ nāmavinyate ||

mekhalātrayasaṃyuktaṃ sākaintu ṣaḍaṃgulam |
utsedha vistantadvannābhinemi sanātanam ||

<p. 129>

nābhi pradeśa mātrantu yonigokarṇa mātrataḥ |
aśvatthapatraṃ yad yoni nābhipadmākṛtiṃ sukhaiḥ ||

palāśakhadirañcaiva aśvatthaṃ vaṭameva ca |
ratnimātrasamutsedhaṃ nāhaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulam ||

tārāṃgulyā ca kartavyaṃ saptāṃgulasamanvitam |
palāśaṃ pātapūrve tu khadirandakṣiṇe na tu ||

paścime tu tathāśvatthaṃ uttare vaṭavṛkṣakam |
staṃbadhyāyopari nyasya cottaraṃ dakṣiṇaṃ mukham ||

raktāyāntu paṭhet pūrve karālandakṣiṇe paṭhet |
caṇḍantu paścime pāṭhe mahocchiṣṭottare paṭhet ||

amūraṇyāmardhayitvā agnijātena buddhimān |
pañcadaśa kṛtādhīmān mardayejjātavedasam ||

daśaṃ satkṛtya vidhivat kulamantreṇa saṃyutam |
garbhādhanādikaṃ kṛtvā pṛthak ca sādhayed budhaḥ ||

imañca vartate naiva ekaviṃśati saṃkhyayā |
dhārāsamidhasāhasraṃ pṛthak gokarṇa mātrataḥ ||

tat tan mantreṇa saṃyuktaṃ ekaikaṃ samidhāhutam |
dvau dvau dvāraṃ prakartavyaṃ dvau dvau cādhyayanaṃ bhavet ||

puṇyāha jayaśabdaiśca śaṃkhaṃ kuryācchubhairapi |
gandhapuṣpaiśca dhūpaiśca dīpamarghya havīṣiṃ ca ||

<p. 130>

kṣīraṃ lājaistilaiścaiva guguṇā juhuyāt pṛthak |
ekaikasya sahasraṃ syāt bhūtiśca vāmatāt ||

vasordhārā pramāṇantu haviccheda samātrataḥ |
yāvatsamāptasahitā tāvat dvāraṃ vidhīyate ||

athavā puruṣasūktena sahasraṃ vā japet tataḥ |
athavā rudrasūktena sahasraṃ vā japet tataḥ ||

jyeṣṭhāmantreṇa vā mantrī sahasrañjapamācaret |
cāmuṇḍī mūrtibhedena mantrabhedena sarvaśaḥ ||

tena tenaiva mantreṇa vāsoddhāraṃ samāhitaḥ |
athavā rudrasūktena muṇḍādhāramathāpi vā ||

athavānugrahasūktena ambudasvāmi śaktiṣu |
gāyatryāḥ prajapenmantrī vāsoddhārantu kārayet ||

atannavākṣaraṃ japyaṃ vāsoddhārantu kārayet |
vāsoddhāraṃ prakartavyaṃ vyāhṛtiścaiva buddhimān ||

āyudhe sarvavyādhi nāśamāyānti kevalam |
vāsoddhāraṃ prakartavyaṃ kṛṣṇāṣṭamyā viśeṣataḥ ||

mahāmārī vināśārthaṃ caturdaśyāmathācaret |
amāvāsyāṃ pratipate vāsoddhārantu kārayet ||

kṛṣṇapakṣe caturdaśyāṃ sarvavyādhi vināśanam |
viśeṣeṇa vasūriñca nāśayet tatra saṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 131>

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena bhūtādi naiva kārayet |
sahasrāḍhakaṃ ghṛtenaiva vāsoddhārantu kārayet ||

vāsoddhāraṃ namate vivaśetadardhenābhi kārayet |
atha śatāḍhake naiva vāsoddhārantu kārayet ||

vāsoddhāranna deveśa mahiṣī manalasya tu |
tenaiva pitṛmāpnoti sarvavyādhi haro bhavet ||

vāsorddhāraṃ prakartavyaṃ mahāmārī vināśanam |
subhikṣaṃ gobalañcaiva āyurārogya saṃpadam ||

brāhmaṇān bhojayet tatra kanyakāṃ bhojayet kramāt |
tatraiva bhojayet tatra baliṃ sarvatra dāpayet ||

bandhañcaiva mokṣaṃ syāt aṃganāvasecanā navā |
pūjayet sarva devāṃśca gandhapuṣpaṃ havistathā ||

pure sarvajanāścaiva snānaṃ kṛtvāmbarānvitāḥ |
śuklagandhānuliptāśca śuklamālyaiśca bhūṣitāḥ ||

prokṣaṇīyā janāssarve vāsorddhārasamutsukāḥ |
taddine caiva pūrvāhṇe purābhāṇḍaṃ tyajed bahiḥ ||

mṛṇmayāni ca bhāṇḍāni purāṇāni ca mārjanam |
purāṇabhāṇḍasūrpāṇa bhūtabhāṇḍāni sarvaśaḥ ||

grāmādbahisthitaṃ vidvān vāsoddhāraṃ tathā kuru |
grāmamadhye tu kartavyaṃ vāsoddhāraṃ samāhitaḥ ||

<p. 132>

āvāhya sarvadevānāṃ brahmaviṣṇu maheśvarān |
indrāgni yamanair(-)ṛtyāṃ vāruṇaṃ vāyumeva ca ||

someśāna gaṇāṃścaiva indrāditya marudgaṇāḥ |
vasavaścāṣṭabhiścaiva dvādaśāditya eva ca ||

rudrā ekādaśassarve aśvinau dvau tathaiva ca |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||

vārāhī caiva māhendrī cāmuṇḍā ca gaṇādhipāḥ |
vīrabhadrañca durgā ca lakṣmī jyeṣṭhā vasundharā ||

sarasvatī uttamā gaṃgāṃ āvāhya vidhivadbudhaḥ |
mahāmārī mahādevī cāmuṇḍā tu varā sadā ||

khārā sānantarūpāśca sūrpahastā bhayānakā |
mūrtimārjani saṃyuktā aiśānyāṃ pūjayedbudhaḥ ||

abhyantare yajeddhīmān brahmaviṣṇu maheśvarān |
skandamādityamantraiśca pūrvabhāge tu pūjayet ||

aiśānyāṃ pūjayed vidvān vasūn pūrvottare yajet |
marudgaṇāvayavaiścaiva pūjya aśvinyāṃśaṃ rodaśam ||

umā śriyā sarasvatyā durgā caiva vasundharā |
gāyatrī devamātā ca gaṃgā prājñāyatā yuti ||

abhyantare yajeddhīmān vāsordhāraparikramāt |
dakṣiṇe saptamātṝṇāṃ vīrabhadragaṇādhipa ||

<p. 133>

lokapālānnyasedbāhye svasve sthāne samāhitaḥ |
agneḥ paścime bhāge cādhikaṃ tatra pūjayet ||

vāmapārśve tathāviṣṇuṃ dakṣiṇe śaṃkaraṃ yajet |
bāhyato lokapālānāṃ mahāmāriṃ kadiśam ||

pūjayet madhyamāṃścaiva āghuvaidarodanaiḥ |
svasvenaiva tu mantreṇa pūjayet tridaśeśvarān ||

gandhapuṣpaiśca dhūpaiśca dīpanaivedyameva ca |
pāyasena nivedyaṃ syāt brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarān ||

(************) nivedyaṃ syāt śeṣātsarveṣu |
mahāmāritaruddreṇa sahasraṃ vā japet tathā ||

jyeṣṭhāmantreṇa vā mantrī sahasraṃ japamācaret |
cāmuṇḍī mūrtibhedena bhadrabhedena sarvadā ||

dātavyañcaiva cāmuṇḍī piṃgalo piṃgalāni ca |
kṛsarannatu dātavyaṃ pitṛdevāśca sarvadā ||

gandhodanantu (************) ṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
(************) kānāṃ pannagānapi ||

asurāsurasiddhāśca yakṣavidyādharānapi |
kiṃnarā apsarā daityā piśācā bhūtayogyakāḥ ||

yoginī ḍākinī caitā guhyamātaragānapi |
sarve māṃsayutaṃ syāt baliṃ sarvatra dāpayet ||

<p. 134>

brāhmaṇān bhojayet tatra vastrābharaṇapūjanaiḥ |
ācārya dakṣiṇāṃ datvā go bhūmī kāñcanādibhiḥ ||

gajāścaturagañcaiva dāsī dāsañca dāpayet |
pradakṣiṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pratye pratyakṣamāpayet ||

vāsoddhāra vidhi hyetan mahāmāri vināśanam |
kapilāyāṃ sahasrantu dattasyātphalamāpnuyāt ||

vāsoddharavidhānena yantraṃ kuryānnarādhipa |
tatraiva jāyate vāpi rudhirāsūrya niścayaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ vāsoddhāralakṣaṇavidhirnāma 
trayastriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 33 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi jīrṇoddhāra vidhiṃ śṛṇu |
mūlasthānaṃ samāśritya bālasthānaṃ prakalpayet ||

bālasthāna pratiṣṭhā tu sīmānañca tathaiva ca |
sīmatā ṣaṭtathā caiva kṛṣṭe kārārddhameva ca ||

lakṣaṇaṃ vāstu bhūmestu tasyādrohaṇameva ca |
tasyāṃkurāṇāṃ rakṣārthaṃ bhūmivṛkṣyarthameva ca ||

śāntihomaṃ tataḥ kuryāt śaṃkhabheryādighoṣayet |
ratnimātraṃ khanitvā tu pāṃsumuddhṛtya pūrayet ||

prokṣaṇaṃ pañcagavyena paryagniñca samācaret |
kīḍikeśāsthiloṣṭe ca sthāne tatraiva dṛśyate ||

<p. 135>

śāntihomaṃ tataḥ kuryāt kṛtvā punaḥ karmasamācaret |
ārṣapauruṣaṃ vāpi tatvāṃśataruṇālayam ||

antasāre mukhe madhye pūrvādīśe tu vāruṇe |
hyattare vā viśeṣeṇa bālasthānaṃ prakalpayet ||

mūlarūpantu naṣṭaṃ syāt pūrvārcā pratimaṃ bhavet |
iṣṭamārge vasan tatra pratirūpaṃ prakalpayet ||

aṣṭasaptanavāṃgulyaṃ pañcaṣaṭcaturaṃgulam |
ekavarṣantu śūnyañca pūjāśūnyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

dvivarṣāṇi ca bhūtāni trivarṣantu piśācakam |
caturvarṣantu gandharva pañcavarṣāsurāśraya ||

saptamamalpatatvañca aṣṭau vetālameva ca |
daśavarṣañca śūnyañca brahmarākṣasamāśraye ||

mūlaprāsādaśūnyañca āśrayantu na saṃśayaḥ |
śānti homaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sādhakān svasti vācayet ||

prāsāde bhinna hīnañca prācīnākṛti yojayet |
yojanaṃ śilpibhiḥ kāryamiṣṭakā śailadārubhiḥ ||

yadyattu kalpitaṃ pūrvaṃ tattenaiva tu kārayet |
uttamaṃ śailajaṃ proktaṃ madhyamaṃ dāruyojanam ||

kanyasantviṣṭakā caiva yojayet pūrvakarmaṇā |
hyuttarottarajaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ tannyūnaṃ naiva kārayet ||

<p. 136>

puṇyāhaṃ pratyahaṃ kuryāt śilpibhiḥ kārite sthale |
saṃprokṣaṇamataḥ kuryāt sthalakarmāvasānake ||

pañcaratnena saṃyuktaṃ pañcagavyantu pūjayet |
mūlarūpantu naṣṭaṃ syāt bālabimbaṃ prakalpayet ||

atha prāsādabhinnaṃ vā bālasthānaṃ prakalpitam |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena śāstradṛṣṭena kārayet ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ jīrṇoddhāravidhirnāma 
catustriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 34 ||


bālasthāna vidhiṃ vakṣye bahuvīryekavīrikam |
bālasthānaṃ prakurvīta subhikṣaṃ sasya vardhanam ||

āyurārogyakañcaiva sarvasaṃpat pravardhanam |
pūrve tu vijayaṃ jñeyaṃ putrapautrādi vardhanam ||

āgneyaṃ śatruvijayaṃ vipulaṃ dhanamāpnuyāt |
uttare jāti vṛddhiḥ syāt pūjyamācandratārakam ||

bālasthānaṃ purā kṛtvā paścāt prāsādamārabhet |
bālasthānaṃ samārabhya tattatprāsādaneṣyate ||

vittahā janmahā caiva rāṣṭranāśastathaiva ca |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena bālasthānaṃ prakalpayet ||

<p. 137>

śilābhiriṣṭakairvāpi pārthivenāpi kārayet |
trihastaṃ vā caturhastaṃ pañcahastamathāpi vā ||

ṣaṭ hastaṃ saptahastaṃ vā ata ūrdhvaṃ na kārayet |
tatraiva dāruṇā caiva arcāyāḥ prathamaṃ kuru ||

mūlasya pratimāṃ kuryāt śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
maṇṭapañcaturaśrantu caturdvārasamāyutam ||

catustoraṇasaṃyuktaṃ darbhamālābhiveṣṭitam |
dhvajāṣṭakasamāyuktaṃ puṣpamālyairalaṃkṛtam ||

madhye vedi prakartavyā dhanumuṣṭidvayaṃ bhavet |
tatraiva pūrayecchālī droṇasaptakameva ca ||

tadardhaṃ taṇḍulaṃ grāhyaṃ padmamaṣṭadalairlikhet |
tanmadhye śayanaṃ kuryāt kambalairvastrapaṭṭakaiḥ ||

kasyopari nyaset kūrcaṃ gandhapuṣpaiśca saṃyutam |
tasyopari nyased devīṃ bhīmarūpīṃ trilocanīm ||

vastrayugmena sañcchādyaṃ upavītañca dāpayet |
svarṇapuṣpañca datvā tu mūlamantreṇa dāpayet ||

prāsādābhimukhād deviṃ śayane śayayed guruḥ |
hṛdaye hṛyaṃ nyasya lalāṭe praṇavaṃ nyaset ||

sthāne navākṣarañcaiva namaskāreṇa hastayoḥ |
netramantraṃ nyaseddhīmān devīnaloṣṭrapena ca ||

<p. 138>

yatpañcakaṃ nyasecchotraṃ nāsāsyantu tṛtīyakam |
turīyantu tṛtīyaṃ vā pādayorvinyased budhaḥ ||

sṛṣṭibījaṃ nyased guhye pṛṣṭhe tārantu vinyaset |
mūrdhnipādacaturthantu praṣṭatātantu vinyaset ||

evaṃ nyastvā vidhānena bimbaśuddhiṃ samācaret |
gandhapuṣpañca dhūpañca dīpamapyapavitrakam ||

puṇyāhaṃ vidhivat kṛtvā snapanañcaiva kārayet |
vividhairbhakṣya bhojyena mūlamantreṇa yojayet ||

brāhmaṇān bhojayet samyak aṣṭottaraśatāni vai |
evameva prakāreṇa pūrvādi kramayogataḥ ||

palāśaṃ khadirāśvatthaṃ bilvavaikaṃkatāni ca |
deśikantu palāśena pūgāṭ khādirameva ca ||

tilasarṣapalājairvā samidhājya carūn budhaḥ |
pṛthagaṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā hutvā tu saṃspṛśet ||

tilaṃ hutvā spṛśet pādaṃ mūlamantreṇa buddhimān |
hutvā tu sarvapāṣāṇāṃ tu ekaṃ spṛṣṭvā tu saṃspṛśet ||

lājaṃ hutvā kaṭiṃ spṛśya caruṃ hutvodaraṃ spṛśet |
samidhaṃ hutvā spṛśeddhasta mudrā kūrcasamanvitam ||

ājyaṃ hutvā tu sarvāṃgaṃ spṛśen mūlasya mudrayā |
navākṣareṇa juhuyāt pūrvavat samapaṃkajam ||

<p. 139>

mūlamantreṇa hutvā tu tato mūlantu vinyaset |
indrāgnika yamaścaiva nair(-)ṛtirvaruṇavāyavaḥ ||

someśānadevānaṃ lokapālāṃstathaiva ca |
bhadrakālī mahākālī cāmuṇḍī caṇḍikā tathā ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī caiva māhendrī vīrabhadro gaṇādhipaḥ ||

bhūtāścaiva piśācāśca vetālaṃ pretanāyakī |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa svanāmapadasaṃyutam ||

praṇavādi caturthāntaṃ homayet khalupūrvaśaḥ |
vasubhiścāṣṭabhiścaiva rudraikādaśabhistathā ||

ādityādvādaśañcaiva samudrāssapta eva ca |
saptadvīpasamākhyātā lokāssaptaprakīrtitāḥ ||

pṛthivyāpastathāgnīśo vāyurākāśameva ca |
śabdasparśarūpañca rasagandhaiśca pañcamam ||

karmendriyāṇi pañcaiva tathā buddhindriyāṇi ca |
buddhimānaścāhaṃkāra prakṛtiḥ puruṣastathā ||

rāgavidyākule caiva māyā bindu tathaiva ca |
vigraheśañcaiva śuddhaśuddhavidyādhikameva ca ||

ekāhaṃ pañcabhiḥ kṛtvā mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ |
kalaśān sthāpayet pūrvaṃ sūtrān kālavivarjitān ||

<p. 140>

sakūrcā dravyasaṃyuktā sāpidhānā sa vastrakā |
madhyame kalaśe brāhmī pavitrāratnavinyaset ||

kṣīraṃ vai pūrvakalaśe dakṣiṇe tu dadhinyaset |
paścime tu ghṛtaṃ nyasya pañcagavyantu cottare ||

śyāmakamagnikalaśe nairṛtyāṃ vaiṇavaṃ nyaset |
vāyavyāṃ śālivinyasya aiśānyāntu kuśodakam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa mantrayitvā tu pūrvavat |
devyāstu paridhe dhīmān kalaśaṃ vinyaset pṛthak ||

raktā karalī caṇḍākṣī (**) cchiṣṭantathaiva ca |
nivṛttiśca patiṣṭha ca vidyāśāntistathaiva ca ||

arcayitvā vidhānena gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt |
rātrau mahotsavaṃ kuryāt śaṃkhabheryādinisvanaiḥ ||

puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu sūtraṃ vai bandhayet tathā |
ādau sarveṣu kartavyaṃ puṇyāhaṃ sarvakarmasu ||

rātrau homaṃ prakartavyaṃ prabhāte sthāpanaṃ kuru |
sumuhūrtadine caiva bālasthānaṃ praveśayet ||

kālamanho vidhānajña yāvat prāsādasañcayaḥ |
tāvat tiṣṭhet baligrāme trisaptadvādaśa kramāt ||

āsthāpana vidhānena sthāpayeddhṛdayena tu |
āsthāpanantu hṛdayaṃ sthāpanānāṃ tu mūlataḥ ||

<p. 141>

kalaśān sthāpayed bimbe navākṣareṇa buddhimān |
kalaśodakena sarvantu prokṣayeddhṛdayena tu ||

pīṭhe garbharddhibhittiśca prāsādaṃ maṇṭapantu vā |
parivārāñca sarvāṃśca prokṣayed deśikottamaḥ ||

paśuṃ hatvā tu tatraiva trayo vā ekameva vā |
nivedayedrakta deveśī hṛdayena samāhitaḥ ||

nivedyandāpayet tatra vastrairābharaṇairapi |
brāhmaṇān bhojayet paścāt kanyakāssapta bhojayet ||

sarve varṇa kramāt tataḥ |
tasmādbhūtabaliṃ grāme naradvāse samāyudhaḥ ||

lājasaktu samāyuktaṃ sarvatra balidāpayet |
hṛnmantreṇa baliṃ datvā balipīṭhañca buddhimān ||

ācāryān pūjayet sarvaṃ vastrahemāṃgulīyakaiḥ |
yāgopayogadravyāṇi vastramābharaṇāni ca ||

ācāryastu yathādravyaṃ vividhāmayakantathā |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ bālasthānavidhirnāma 
pañcatriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 35 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi jalasaṃprokṣaṇaṃ śubham |
sūtakī pretakī caiva hyālayābhyantare gataḥ ||

<p. 142>

caṇḍālaiḥ patitairvāpi kṣetrācāraviruddhakaiḥ |
praviṣṭe devagehe ca mohādvā jñānatopi vā ||

sparśitaṃ liṃgaberādi devamānamathāpi vā |
prāṇināṃ maraṇe caiva nānādoṣasamudbhave ||

saṃprokṣaṇamataḥ kuryācchāstra dṛṣṭeṇa karmaṇā |
maṇṭapaṃ kārayet samyak pūrvoktavidhinā budhaḥ ||

aṣṭadīrghajasaṃyuktaṃ kalaśaissamalaṃkṛtam |
śālibhisthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā aṣṭadroṇaistu buddhimān ||

tadardhaṃ taṇḍulañcaiva tasyārdhaṃ tilameva ca |
tasyārdhaṃ lājasaṃyuktaṃ darbhamuṣṭiśca vistṛtam ||

tanmadhye paṅkajaṃ likhye sāṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam |
tarpūrve yonikuṇḍañca ācāryo vidhisattamaḥ ||

kalaśāṃstu vaṭāṃścaiva trisūtraṃ veṣṭayecchubham |
lohajairmṛṇmayaiścaiva kṣālitaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

ghṛtakṣīradadhīṃścaiva arghyapātraṃ kramān nyaset |
madhye (**) ntu vinyasya pañcaratnaṃ sunikṣipet ||

pūrve tu kṣīravinyasya uttarepya (*) meva tu |
dadhīnāṃ dakṣiṇe caiva paścimantu ghṛtaṃ nyaset ||

pādyantu vinyaset mantrī pūrvoktaissarvameva tu |
(*) ṣāyaṃ pañcagavyañca ikṣusārantathaiva ca ||

<p. 143>

śeṣāṇi para (*) ttoya navākṣareṇa mantritam |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||

vārāhī caiva māhendrī cāmuṇḍā ca prakīrtitā |
vīrabhadragaṇādyāśca svasvamantreṇa vinyaset ||

kālī caiva mahākālī surālī tu catuṣkalā |
surālī yuktamadhye tu kalaśasya nyased budhaḥ ||

raktā karālī caṇḍākṣī mahocchiṣṭā pṛthak nyaset |
caturdikṣu ca vinyasya homaṃ kuryād yathā purā ||

palāśaṃ khadirāśvatthaṃ plakṣanyagrodhameva ca |
aśvatthodumbarañcaiva bilvavaikaṃkatāni ca ||

samidhājya carurlājaṃ dadhikṣīraṃ tathaiva ca |
hutamaṣṭottaraśataṃ pratyekaṃ sarva mūrtiṣu ||

brahmādi mūrtibhiścaiva dhārayenmūrti dhārakāḥ |
hutvā japtvā spṛśed devīnnavākṣareṇa buddhimān ||

sumuhūrte sulagne ca yoge ca karaṇānvite |
navākṣarantu bimbe vā praṇavādi namontakam ||

navākṣareṇa saṃyuktaśśastre saṃprokṣayed budhaḥ |
snapanoktavidhānena abhiṣiñcedyathā śubham ||

nṛttavādyaiśca saṃpūrṇaṃ nānāghoṣasamanvitam |
vedaghoṣasamāyuktaṃ sarvātodya samāyutam ||

<p. 144>

evameva vidhānena abhiṣiñcedyathā śubham |
nṛttavādyaiśca saṃpūrṇaṃ nānāghoṣasamanvitam ||

vedaghoṣasamāyuktaṃ |

kalaśodakantu saṃgrāhya pratimāñcābhiṣecanam |
prāsāde parivāre ca subāhyābhyantarepi ca ||

sarvaṃ saṃprokṣayed vidvān pūrvoktaṃ mūlavinyaset |
āvāhayet tato devīṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām ||

aṣṭābhujāntriṇetrāñca nāgābharaṇabhūṣitām |
nāgayajñopavītena śiro mālāvibhūṣitām ||

pralayasthiti sarvāṇāṃ jagadyoniṃ maheśvarīm |
pratimāyāṃ nyased devī kujavāre viśeṣataḥ ||

tataḥ prabhṛti yatnena pūjayet tatra vittamaḥ |
pratiṣṭhā caiva tatkāle ācārya svasti vācakaiḥ ||

nānābharaṇadravyaiśca gobhūmī kāñcanādibhiḥ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ saṃprokṣaṇavidhirnāma 
ṣaṭtriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 36 || 


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi kṣetrācāra vidhikramam |
varṇānāmānupūrṇyaśca śṛṇubrahman samāhitaḥ ||

sevanaṃ garbhagehañca deśikānāṃ vidhīyate |
ardhamaṇṭapasevā ca śrotriyāṇāṃ samīritam ||

<p. 145>

tadbahikṣatraviṭbhyāntu tadbahiśśūdrasevanam |
sūcikastantu vāgvaśca tilaghātī ca sūnikaḥ ||

takṣakassvarṇakāraśca śilābhedī tu lohakaḥ |
kumbhakāraśca gopālo hyete vai nyūnajātayaḥ ||

etaistu darśanañcaiva kartavyaṃ dhvajamūlataḥ |
rajakādi hīnajānāndarśanaṃ bahirālayāt ||

caṇḍālaśvapacādīnāṃ kṣetrācca śatadaṇḍake |
eteṣāṃ vyatyaye naiva kṣetrāntarveśane sati ||

devasānnidhyahīnañca mahādoṣaḥ prajāyate |
mahāmāripraveśañca sarve vai puravāsinaḥ ||

pīḍyante satataṃ rogaistad doṣaśamanāya ca |
puṇyāhantu prakurvīta saṃprokṣaṇamathācaret ||

varṇānāṃ kramaśo vakṣye śṛṇu brahman samāsataḥ |
brāhmaṇyāṃ brāhmaṇājjāta saṃskṛto brāhmaṇo bhavet ||

evaṃ kṣatriyaviṭśudrāḥ jñeyāssvebhyassvayonijāḥ |
adhyāpanaṃ cādhyayanaṃ yajanaṃ yājanaṃ tathā ||

dānaṃ pratigrahaśceti ṣaṭkarmāṇyagrajanmanaḥ |
ṣaṇṇāntu karmaṇāmasya trīṇi karmāṇi jīvikā ||

yājanādhyāpane caiva viśuddhācca pratigrahaḥ |
ijyādhyayanadānāni vaiśyasya kṣatriyasya ca ||

<p. 146>

pratigrahodhiko vipre yājanādhyāpane tathā |
nṛpāyāṃ viprato jātassavarṇo brāhmaṇo bhavet ||

āyurvedātharvaveda dhanurvedān sadāpaṭhet |
viprasya triṣu varṇeṣu nṛpatervarṇayordvayoḥ ||

vaiśyasya varṇa ekasmin ṣaḍete paśadā smṛtāḥ |
vaiśyāyāṃ vidhinā viprājjāto hyambaṣṭha ucyate ||

kṛṣyā jīvī bhavet tasya tathaivāgneya vṛttikaḥ |
dhvajinī jīvikā vāpi ambaṣṭhāśśastra jīvinaḥ ||

vaiśyāyāṃ viprataśceryotkumbhakārassa ucyate |
kulālavṛtyā jīveta nāpitvā vā bhavantyataḥ ||

nābherūrdhvantu vapanaṃ tasmānnāpita ucyate |
śūdrāyāṃ vidhinā viprājjātaḥ pāraśivo mataḥ ||

bhadrakāli samāśṛtya jīveyuḥ pūjakāḥ smṛtāḥ |
tasyāṃ vai cauryato jāto niṣādaśca prakīrtitaḥ ||

vane duṣṭamṛgān hatvā jīvanaṃ māṃsavikrayam |
nṛpājjātotha vaiśyāyāṃ gṛhyāyāṃ vidhinā sutaḥ ||

vaiśyavṛtyā tu jīveta kṣatrirmanna cācaret |
tasyāṃ tasyaiva cauryeṇa maṇikāraḥ prajāyate ||

maṇīnāṃ rājatāṃ kuryāt muktānāṃ vedhanakriyām |
śūdrā kṣatrasaṃsargājjāta ugra iti smṛtaḥ ||

<p. 147>

nṛpasya daṇḍadhārasyādaṇḍaṃ daṇḍyeṣu sañcaret |
vaiśyā tu karaṇaśśūdryāṃ bhinnāyāntu vidhismṛtaḥ ||

māhiṣyeṇa karaṇyāntu rathakāraḥ prajāyate |
śilpakarmāṇi cānyāni prāsādalakṣaṇaṃ tathā ||

paṭhanāṃ vastuśāstrāṇāṃ hemānyābharaṇāni ca |
lohakarma tathā kuryāt rathakārasya vṛttayaḥ ||

nṛpād brāhmaṇakanyāyāṃ sūto nāma prajāyate |
vedānarhaṃ tathā caiṣāṃ dharmāṇāmanubodhakaḥ ||

vaiśyādvai dehaśśūdrāccaṇḍālo nāma jāyate |
kṣatriyā māgadhaṃ vaiśyāchūdrākṣattārameva ca ||

śūdrādāyogavaṃ vaiśyā janayāmāsa vaisutam |
nṛpāyāṃ vaiśyataścauryāt pulindo nāmajāyate ||

hiṃsayā duṣṭasatvānāmaraṇye vartayedayam |
śūdrādāyogavaḥ kṣattā caṇḍāścādhamo nṛṇām ||

yathaiva śūdrād brāhmaṇyāṃ bāhyajantu prasūyate |
tathā bāhyataraṃ bāhyāccāturvaṇyaṃ prasūyate ||

prātilomyena saṃbhūtāssarvakarmabahiṣkṛtāḥ |
ugrāttu jātaḥ kṣatrāyāṃ śvapāka iti kīrtitaḥ ||

caṇḍālaśva pacānāntu bahirgrāmātprati śrayaḥ |
varṣopetamavijñātannaraṃ kaluṣayonijam ||

<p. 148>

āryarūpamivānāryaṃ karmabhissvairvibhāvayet |
varṇānāmānupūrvyeṇa jāto vai hyanulomajaḥ ||

vaiparītyena saṃbhūto pratiloma itīritaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ kṣetrācāravarṇaviveko nāma 
saptatriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 37 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi bālasthāpanamuttamam |
prāsāde chinnabhinne vā pratimā vā tathā yadi ||

navīnaṃ kārayet paścāt sarvāṃgaṃ citraśobhanam |
tataḥ praveśakāle tu pūrvavadvidhimācaret ||

kuṇḍamaṇṭapa prāsāda pratimāṃ śuddhimācaret |
sthāpayed deva deveśi tantroktaṃ vidhinā kuru ||

anyathā saṃpravakṣyāmi śuddhāsanamuttamam |
sumuhūrte ca nakṣatre yoge ca karaṇānvite ||

rātrādhivāsayed devīmmātaraṃ sahatatkramāt |
purato deva deveśī dhānyarāśau vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

vṛttaṃ vā caturaśraṃ vā yogapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet |
śālinā pūjayet tatra pañcadroṇaistathā kramāt ||

tasyopari nyasenmantrī droṇapañcakataṇḍulaiḥ |
caturaśra samaṃ kṛtvā pañcagavyena prokṣayet ||

<p. 149>

tanmadhye tu likhet padmamaṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam |
hemarupyamayaṃ kumbhaṃ tāmrañca mṛṇamayantu vā ||

kalaśānnavakaṃ grāhya supakvān sudṛḍhāñca vā |
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ kalaśānvinyaset kramāt ||

indretyācamanaṃ nyastvā āgneyyāṃ madhyameva tu |
yāmye pādyantu vinyasya nair(-)ṛtyāntu kaṣāyakam ||

vāruṇyāṃ kṣīraṃ vinyasya vāyavyāṃ dadhivinyaset |
saumyāyāṃ sarpivinyasya aiśānyāṃ gavyameva tu ||

brāhmyādīnnyaset tatra svasvamantreṇa dāpayet |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||

vārāhī caiva māhendrī īśvarī ca (****) |
navame (**) ekavīrī (**) madhye kalaśeṣu vidurbudhaḥ ||

gandhapuṣpaiśca dhūpaiśca arcayitvā vidhānataḥ |
vinyaset padmamadhyantu karṇikāyāṃ susaṃhitam ||

mātarasthalamadhyastha pūrvāditamayogata |
nikṣipet pañcaratnāni navabījena mantravit ||

vāriṇā pūrayet paścāt vastrapūtaṃ sugandhibhiḥ |
kūrcākṣatavinyasya vastrayugmena veṣṭayet ||

raktenopari sañcchādya mantramudrāṃ pradarśayet |
evantu kalaśānnyasya paścād dhyāna paro bhavet ||

<p. 150>

pṛthivī pākajaṃ dhyātvā karṇikā merunirmitam |
karṇikopari vinyasya deveśīṃ bhūtamātaram ||

kapālakhaṭvāṃga dhārī mahāpretakṛtāsana |
caturbhujā cāṣṭabhujā triṇetrāṃ rudrarūpiṇīm ||

diśāmbarāṃ mukakeśāṃ mahāvyālavibhūṣitām |
kapālamālinīn devīṃ pralayāgni samaprabhām ||

sūryakoṭyāyudhaprakhyā surāsurabhayaṃkarīm |
itthaṃ rūpadharīndevīṃ kalaśe sthāpayed budhaḥ ||

nirodhantatra kartavyaṃ mantramudrā samanvitam |
naivedyaṃ vidhinā dadyāt yātrāhomaṃ samārabhet ||

aṣṭabhiḥ pañcabhirvāpi homaṃ kuryā sa dīkṣitaiḥ |
bilvaṃ palāśakhadiraṃ vaṭamaudumbarastathā ||

plakṣaṃ vaikaṃkatañcaiva aśvatthaṃ vāruṇaṃ tathā |
pūrvādikṣu yathānyāyaṃ homaṃ kuryāt samantrakaiḥ ||

kuṇḍeṣveva vicitreṣu lakṣaṇeṣu ca buddhimān |
caturaśraṃ bhavedindre āgneyyāṃ yoni saṃbhavam ||

yāmyāyāñcārdhacandrantu nair(-)ṛtyāntu trikoṇakam |
vāruṇyāṃ vartulaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vāyugocare ||

uttare caiva padmābhaṃ aiśānyāñcāṣṭakoṇakam |
eteṣu kuṇḍamevoktaṃ kuṇḍeṣu ca vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

<p. 151>

svasvenaiva tu mantreṇa mūrtidhāraiśca homayet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā sadṛśenaiva lambite ||

śirodeśe tu devānāṃ ācāryo homamārabhet |
tilasiddhārthakañcaiva priyaṃguśālilājakam ||

ājyaṃ hutvā hunet sarvān bāla (************) |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā pratyekaṃ sarvamūrtiṣu ||

ācārya dviguṇaṃ hutvā pu (*) ṇataruṇālaye |
(**) kāle kriyā sarvān adhivāsana karmasu ||

calasya ca nyasenmantrī pūrvokte ca (****) yet |
gurubālasthānamalaṃkṛtya vitānādyupaśobhitam ||

deśakālaṃ tataḥ prāpya bālasthāne niveśayet |
calantu sthāpitaṃ kāryaṃ bālasthānantu deśikaḥ ||

tatpayavayaṃ gacchet ācāryo sādhakaissaha |
śanairutkṛtya kalaśaṃ pūrvavatsmaraṇānvitam ||

niṣṭapya dvāradeśe tu śanairgacchet pradakṣiṇaṃ |
praviśya bālasthāneṣu devīnāmarcayed budhaḥ ||

kalaśānāntu sarveṣāṃ arcayecchūla vinyaset |
arcayitvā vidhānena naivedyaṃ vidhivad dadet ||

pañcopacārakān sarvān samantreṇa tu dāpayet |
mahābaliṃ tato dadyāt bhūtakrūrasamanvitam ||

<p. 152>

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ bālasthāpanavidhirnāma 
aṣṭatriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 38 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi laṃghanasya vidhikramam |
strīṇāñcaiva tu viprāṇāṃ pramādāllaṃghane sati ||

raktasrāvena kartavyamekavīrī nivedanam |
kṣatriyasya tu laṃghaiśca māṃsacchedantu kārayet ||

athavā pṛthumāṃsaiśca ajamekaṃ hunet budhaḥ |
vaiśyasya laṃghane caiva prati māṃsantu dāpayet ||

śūdrāṇāṃ laṃghane caiva ekamāsantu dāpayet |
haṃsairmayaiśca mahiṣaiḥ śvānaiścaiva kharoṣṭrakaiḥ ||

aśvañcaiva tathā jambu vānarādi tathaiva ca |
hastinaṃ kukkuṭañcaiva sadyotantu dāpayet ||

paśūnāñca tapasvīnāṃ brāhmaṇena tu laṃghane |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā ajamekavyaghātayet ||

pratilomādilaṃghairvā caṇḍālai (**) laṃghayet |
sadyo ghātantu kartavyaṃ mutsavya (************) ||

(****) maṃ prakūrvīta samidhādi yathākramam |
mūlagāyatrimantreṇa juhuyādyovikaṃ viduḥ ||

<p. 153>

kanyānāṃ laṃghayitvā tu aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutam ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ nagaraparibhramaṇalaṃghavidhirnāma 
ekonacatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 39 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi pratimālakṣaṇaṃ param |
navatāla prāmāṇeṇa pratimāṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

śilāmayaṃ lohamayaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ vāpi kārayet |
grāmāccāṣṭabhujaṃ vidyāt nagare ca caturbhujam ||

vanāntare dvibhujaṃ vidyāt parvatāgre tu ṣoḍaśa |
samudre dvādaśaṃ kuryāt jandandya (**) ṣaṭbhujam ||

taṭāke daśabhujaṃ kuryāt catuṣpathe caturbhujam |
khaḍgañca kheṭakañcaiva nāgaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ tathaiva ca ||

śūlakapālakhaṭvāṃgaṃ ḍamarūñca tathāṣṭakam |
śyāmavarṇā ca kartavyā daṃṣṭrākāladaṃ śubham ||

ūrdhvakeśañca kartavyaṃ triṇetraṃ nāgabhūṣaṇaṃ |
dārukasya hṛdi śūlaṃ proktavyaṃ himalocanam ||

raudrarūpantu kartavyaṃ cāmuṇḍālakṣaṇaṃ param ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ pratimālakṣaṇavidhirnāma catvāriṃśat 
paṭalaḥ] || 40 ||


<p. 154>

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi kṣetrapālavidhikramam |
trailokyanāthaṃ sarvajñaṃ sarvadevaṃ jitendriyam ||

āgameśamūrtikaṃ ca ādikṣetrasya pālakam |
parantatparamākāśaṃ devatā cittameva ca ||

cintayenmanasānityaṃ śivaloke mahīyate |
tataḥ prabhṛti deveśa śivarūpaṃ śivaṃ yathā ||

paścād daṇḍālayaṃ vidyāt pralayaṃ paṃktimānakam |
sakalajīvarūpañca jyeṣṭhavaṃśāntavṛttakam ||

vṛttamadhye tu jyotissyāt jyotimadhyamaṇustathā |
