<p. 155>

nadī saṃgamane vāpi vanavāse samāśraye |
grāme vā nagare vāpi pattane kheṭakātmake ||

bhāgyavādi tathādroṇe kolakaṃ pratimāvahet |
tat tacchāstra yathā yogaṃ kṣetrasthānaṃ vidhīyate ||

kriyāśeṣaṃ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadanupūrvakam |
śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ caiva adbhūtañca vicārakam ||

grāmādi janasaṃsthāne śāntikaṃ vinyased vidhim |
guhāyāṃ vanavāse vā pauṣṭikaṃ tatra kārayet ||

adbhūtaṃ paramūrtiśca ābhicārakarakṣaṇam |
tat tatsthāne yathāyogyaṃ yogenaiva tu kārayet ||

caturbhujaṃ śāntikañcaiva pauṣṭikañcāṣṭabāhukam |
dvibhujaṃ sarvasāmānyaṃ kriyā śeṣaṃ vidhīyate ||

caturbhujaṃ dakṣiṇe haste triśūlaṃ ḍamarukantathā |
vāmahaste kapālantu bhujakañca vidhīyate ||

padmapīṭhasthitaṃ deva parijanānāṃ vidhīyate |
pādau tu śailamevoktaṃ kaṭisthānnāgamāvṛtam ||

pārśve kanakamaṇīnāṃ rajjubandhanameva ca |
udare nāgabandhañca karṇikena samanvitam ||

mukhe yā lambite karṇaṃ sarvayajñopavītinam |
naraśirastrilaṃbaiśca stanayorantare vidhu ||

