<p. 57>

caturbhujamiti jñeyaṃ grāmaśāntikaraṃ śubham |
pauṣṭikasya vidhiṃ kṛtvā vīryaṃ vai śatrunāśanam ||

strīvardhanamiti jñeyaṃ bhūtākāramiti smṛtam |
lokāloka hitārthāya kārye kāryeṇa yojayet ||

balikarmavidhiṃ kṛtvā śāntikarmavidhismṛtam |
snapanādi sarvakāryaṃ yojayet tadvicakṣaṇāḥ ||

adhivāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā sarvadravyāṇi yojayet |
kalaśasthāpanaṃ kṛtvā phaṭkāramucyate budhaḥ ||

pratiṣṭhāmantramevaṃ syāt mūlamantramanusmaran |
mahāberaṃ tathā mūlaṃ jīvākṣaramihocyate ||

oṃkāraṃ vinyasenmūlaṃ madhye śrīṃkāramucyate |
svāhāntaṃ vinyaset tatra agre strīṃkāramucyate ||

vinyased gandhapuṣpañca dhūpadīpañca dāpayet |
paścād deva samāyuktaṃ ācāryaṃ sthāpite budhaḥ ||

bahale brahmasārasya candrārke arkamūlataḥ |
madhye viṣṇustathā nyasya sarvasaṃhāramūrtayaḥ ||

mahākāyaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ brahmajñānamiti smṛtam |
pratiṣṭhedindrasaṃyuktaṃ bhagavantaṃ sadāśivam ||

brahmāvālaṃ jitriyājāṃ dvivṛddhiṃ jitavetti |
kaṇṭhakahṛdayapādanābhiguhyaśirāśira ||

