athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi mātṝṇāṃ śūlasaṃgraham |
uttaraṃ dakṣamayanamuttaramuttarantathā ||

dakṣiṇamayanañcaiva ṣaṇmāsañcaiva varjayet |
uttarottaramabhyuktamuttaraṃ sarvasaṃgraham ||

ityete saṃgrahaṃ śūlaṃ sarvakāmārthasādhanam |
subhikṣaṃ kṣemamārogyaṃ sarvasasya vivardhanam ||

cāturvaṇyaṃ hitañcaiva sarvāriṣṭavināśanam |
grāme vā nagare vāpi sarvaśāntikaraṃ śubham ||

