<p. 159>

svastivācaka vākyañca brahmaghoṣantathaiva ca |
paṭahaṃ maddalaṃ tālaṃ karaṭītimilā tathā ||

śaṃkhakālasamāyuktaṃ mātṛghoṣaṃ tathaiva ca |
ācārya śiṣyasaṃyuktaṃ vastrābharaṇameva ca ||

aṃkurārpaṇa pūrvoktaṃ madhivāsana karmaṇi |
mātṛmaṇṭapasaṃyuktaṃ śāntinaṃ śāntikarmaṇi ||

sthaṇḍilaṃ tatra kurvīta aṣṭadroṇantu śālibhiḥ |
tadardhantaṇḍulañcaiva taṇḍulārdhatilantathā ||

tasyārdhaṃ tilasaṃyuktaṃ darbhamuṣṭintu vistṛtam |
tanmadhye paṃkajaṃ likhya sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam ||

aśvatthodumbaraṃ plakṣa vaṭavṛkṣaṃ tathaiva ca |
caturaśrasamaṃ kṛtvā hastamātrapramāṇakam ||

sthaṇḍile vinyaset pīṭhaṃ ācāryassādhakaissaha |
pādyamācamanīyañca gandhapuṣpādi cārcayet ||

pādyādi sarvamantreṇa arcayitvā vidhānataḥ |
ajaṃ rudhira māṃsādi sarve havirnivedayet ||

nivedanantu nirmālyaṃ sarvañcaiva visarjayet |
tāmbūlaṃ sadyamantreṇa sādhakācārya pūtrakaḥ ||

