<p. 160>

pratimandakṣiṇañcaiva ācāryaṃ sarvamātṛkam |
pra (************) sadāśiva śivastathā ||

vasavaścāṣṭabhiścaiva dvādaśāditya eva ca |
radramekādaśa sarve aśvinyāśca samanvitam ||

indrāgni yamanir(-)ṛti vāruṇavāyureva ca |
someśonyastathā caiva āgachantu namo namaḥ ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī ca tathendrāṇī cāmuṇḍī gaṇarudrakā ||

ityete kramaśaścaiva māṇāñca namo namaḥ |
yoginī ḍākinī caiva sākinī pūtanā tataḥ ||

pālinī dundubhiścaiva tathocchiṣṭā ca mātaraḥ |
bhūtapreta piśācāśca vetālañca tathaiva ca ||

kumāragra(ra)kūśmāṇḍa mahādeva grahastathā |
sarvañca sarvalokañca sarvapīṭhañca devatā ||

dvātriṃśadadhipaścaiva āgachantu namo namaḥ |
ācāryaṃ mantrasaṃyuktaṃ sāvakā saṃhitā ca vai ||

mahākālasya vinyasya mātṛmaṇḍalasaṃgraham |
dvitīyaṃ lakṣaṇairyuktaṃ śilpisāyakasaṃgraham ||

yātrā pātrapīṭhasya dvā vā pīṭhe śilpinā kṛtam |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śilpināṃ lakṣaṇairyutam ||

<p. 161>

ityete kramaśaścaiva śūlaṃ grabhagṛhaṃ bhavet |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śilpi citrakalakṣaṇaṃ ||

brāhmaṇā kṣatriyā vaiśyā śūdrairvā śūdralakṣaṇam |
daśatālaṃ navatālaṃ tu viprasya navatālaṃ kṣatriyasya tu ||

aṣṭatālantu vaiśyasya saptatālantu śūdrakaḥ |
vāmadakṣiṇa khaḍgañca madhyamā śūlapatrakam ||

caturaṃguli vistāraṃ patrakhaḍgañca vaktrakam |
dvitālaṃ sarvavarṇañca śūlasthāpanameva ca ||

agraṃ daśāṃgulavaktraṃ pīṭhāṣṭāṃgulavaktrakam |
pīṭhantu ṣoḍaśāṃgulyaṃ caturaśraṃ pīṭhasaṃgraham ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ citrapatra (****) |
śāntikañcaiva kālīsthāpanamuttamam ||

(**) pīṭhakramañcaiva hastamātra pramāṇakam |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ sarvacitravicitrakam ||

sarvāṃgaṃ sarvasaṃyuktaṃ śilpacitrakalakṣaṇam |
śūlapatrañca devasya brahmabrahmañca vinyaset ||

vāmapatraṃ tathaiśānyāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ viṣṇupatrakam |
ityete adhidevā vā śūlapatrasya devatā ||

śūlapīṭhaṃ mahākālaṃ madhyamañca vidhīyate |
bahuvīrañca pīṭhasya astrapīṭhasya vinyaset ||

<p. 162>

agrapīṭhasya daṇḍaṃ vai pādapīṭhaṃ tadīśitam |
śāntyarthasya vistāraṃ tribhāgaṃ bhāgameva ca ||

daṇḍaṃ vaktreṇasaṃyuktaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulavistṛtam |
tribhāgaṃ ghaṇṭavistāraṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam ||

pādapīṭhasya vistāraṃ dvitālaṃ caturaṃgulam |
sarvacitrakalekhyañca aṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

vāmāṃgamabhisaṃyuktaṃ manonmani mayāntakam |
dvātriṃśadadhi daivatyaṃ abhyantarābhyanta devatā ||

madhye daṇḍasya devānāṃ aṣṭamañcādhiyoginī |
ityete kramaśaścaiva śūlasaṃgrahameva ca ||

brāhmaṇa kṣatriyī vaiśyā śūdro vā putra vṛddhidam |
sarvalokahitaṃ puṇyaṃ sarvaśāntikaraṃ param ||

sarvavyādhivināśañca sarvāriṣṭavināśanam |
grāmaṃ grāmapatiñcaiva śūlasaṃgrahameva ca ||

brāhmaṇa kṣatriyo vaiśya kartā bhartā vivardhanam |
mahāmārī praśamanaṃ vātavyādhi vināśanam ||

subhikṣaṃ grāmavṛddhiñca sarvasasya vivardhanam |
mantrahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ dravyahīnaṃ tathaiva ca ||

muhūrtakālahīnañca kālakalantathaiva ca |
sarvadoṣaṃ viśeṣeṇa kartavyaṃ sarvavarjitam ||

<p. 163>

lohārcanañca śūlañca lohārthaṃ mātraśūlakam |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ śūlasthāpanavidhirnāma 
catvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 42 ||


athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi prāyaścitta vidhikramam |
mātṛśāntiṣu yogeṣu yathādoṣa pravṛttaye ||

taddoṣa śamanārthāya prāyaścitta vinirṇayam |
prāsādañcchinnabhinnañca kālena patitena ca ||

śailaṃ vā pratimaṃ vāpi kṣataṃ vā bhagnameva vā |
sirā caiva parairvāpi patitaṃ bhinnameva vā ||

hīnako vyādhito vāpi ālayaṃ pratimāṃ tathā |
toraṇaṃ patitañcaiva dvausūrya prabhayorapi ||

bhūmiṃ vā kampanañcaiva agninā dahanepi vā |
samayī sādhakaścaiva putrakāvārya saṃyutaḥ ||

yajamānavyādhipīṭhaṃ citrakeṭakasarvataḥ |
hīnādvai dakṣiṇeryatra hanahīnamathāpi vā ||

heme tu dravyahīne tu vastrahīnañca tadbhavet |
devaṃ na rūpaṃ vijñeyaṃ prāyaścittaṃ praśastakam ||

navākṣareṇa mantreṇa pratyekāṣṭaśataṃ hutam |
samidhā tilaparyantaṃ devyā gāyatrī hūyate ||

prāsāde maṇṭape bhinne śūlādaṣṭāyudhāni ca |
navaśaktisamāyuktaṃ homayet tu śatāṣṭakam ||

prāsādaṃ bhinnahīnantu bālasthānaṃ prakalpayet |
prāsādaṃ tatra kurvīta ācāryaśśilpibhissaha ||

pūrvoktena vidhānena saṃprokṣaṇamathācaret |
tatra hīnahute caiva mūlamantrañca kārayet ||

mātṝṇāñca pratiṣṭhānte sudhācitrādi śobhite |
caṇḍālahīnavarṇañca śvānasparśanasaṃkare ||

saṃkaretarajātīnāṃ patitonmattakā api |
khaṇḍasphuṭita bhinnañca kavāṭaṃ staṃbhayorapi ||

saṃprokṣaṇaṃ prakartavyaṃ pūrvavadvidhicoditam |
grāmādipattanasyānte narāṇāṃ vyādhipīḍite ||

sarvāmukha prayatnena saṃprokṣaṇamataḥ kuru |
tatraivaṃ na kuryāt tu pūrvoktena vidhānataḥ ||

pūrvoktena vidhāne puṃsavaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ |
tatraiva snapanaṃ kuryāt tathā vittānusārataḥ ||

tatraiva taddhānenmantrī navākṣareṇa buddhimān |
sahasrannavakañcaiva aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutam ||

tatraiva trividhaṃ homaṃ uttamādi yathākramam |
sarva dravyeṣu śāntāni pūrṇāhutiṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

<p. 165>

ācārya vyādhiprāptasyāt kartā vā vyādhipīḍitaḥ |
homayenmūlamantreṇa tyājyā tilasaṃyutam ||

agninā dahane vastre ālaye pratimāpi vā |
sarvadravyeṣu saṃyuktaṃ navabījena homayet ||

bhūmervā kampane caiva rogeṣu kalaheṣu ca |
toraṇaṃ patanañcaiva mūlamantreṇa saṃyutam ||

homayet pañcaviṃśatyā hutvā vai kaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa uttālaktantathaiva ca ||

caṇḍālasparśane caiva yatra bhinnañca varjayet |
bhāṇḍamanyattu saṃsthāpya praṇavena tu saṃyutam ||

śayanairvā maraṇairvā jalasaṃprokṣaṇaṃ vidhiḥ |
śvānairvā mlecchajātī ca śilpirvā citrakarmaṇi ||

ālayābhyantare caiva gamane doṣakṛdbhavet |
prāyaścittantu kartavyaṃ saṃprokṣaṇamathā caret ||

devīnāmarcane kāle yathādoṣaṃ pravartate |
liṃgaṃ vā pratimāṃ vāpi paraśuṃ śūlameva vā ||

ghaṇṭāñca kalaśañcaiva dhanurnārā ca meva ca |
antyaiścāyudhairyuktaṃ balibāleṣvayaṃ tathā ||

pramādātpatite bhinne yathā saṃbhavato matā |
yathālābhaṃ gṛhītvā hutvā devīṃ nivedayet ||

