pramādādyatra hīne tu sarvayukta pramāṇakaiḥ |
mūlagāyatri mantreṇa sahasraṃ vā śatāṣṭakam ||

svacakraṃ paracakraṃ vā kṣobhayuddhaṃ yathā bhavet |
devyā gāyatrī mantreṇa homayenmūlavidyayā ||

darvīva homadravyeva niṣkale pratimepi vā |
kālitthaśca laḍaṃ vāpi mūlamantreṇa homayet ||

yatra kumbhaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya patitaṃ cetpramādataḥ |
navākṣareṇa mantreṇa tadevaṃ homayedbudhaḥ ||

snapanasyādhivāsena kalaśaṃ bhagnameva ca |
tatraika kalaśe madhye yadādoṣaṃ pravartate ||

dhvaje ca patite vāpi dhvajādaṇḍasya bhedane |
tatra homaṃ prakurvīta samayādyāsu vidyayā ||

paśūnāṃ chedane yatra udare vatsadṛśyate |
taddoṣaśamanārthāya prāyaścittaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

<p. 168>

japtvā saṃprokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā tataścotsavamārabhet |
saptāhamapi kurvīta utsavaṃ pratyahaṃ budhaḥ ||

snapanañca prakartavyaṃ yathāśāstrānusārataḥ |
tattacchāntiṃ prakūrvīta prajotpātakamāraṇam ||

sarvaduḥkhakaraṃ nityatyaṃ yajamānavyādhi pīḍitaḥ |
homayed vidhivatpūrvaṃ mūrtamādiṣu yojayet ||

nityotsavavihīne tu sandhihīne tathaiva ca |
tasya homaṃ prakūrvīta mūlamantrādisaṃyutam ||

ekaṃ pañcadaśaṃ vāpi ekāṣṭaṃ pūjahīnake |
māsena navaṃ kuryāt pañcāśacca śatāṣṭakam ||

ardhamāse daśatyekaṃ snāpayet tu yathāvidhi |
māsādivatsarānte tu prāyaścittaṃ yathāvidhi ||

ekakālaṃ dvikālaṃ vā trikālaṃ vā na pūjya ca |
ekādaśakarātraṃ vā devyādi chinna pūjya ca ||

yasya kālavihīne tu tasya śāntiṃ samārabhet |
kālādhikaṃ bhavet tatra homāda (**) kaṃ bhavet ||

yasya hīne vide viyāne tadā pṛṣṭe pratilomānulomakaiḥ |
grāme vā nagare vāpi narāṇāṃ vyādhipīḍitam ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena devi sānnidhyakārakam |
prāyaścittaṃ prakurvīta vādyahīnaṃ tathaiva ca ||

<p. 169>

karamudrā vihīnantu homasthānantu yadbhavet |
nṛttakāle pramādādvā narāṇāṃ pātane sati ||

tathā homaṃ prakurvīta paśuṃ hatvā yathāvidhi |
ājyāhuti sahasraṃ vā kṣetraśāntiṃ tathā kuru ||

tasmān nṛttaṃ samārabhya grāmādīnāṃ pradakṣiṇam |
mārjanaṃ tāṭanaṃ kuryāt devyovantu varjayet ||

mārjanā hīne tu tāṭyaṃ sthānanāśaṃ bhaviṣyati |
tasmāt sarva prayatnena śāntihomaṃ samācaret ||

tatastu śeṣamātodyaṃ paṭahādi yathākramam |
narādi makṣikāntāni na kuryāt tatra laṃghanam ||

pramādāllaṃghayitvā tu hutvā devyā nivedayet |
navāgnīva śivaṃ dhyātvā arcayenmūlavinyaset ||

anyāṃstu laṃghayitvā tu devīṃ tatra prapūjayet |
utsavo diśyāvadyastu dhāryate triṣu pauruṣam ||

mahādoṣaḥ pravartante vadāmītirajasvalā |
doṣānurūpaṃ saṃvakṣye śāntiṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

pratiṣṭhākālakriyā sarve kārayet susamāhitaḥ |
evaṃ parīkṣya bahudhā kārayet tatra vittamaḥ ||

ācāryaṃ pūjayet samyak vastrahemāṃgulīyakaiḥ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ prāyaścittavidhirnāma 
tricatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 43 ||


<p. 170>

śūlasya lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye śṛṇubrahmanyathā kramam |
pratimāyāṃśca cāyāmañcottamaṃ madhyamādhamam ||

nābherantaṃ tadūrdhvantu lalāṭāntamuttamaṃ bhavet |
tat tan madhyamaṃ jñeyaṃ tadardhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet ||

tasmānmadhyaṃ samāvarthavartayedardhacandravat |
madhyabhāgena kartavyaṃ madhyabhāgaṃ yathā bhavet ||

madhyabhāgalatāyāṃ vai hastraneyastriyaṃ bhavet |
grīvā pīṭhākṣaraṃ netre brahmāṇī ca caturbhuje ||

caturvaktrasamopetaṃ vaktre vaktre vilocanam |
padmamālā samopetā kṛṣṇājinavibhūṣitam ||

upavītadharāṃ devīṃ citra (************) |
paṃkajāsanasaṃyuktaṃ haṃsāsanamathāpi vā ||

kamaṇḍaluṃ vāmahaste dakṣiṇe akṣasūtrakam |
(************) ke paṃkajāsanasaṃyutam ||

evaṃ vidhanatannetraḥ lakṣaṇenasamanvitam |
netropari netre ca vaiṣṇavī lakṣaṇānvitam ||

kālālagāṃgasaṃyuktā tathā cāṣṭabhujānvitam |
hārakeyūrasaṃyuktaṃ raktāmbaravibhūṣitam ||

īdṛśāṃ vinyasennetrī triṇetraṃ śāntarūpiṇam |
vidhinā (*) ñca kartavyaṃ vāyavyāṃ lakṣaṇānvitam ||

<p. 171>

pārśvayostu bhāgābhyāṃ pārśvaśūlaṃ yathā bhavet |
madhya bhāgasya pārśvañca pārśvaśūlaṃ yathā bhavet ||

tasyāṃ śūlaṃ yathābhāgaṃ bāhulañcocyate kramāt |
tāsāṃ padasya vistāramaṣṭāṃgaiḥ kārayed badhaḥ ||

aṣṭabhāgaikabhāgantu tāsāṃ bāhulamucyate |
tadardhaṃ vaikadeśe tu anupūrvakrameṇa tu ||

bhrāmayed vitato vidvān lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
madhyabhāgasya pārśve tu tadbhāge parivartayet ||

bhāgadvayaṃ tathā madhye grāsadvaiva vicakṣaṇaḥ |
tasyāṃ śūlayathābhāgaṃ tribhirbhāgaistu mūlataḥ ||

grīvā pīṭhaṃ prakartavyaṃ caturaśraṃ suśobhanam |
saptabhāgaikabāhulyaṃ pīṭhavistārato bhavet ||

kauśukādimunau jāti pīṭhakoṇeṣu śobhitam |
ghaṇṭājālasamāyuktaṃ pippalī patraśobhitam ||

grīvā pīṭhaṃ bhavedevamupaśobhāsamanvitam |
pīṭhaṃ vai pārśvataścaiva bhāgadvayavinā vināśayet ||

pārśvaśūlaṃ yathāgrantu īṣacchedādikaṃ bhavet |
svarṇenaiva prakartavyaṃ śūlaṃ vai devatā bhavet ||

svarṇarajate sarve suvarṇaṃ śūlamucyate |
rajatena prakartavyaṃ rājadaṃśūlamucyate ||

<p. 172>

rājataṃ madhyamaṃ jñeyaṃ madhyamaṃ tatprakīrtitam |
rājatantu bhavet sarvaṃ triśūlaṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

śuddhenaiva prakartavyaṃ kanyasaṃ śūlamucyate |
śubhākāraṃ bhavet sarvaṃ pū (************) nvitam ||

eteṣvekaṃ samāśritya kārayet tatra vittamaḥ |
avāṭavādirā nālaṃ kṛmikoṭara varjitam ||

yojayet tatra vitprājño yathā vistārarūpataḥ |
āsanenābhi kartavyaṃ sāramadhyaṃ suśobhanam ||

tadbhāgaṃ triguṇānālaṃ āyudhaṃ ca prakīrtitam |
grīvābhāgaṃ tribhāgaikaṃ nāhaṃ tasya prakīrtitā ||

pīṭhe vai vīrabhadrasyāt yathā vidhi purassaram |
tatpīṭhasya tu vistāraṃ tadardhā yena kīrtitā ||

vistāraṃ sarvabhāgaikaṃ bāhulañca prakīrtitam |
vartabhāgaikamutsedhaṃ pīṭhasyaiva prakīrtitam ||

grīvaṃ pīṭhasya cākāramadhastāt sadṛśaṃ bhavet |
caturaśraṃ bhavedūrdhvamadhastācca tatāśrakam ||

vṛttākāraṃ bhavedūrdhvamadhastā dhṛtamucyate |
evaṃ pīṭhaṃ prakartavyamūrdhvādhaḥ padmaśobhitam ||

vīrabhadrādi mātṝṇāṃ śūlapīṭhe tu vinyaset |
evaṃ vai lakṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ śūlastveva samāsataḥ ||

<p. 173>

garbhādena prakartavyaṃ śāstra dṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
evameva prakartavyaṃ śūlalakṣaṇasaṃyutam ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ śūlalakṣaṇavidhirnāma 
catuścatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 44 ||


śūlapratiṣṭhāṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu brahmanyathā kramam |
prāsādasyāgrataḥ kuryāt aiśānyantu viśeṣataḥ ||

navahastaṃ saptahastaṃ pañcahastamathāpi vā |
maṇṭapaṃ kārayet tatra śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

maṇṭapañcaturaśrantu lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
trividhaikaṃ samāśṛtya maṇṭapaṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

(navahastaṃ saptahastaṃ pañcahastamathāpi vā |
maṇṭapaṃ kārayet tatra)

dvividhaṃ maṇṭapaṃ proktaṃ cottare vāsanaṃ bhavet |
ṣoḍaśastambhasaṃyuktaṃ catuṣtoraṇasaṃyutam ||

pañcabhāgaṃ tribhāgaikaṃ devī vistāramucyate |
tadvibhāgaikamutsedhaṃ darpaṇodarasannibham ||

mekhalātraya saṃyuktaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
yadaikamekhalāṃ kuryāt (************) ||

(************) droktamekhalāyā samantathā |
prathamā me (**) proktā coktamādyaprakīrtitā ||

tasmādaṃgulahīnā ca dvitarā (*) prakīrtitā |
madhyamā sā ca prakīrtitā ||

utsedhantāvadevokta tasmādvistāramucyate |
diksopāna samāyukta manojñā ca prakīrtitā ||

utsedhantāvadevoktaṃ tasmādvistāramucyate |
diksopānaṃ bhavet brahman caturdikṣukrameṇa tu ||

catudvārasamāyuktaṃ darbhamālāvalambitam |
vāpanopari sañchannaṃ puṣpamālopaśobhitam ||

dhūpadaīpasamāyuktaṃ toraṇaiśca samanvitam |
plakṣodumbaramaśvatthaṃ vaṭaṃ pūrvāditaḥ kramāt ||

plakṣantu toraṇañcaindre yāmye caudumbaraṃ bhavet |
aśvattham vāruṇaṃ jñeyaṃ vaṭaṃ saumye ca kīrtitam ||

evaṃ vai toraṇaṃ jñeyaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
bhūmau tataḥ praviṣṭañca tadūrdhvañca caturbhujam ||

āpantoraṇasaṃyuktaṃ lakṣaṇenasamanvitam |
arcayitvā vidhānena kalaśaṃ teṣāntu mūlataḥ ||

evaṃ vā maṇṭapaṃ kṛtvā dhvajasya sthāpanaṃ kuru |
adhivāsanaṃ vinā pūrve dhvajamuthāpayed guruḥ ||

dhvajamutthāya vidhinā sthaṇḍilaṃ tatra kārayet |
sthaṇḍilañca prakartavyaṃ devikāyāṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

<p. 175>

ekottara padeṣveva madhye padmaṃ prakalpayet |
ekaikāntaritastasmin padamekantu hrāsayet ||

droṇataṇḍulasaṃyuktaṃ vikirenvasamantataḥ |
śobhitañcaiva padmaistu madhyamena tilena ca ||

tatpadmaṃ karṇikāyuktaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam |
āsanaṃ kalpayet tatra śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

pañcācāryasamāyuktaṃ athavāsa samanvitam |
aṣṭamaṃgalasaṃkīrṇe maṃgalaṃ kuru (****) ||

(****) śāyate śūlaṃ sarvadevamayaṃ śubham |
jalāvāhasaṃyuktaṃ śūlaṃ vai lakṣaṇānvitam ||

evaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena śūlaṃ sthāpayet budhaḥ |
(************) homakāryaṃ samārabhet ||

vedikāyāntu paritaḥ caindrādikramayogataḥ |
caturaśraṃ bhavedaindraṃ yonyākārantu pāvake ||

ardhacandro bhavedyāmye trikoṇa nair(-)ṛtaṃ bhavet |
vartulaṃ vāruṇaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vāyugocare ||

saumye padmanibhākārairaiśānyāmaṣṭakoṇakam |
eteṣu homaṃ kartavyaṃ śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā ||

samitsarpi dadhikṣīraṃ madhulājādhikaṃ kramāt |
(*) tro velaṃ prakartavyamadhipasya prayatnataḥ ||

<p. 176>

tataḥ prabhāte vimale śūlasthāpanamārabhet |
sthāpayenmātṛmantreṇa ācāryo mantravigrahaḥ ||

maṇṭapasya tu tanmadhye vedikāyāṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
vedikāyāṃ manojñāyāṃ śāstroktāyāṃ varānane ||

ratnanyāsottare kāle śūlantatra pratiṣṭhayet |
tadante snapanaṃ kuryādante bhūtabaliṃ kṣipet ||

aparāhne tadante tu yajñastu yathākramam ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ śūlapratiṣṭhā nāma 
pañcacatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 45 ||


balipīṭhaṃ prakartavyaṃ sarvato dikṣu vai tathā |
sumahinī śoṣaṇī caiva mohinī kaṃpanī tathā ||

dhūmrākṣī ca viśālākṣī sumukhī durmukhī tathā |
tṛtīyāvaraṇe kuryāt anirūpā ca tiṣṭhati ||

dvibhujā śyāmavarṇāṃ ca śubhaṃkarī tathā śubhā |
aiśānyāṃ kṣetrapālastu lohajaṃ seti pitṛtā ||

ālayasya balīnāntu pañcadaṇḍāntamantare |
parivārasyālayaṃ kuryāt pīṭhaṃ vā cottarāndiśi ||

tṛtīyāvaraṇe yasya bāhyataḥ parikalpayet |
pratiṣṭhitā ekavīrī bahuvīrī prakalpayet ||

<p. 177>

bahuvīraṃ vinā yatra ekavīraṃ na kārayet |
ekavīraṃ vinā yatra bahuvīraṃ na kārayet ||

idameva prakartavyaṃ sarvaśāntirbhaviṣyati |
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi mātṝṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śubham ||

śrīpradaṃ putradañcaiva dhanadhānyasuvardhanam |
siddhidaṃ muktidañcaiva paracakravināśanam ||

sarvamāri praśamanaṃ sarvajvaravināśanam |
tuṣṭipuṣṭivivardhanañca subhikṣamāyuvardhanam ||

ekakālaṃ dvikālaṃ vā trikālaṃ nityameva vā |
balihomārcanairyuktaṃ sarvapāpakṣayaṃ bhavet ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena mātṝṇāṃ kārayedbudhaḥ |
pūrvato vīrabhadrantu paścime tu vināyakam ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī ca tathendrāṇi cāmuṇḍī ca tataḥ param ||


[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ balipīṭha mātralakṣaṇo nāma 
ṣaṭcatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 46 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi yogavṛkṣasya lakṣaṇaṃ |
timiraśūlasya mūrtisyāsamidhā lakṣaṇena ca ||

<p. 178>

toraṇaṃ pañcāyudhañcaiva tathā brahman purā purā |
khadiraṃ panasañcaiva bilapañcāsanantathā ||

madhukañcaṃpakañcaiva vasurandevadārukam |
kadambamarjunañcaiva palāśāśaṃkhameva ca ||

candano nāgavṛkṣañca jātī ca spandanastathā |
staṃbakañcaiva kaṣmaryaṃ śitītimirameva ca ||

palāśakhadirāśvatthaṃ plakṣanyagrodhabilvakam |
śamī vaikaṃkataṃ caiva vaiṇavañca krameṇa tu ||

nimbarā rājavṛkṣañca pāṭalañca tathaiva ca |
deṣṭarañca hitaṃ śubhraṃ kujjajīrṇañca varjitam ||

agnidamaṃ svayaṃ śuṣkaṃ pipīlikābhiśca sevitam |
patitañcoditañcaiva harivṛścika sevitam ||

bhedyaṃ vā suṣirañcaiva annastomasamanvitam |
sarpañca kṛkalāsañca kṛmicchidrañca varjitam ||

mūlahīnaṃ tathā puṣpaṃ palāśa jīrṇitantu vā |
tvakdoṣa sphuṭitañcaiva doṣahīnena varjayet ||

bhinnāhannada (************) 
(*) |
śuṣkadagdha svayaṃ bhinna dakṣiṇa pravaṇantathā ||

kīrṇakṛmibandha (**) saṃpūrṇa pakṣisevitam |
(****) ñcaityajātāśca varjanīyāt prayatnataḥ ||

<p. 179>

nadītīre taṭāke vā grāmamadhye ca dikpathe |
pūtabhramo mā (****) ṇḍāla śabarāṣṭite ||

vātādapagnidagdhaśca tathaiva parvateṣu ca |
vṛkṣagrāhyāstadālābhe bhragatajana dūṣite ||

cakṣuroṣarāśiyuktevastrīṇe jalavarjite |
marupradeṣu deśeṣu kaitaikīttomasaṃkule ||

gomāyuvṛkabhūtiṣṭhe grantharkṣaśyena saṃkule |
pakvāpakvasamākīrṇaṃ mlecchadeśeṣu bhīṣaṇe ||

grāmapradeśe valmīke vrajanī vṛkṣase śubham |
vṛkṣasāmānya saṃkīrṇe bahanakamṛṇānvite ||

kiñciddoṣeṇa saṃgrāhya bahudoṣaṃ vivarjayet |
doṣarahitabhramaṇa vāme khalatvaṃ na vinyaset ||

vṛkṣamaṃ karmatā kuryāt śastra dṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
tatraiva vṛkṣāgragarbha pravakṣyate yathāvidhi ||

sirāśca vivarāścaiva āpadgūḍha yathā tathā |
maṇḍalañca tathā garbha vṛkṣatā ceti sarvataḥ ||

vṛkṣadoṣasamākhyāta sarvasaṃpadvināśana |
adhikañcaiva vināśañca sphuṭitaṃ patrameva ca ||

sthūlaścaivāgrataścaiva suṣirañcaiva saṃpravai |
dantivṛkṣadoṣeṇa vināroge vivarerāgravigraham ||

<p. 180>

āpatre vahni durbhikṣaṃ prabhedassyātsvayaṃ bhavet |
maṇḍale varṇa doṣe tu śubhaye sarvajanakṣayam ||

rūkṣatāyana nābhayaṃ karturbhavati nityatā |
adhiketha bhavedvyādhi bhinno vā vigrahaṃ bhavet ||

sphuṭite prāṇināśastu kartukāradvitantave |
vaktre tu sarvasantāpaṃ sthūlavyādhirbhaviṣyati ||

kalaśe tu bhuvivyādhi suṣire svāmināśanam |
śubhavṛkṣasamākīrṇaṃ bahunākatṛṇānvite ||

padmotpalaṃ vā nākīrṇe vṛkṣahī kṣetra samākule |
kuśāgarbha saṃkīrṇante grāhyā vṛkṣate sadā ||

athottarāyaṇe māse pūrvapakṣe tathaiva ca |
sumuhūrte ca nakṣatre kunānyāya kulantathā ||

nādaṃ dakṣiṇottarāyāṃ pratye garbha yathā punaḥ |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu paribhramya (****) ||

parāṅmukhassa namaskuryāt vṛkṣañcaiva tadā karma (**) |
(************) paścādāyudha 
meva vā ||

samidhena ca tatra daṇḍañca samidhena sakṛdbhavet |
evaṃ vidhisamāyuktaṃ parikṣayet tatra vittamaḥ ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ yogalakṣaṇo nāma 
saptacatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 47 ||


<p. 181>

pratiṣṭhāvidhiṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu brahmanyathā kramam |
āṣāḍhe śrāvaṇe caiva proṣṭhapāde tu meva ca ||

kārtikā mārgaśīrṣe tu pauṣyaphālgunayorapi |
pratiṣṭhāṃ kārayennūnaṃ kārayet tatra vittamaḥ ||

dakṣiṇāyana kāle tu kṛṣṇapakṣe śubhe dine |
prāsadasyottare caiva aiśānyāntu viśeṣataḥ ||

athavā pūrvadeśe tu maṇṭapaṃ caturaśrakam |
daśadvādaśahastantu tathā ṣoḍaśahastakam ||

kanyasaṃ madhyamaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ trividhaṃ maṇṭapaṃ smṛtam |
ṣoḍaśastambhasaṃyuktaṃ dvādaśastaṃbhameva ca ||

dvātriṃśatstaṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ maṇṭapantu viśeṣataḥ |
uttarāpaṭṭikāyuktaṃ paṭalāścāditaṃ śubham ||

caturbhistoraṇaiścaiva catvāropaśobhitam |
yāvadvāra pramāṇāni tāvat toraṇavistaram ||

viśadaṃgulanāhantu tathāṣṭadaśameva ca |
pariṇāhaṃ tathotsedhaṃ vistāraṃ caturaṃgulam ||

darbhairmālāvṛtañcaiva puṣpamālāpralambitam |
palañca palvalañcaiva pālikā capalaṃ kṛtam ||

chatracāmārasaṃyuktaṃ aṣṭadigdhvajaśobhitam |
indrādīśānaparyantaṃ mālayā caiva kārayet ||

<p. 182>

śaktitoraṇasaṃyuktaṃ kadalīstaṃbha ikṣubhiḥ |
citradhvajasamākīrṇe nānāpuṣpasamākulam ||

aṣṭadikṣudhvajañcaiva paṭhe vāhana lekhayet |
indradvāraṃ yamadvāraṃ varuṇadvārameva ca ||

saumya dvārasamāyuktaṃ aṣṭadhvajasya vistaram |
dvyaṃgulaṃ śāntadaṃ proktaṃ suprayogamathottare ||

pūrvamaṇṭapasaṃyuktaṃ vedikā caturaśrakam |
maṇṭapaṃ navabhāge tu madhyabhāge tu vedikā ||

pañcahastaṃ pramāṇaṃ vā caturhastamathāpi vā |
trihastaṃ vā dvihastaṃ vā ekahastamathāpi vā ||

aṣṭāṃgulācchrayā mānaṃ darpaṇodarasannibham |
(************) 
(****) ||

navakuṇḍasamāyuktaṃ madhye devī samanvitam |
caturhastaṃ trihastaṃ vā ekahaste eva śubham ||

uttamādhamavijñeyaṃ mekhalātrayasaṃyutam |
dagdhā mudrā tathā brahman madhyamaṃ mekhalānvitam ||

vitastinnayo jñātāṃ sāmyakalāsalānvitam |
agnikuṇḍāni vakṣyāmi pratimāyā viśeṣataḥ ||

caturaśrantu mindrāyāmāgneyyāṃ yonimāśritam |
ardhacandraṃ yamasthāne trikoṇe nair(-)ṛtaṃ bhavet ||

<p. 183>

vāruṇe vartulaṃ kuṇḍaṃ vāyavyāntu ṣaḍaśrakam |
saumyāyāṃ padmakuṃḍantu aiśānyāccāṣṭakoṇakam ||

ekahastapramāṇena kuṇḍaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
mekhalātrayasaṃyuktaṃ khānahastapramāṇakam ||

kṛtrimāttoraṇe kāle mūle puṣpādibhiḥ kramāt |
dhvajāsīṣu nyaset paścāt pītaraktaṃ tathāsitam ||

haritaḥ śyāmavarṇañca śikhaṇḍaharameva ca |
dhūmābhaṃ pāvakābhañca pūrvādīśāntameva ca ||

caturhastañca sarvāpi triyasti dvayavistṛtā |
pārśve kadali kopeta dagre tu vidhā kṛtā ||

dhvajānāmadhidevaśca pūrvādīśāntameva ca |
(************) pravakṣyāmi pitāmaha ||

paścādvau vārikāṃ nyaset (************) |
āgneyāṃ vakritānanāṃ carcikāṃ dakṣiṇe nyaset ||

nair(-)ṛtyāṃ piṃgale nyasya vāruṇyāṃ vinyaset budhaḥ |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ pratiṣṭhā vidhirnāma 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśatpaṭalaḥ] || 48 ||


athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi allikā lakṣaṇaṃ śubham |
sarvalokahitārthāya sarvadoṣa priyāya ca ||

<p. 184>

purāmañjīradehātmā aṃkāro jāta eva hi |
yātu allisamudbhūtā tatsaṃyogena allikā ||

vedena saṃyutaṃ paścāt aṃkāra iti kīrtitaḥ |
dārupramāṇavalayañcarma bandhādhidaivatam ||

pāṭhyamānaṃ samutpatti vada me parameśvara |

īśvara uvāca ||

sabhāyā lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu tvaṃ nandikeśvara |
candanāragvadha (************) pakam ||

anantajīvaśaminimbakhadirāpanasārjunau |
āraṇyavṛkṣau ca (************) kā ||

kanakaṃ rajataṃ tāmraṃ kāṃsyañca kanakadvayam |
niva (*) ragudhayugakhadiraścottamā smṛtā ||

samasāraśamyāni hiraṇmayanidragamau |
panasāntajīvaya ālāmadhyamā kathitā ||

ime mṛt caṃpakārjuna pallaścādhamāssaṃprakīrtitāḥ |
antassārā api pare kanyāyāḥ kathitāḥ drumāḥ ||

ekabhūmi sthitaṃ vṛkṣaṃ naranya dārusaṃyutam |
samasthalasamudbhūtaṃ caṃtudūgvāyu saṃhṛtam ||

ūrdhvavṛttaṃ manoharaṃ grāhaṣayo vādyavṛkṣakāḥ |
anyadoṣayutaṃ vṛkṣaṃ varjayet tu prayatnataḥ ||

<p. 185>

lakṣaṇopayutaṃ vṛkṣaṃ kañciddoṣavivarjitam |
grāhayet sarvayatnena balindatvā viśeṣataḥ ||

samyak kṛṣṇakṛtasyāsya tato mānaṃ prakalpayet |
karturaṃgulimānena pramāṇaṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

kaniṣṭhāyaśca tarjanyo agrarekhā tu ye yadā |
samassatraṃ bhavet tat tu caturaṃgulamucyate ||

yatra dūtaṃ mamānaṃ syāt vādyanirmāṇa karmaṇi |
kaniṣṭhāyāśca tarjanyā agraprānte samaṃ yadā ||

caturaṃgulamākhyātaṃ tanmānaṃ madhyamaṃ viduḥ |
kaniṣṭhāyāśca tarjanyā madhyarekhāśca ye yadā ||

caturaṃgulasūtraṃ yat tanmānañca yamaṃ viduḥ |
pañcatriṃśat samārabhya yāvat pañcādaśāṃgulam ||

tāvadādhamamānaṃ syāduttamādhamamadhyamaiḥ |
saptatriṃśennavati triṃśat pañcāśacca dvihīnakam ||

uttamā yāmamānaṃ syāt adhamaṃ madhyamucyate |
ekonatrinapañcāśaccatuḥpañcavihīnakam ||

catvāriṃśad dvicatvāṣṭatriṃśacca madhyamam |
aṣṭāṃgulīnāmārāṃ satvayamassanigāhiḥ ||

vistāramānanti vimuktayādhamamadhyamaiḥ |
pañcapañcāśadārabhya yāvat saptatiraṃguliḥ ||

<p. 186>

tāvadvistāramānaṃ syāt uttamādhamamadhyamaiḥ |
ekona saptatyatra pañcanūna saptaṣaṣṭhikam ||

triyūnaṣāṣṭṛkañcaiva pañcapañcāśaduttamam |
ekaṃ ṣaṣṭitriṣaṣṭiśca saptaṣaṣṭiśca madhyamam ||

paṃ śṛṃga kuḍyaṃ pauruktam |
anyadalinistāramadhamaṃ kanyagarhitam ||

ekonaviṃśadārabhya pañcapañcaśatovadhi |
mukhavistāramānaṃ syādoṣṭhāścāṃguṣṭhamānakaḥ ||

āyavyayonitāra vārāṃśatiya yat kramāt |
yathā homañca kartavyaṃ makṣikādi prabhedakaḥ ||

dvibhāgaśakra ca sthūlaṃ madhyakośātakopamam |
ekavarṇe bahuguṇo bahuvarṇo mṛti pradaḥ ||

kvacit kvacit pradakṣiṇaṃ kabarhāt sthānanāśanam |
evaṃ lakṣaṇahīnantu doṣa dṛṣṭavivarjayet ||

guṇayuktaṃ samādāya śilpakāraṃ vivarjayet |
kuṇḍadravyaṃ samādāya kāṃsyāntaṃ mṛṇamayopi vā ||

aṃguṣṭhākāramātreṇa kuṇḍaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyutam |
caturaṃgulavistāramadhikaṃ vartamānataḥ ||

rajjubhissamyagāveṣṭya maṇibandha pramāṇakam |
evaṃ dakṣiṇa kuṇḍaṃ syāt vāmakuṇḍavidhiṃ śṛṇu ||

<p. 187>

yāvacchṛṃgamayaiḥ kāṣṭhaiḥ kuṇḍaṃ kuryāt tribhedakam |
tryaṃgulādhikaṃ vaktrāt kuṇḍaślakṣṇī kṛtaṃ śubham |

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ a(?)llikālakṣaṇavidhirnāma 
ekonapañcāśatpaṭalaḥ] || 49 ||


nāgapāśavidhiṃ vakṣye kartavyaṃ dhātubhiḥ kramāt |
tryaṃgulamākṛṣya tadākāreṇa bandhayet ||

śaṃkusaptakamābadhya paṭṭe tryaṃgulamānakam |
dhūpikā nāmikaṃ divyā tasyārdhaṃ kukṣivṛttakam ||

adhastādardhasuṣiraṃ śaṃkukāvedhanaṃ dṛḍham |
gocarma dvividhaṃ proktaṃ bāhyābhyantaramaṃjulam ||

darpaṇodarasaṃkāśaṃ sarvadoṣavivarjitam |
kīlañca dvividhaṃ proktamupakīlañca kīlakam ||

vistṛtadvaya hastoromācārya nirmitam |
kīlakasyāṣṭadīrghaṃ syāt aṃguṣṭhodaramānakam ||

rūpasaṃkośa kārye tu kīlasyādīmapo bhavet |
upakīlasyāṣṭabhāgaṃ ca dvāpatraya samākulam ||

mṛdunā carmaṇāveṣṭya vāmakuṇḍamatho dṛḍham |
valaye suṣiraṃ kuryāt dvayaṃ vā trayameva vā ||

jīvāya jīvamānaṃ syāt ardhajīvī bhayaṃ tathā |
viparītabhayā caiva ṣaṭbhedāḥ kartari kramāt ||

<p. 188>

viparītabhayā caiva ṣaṭbhedāḥ kartari kramāt |
kartaripāri (*) caiva kartarī cālikādvayam ||

rekhantu cānu jīvā ca baddhahastānuvāganu |
anupāliśca pañcaite balakāñcālajīvakam ||

alakādvālistathā caiva malakālakālakaiśca tu |
rekhāmiśraṃ pañcamukhaṃ anupodantabandhanam ||

kartarijīvā ca antyādiśca mānakam |
mānañcālapamānāni dvādaśārtha prabhedakaḥ ||

rekhādimānaparyanta dvādaśālāpacālikāḥ |
bandhamuktamatiproktaṃ mālatī bhedakadvayam ||

rekhātaratālānāṃ pāraṇācālikātrayam |
cākā ca dvidhā proktā bāhyātāla pradarśayo ||

kapitthamekaṃ tatra syāt tālavācyā tataḥ param |
bhedā vācyaṃ stokavācyaṃ bahavācyamataḥ param ||

ekavācyaṃ kākavācyaṃ haṃsavācyaṃ tathaiva ca |
vaco vādyañca vidvadbhirityaṣṭau saṃprakīrtitam ||

vyūhamekaṃ parvatatvaṃ tathā caikamudāhṛtam |
caturviṃśati saṃyuktaṃ śataṃ saṃkhya prakīrtitāḥ ||

sarvatāla prayogeṣu takārastu padaṃ prati |
prathame niyame teṣāṃ majīvya niyamo bhavet ||

<p. 189>

gopuraśca niyamo paścāt sroto mṛnniyamastathā |
gatipūrvaśca niyamaste vaṃśavaguṇastathā ||

dīrghavagṇikāpi syāt antaro niyamaḥ paraḥ |
satāla niyamopi syāt antarīvasuhastakāḥ ||

pañcasthālī mahīṣa syāt calī ca bahucālikā |
hastaprakṣepaṇaṃ paścāt tathaivatyakathāpi ca ||

karmā vā vartakānāntu vakṣyāmi daśasaṃjñitam |
ekadvitricatuṣpañcaṣaṭsaptāṣṭa navodaśa ||

prāgekā vartanaṃ proktaṃ dvitīyāvartanaṃ tathā |
tṛtīyāvartanañcaiva caturthā vartakaṃ tathā ||

pañcamāvartanañcaiva ṣaṣṭhāvartantathaiva ca |
saptamāvartakañcaiva aṣṭamāvartakaṃ tathā ||

[iti brahmayāmale śatasahasrasaṃhitāyāṃ nāgapāśavidhirnāma 
pañcāśatpaṭalaḥ] || 50 ||


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi āśaucasyavidhikramam |
varṇajātividhiñcaiva anulomavidhiṃ kramāt ||

sūtakapretakañcaiva āśaucañca krameṇa vā |
(brāhmaṇācchūdrakanyāyā jātoṣaṣṭha ucyate ||)

brahmacārī jaṭādhārī sanyāsī śauca varjitaḥ |
vānaprasthaśca bauddhaśca āśaucasya vivarjitaḥ ||

<p. 190>

brāhmaṇānāṃ daśāhañca kṣatrayaṃ dvādaśaṃ bhavet |
vaiśyānāṃ ṣoḍaśañcaiva śūdrāṇāṃ triṃśatistathā ||

anulomajātānāntu āśauca vidhiṃ śṛṇu |
viprasya nṛpakanyāyāṃ jāto savarṇanāmakaḥ ||

ekādaśāhamāśaucaṃ dvijavatkarmamācaret |
viprasya vaiśyakanyāyāṃ jātoṃṣaṣṭha ucyate ||

upavīta samantrajña dvijavatkarmamācaret |
sūtakapretakañcaiva āśaucaṃ dvādaśakramāt ||

brāhmaṇācchūdrakanyāyāṃ jātaḥ pāraśavaḥ smṛtaḥ |
niṣekādivivāhānta dvijavatkarma mācaret ||

sūtakapretakañcaiva āśaucaṃ ṣoḍaśakramāt |
kṣatriyādviprakanyāyāṃ jāto vai sūta ucyate ||

sūtakapretakañcaiva dvādaśañca bhavet kramāt |
brāhmaṇādvaiśyakanyāyāṃ cauyādvai kumbhakārakaḥ ||

sūtaka pretakañcaiva ṣoḍaśantu bhavet kramāt |
anuloma kramañcaiva karmajāti kramaṃ śṛṇu ||

rudrasya gaṇikāścaivamāśaucañca ṣoḍaśa |
tapasvī devadāsīnāṃ pakṣāśaucaṃ vidhīyate ||

anyathā nṛttavādyañca daśapañca krameṇa tu |
viṣṇudāsī dāsakānāṃ daśapañca krameṇa vai ||

<p. 191>

liṃgārcana śivabhaktānāṃ āśaucaṃ pakṣamācaret |
mātṛvargamāśaucaṃ pitṛvargañca varjayet ||

taddāsī jananāssarve veśyāputro vivarjayet |
sūtakāśauca madhye tu mṛtaścetsūtakāntakam ||

mṛtāśauca madhye tu jātakaṃ pūrṇamācaret |
ādantajanmanassaya ācaulānte śikhismṛtaḥ ||

trirātramāvṛtādeśād daśarātramataḥ param |
trivarṣādudakaṃ piṇḍaṃ śrāddhāntaṃ pañcamātparam ||

aṣṭadārthakalaṃ grāhyaṃ sapiṇḍāntamataḥ param |
bhāryā tu garbhiṇī caiva garbhanyāsaṃ vivarjayet ||

dvibhāryā garbhiṇī caiva ekabhāryā prasūtikā |
vapanaṃ naivakurvīta nāmakarma ca kārayet ||

mātāpitṛmṛte prāpte kṣauraṃ kurvanvinaśyati |
kṛtvā caulopakurvīnāt udakapiṇḍameva ca ||

gurvācāryapatnīnāṃ garbhavānapi vāpayet |
pitṛdīkṣā ca kurvīran jātikṣauraṃ na kārayet ||

mātāpitrostu dīkṣāyāṃ śubhāśubha vivarjitam |
śivānugamanañcaiva vapanaṃ sindhu sevanam ||

antarvatyā patiṃ kurvan prajā bhavati dhruvam |
śāvānnaṃ sūtakānnañca sīmantonnaṃ tathaiva ca ||

<p. 192>

go kṣīre daśavāreṇa bhuktvā cāndrāyaṇaṃ caret |
mātāpitrostu dīkṣāyāṃ madhyame śubhakarmaṇi ||

sapte dīkṣāsamāptaiva śubhakramaṇi kārayet |
bahuputreṇa dīkṣā ca madhyame śubhakarmaṇi ||

prāpte kaniṣṭhaputreṇa dīkṣāpi ca samāpyatā |
śubhakarmeṇa tenaiva kuryādapi viśeṣataḥ ||

mātāpitṛpitṛvyāṇāṃ mātulaiḥ pūrvajairmṛtau |
parācārya (****) nāṃ garbhavānapi vāpayet ||

antavāgdahanaṃ kuryāt keśāśmaśrūṇi vāpayet |
garbhiṇī aṣṭamāsañca garbhavānkarma varjayet ||

garbhitenaiva karmeṇa jātakaṃ madhyameva ca |
prāyaścittañca kartavyaṃ punaḥ karmasamācaret ||

utsave ca pratiṣṭhāyāṃ arcane homa eva ca |
yatkālamadhyame śauce karmāntyeśauca mācaret ||

mātuśca pūrvadīkṣāyāṃ pitṝṇāndahanaṃ bhavet |
pituśca pūrvadīkṣāyāṃ dahanaṃ vapanaṃ kramāt ||

kanyā udakapūrvaśca mṛtyuḥ karmapitā yadi |
kanyādānānmudā caiva bhaktākarmañca kārayet ||

kanyābhaktamataiścaiva rajasāyapidhāya ca |
garbhiṇī garbhānmaraṇe sūtikādaśamaṃgalī ||

sahodaraṃ sakhīputrī mṛtasūte śauca varjayet |
bhartṛvargañca hīnañca sahodarakarmakārayet ||

antye pariśrama pretaṃ ekāhamaṃ śauca mācaret |
sarpabandhañca pāśañca agnidagdhañca khaḍgakam ||

jalaṃ vṛkṣanadī śṛṃgo auṣadhañca prayogaśca |
durmaraṇannavamañcaiva prāyaścitta vidhi kramāt ||

antarātmagaje yaiva paramātmā na yojayet |
nārāyaṇa baliñcaiva brāhmaṇānāṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

grahaśānti vipra bhojana karmañcaiva tatkārayet |
ṣaṣṭhamāse caturmāse athavā ca trimāsake ||

punassaṃskāra karveṇa astisañcaya ||




